<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">- Ndendeule Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Kutumbula</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabo chu Kutumbula</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kitabo chu Kutumbula</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kutu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabo chu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kutumbula</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Lilobhe Genesis yane, “Kutumbula,” na ndi liina lya kitabo chenje cha lilaghano lya Makacho chibhakema. Mukiebulaniya litumbwii na lilobhe, “Kuhumii Makacho.” Kilangii kila kilebhe kipitila bhole na Chapanga chatumbwila kubhehe pahina na bhando. Akachomi bhibhajholwike bha machiko ghanga bhibhawacha changalandana kwa mundo amu bhando bhibhajhandike kitabo chenje Chukutumbula na kipinde ghane kikajhandikwe. Bhabhii bhibhahambuka kubhehe kitabo chenje kubhoke mu majhahandiko gha makacho mu kipinde cha panakate jha kalune jhu nhwano amu jha chita nukubhelukwa jhe Yecho Kilichitu. Bhange bhijheketela kibhehe mapokelo panakate jha bhando bhibhajholwike kubhehe Mucha ndi jwajhandike kitabo chenje na helahela akajhandike itabo henge ya Kubhoka na kitabo cha ilebhe ya Akalabhe na kitabo cha Kibhalango na kitabo cha Ukombokelo gwa Tolate pakate jha yaka 1300 na 1400 nu kubhelukwa jhe Yecho Kilichitu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabo Chukutumbula kijholwike malobhe ghambone hake ghighatangatila bhando bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu kuimanya Bibuliya jhoha, kuhumii lilaghano lya makacho na lilaghano liyono. Kitabo chenje kilangii uhakaho chiujhingila pannema, na bhando bhoha chibhaghanita Ughombokeko. Helahela kitabo chenje kitulangii hotuhotu mpangu gwa Chapanga gwa kwaghombola bhando. Lyenio libhonekana kubhoke pala mulondole ghukutumbula kwa nhwalo jha Yecho. Kutumbula 3:15, na malaghano gha Chapanga kwa Ulaamo ghakumpe mota pannema, Kutumbula 12:3.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghughabhii mukitabo</para>
  <para style="io">Mu chula jha 1 ade 2, kitabo kichimulila kubhehe Chapanga chapangina nnema na helahela ngampangina Adamo na Hawa.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu chula jha 3 ade 5, kitabo kichimulila Adamo na Hawa uhakaho gwabhe na ibheluko yabhe.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu chula jha 6 ade 9, kitabo kichimulila panane jha Nuho na maheluko gha mache twe.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu chula jha 10 ade 11, pughapetita gheniya, kitabo chenje kichimulila chikipitila machiko gha Nuho na chela cha Ulaamo pamonga na malobhe gha nnala gwa Babele.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu chula jha 12 ade 50, kitabo kichimulila malobhe gha Ulaamo na lukolo lwake na ndi lihembuko lya kilambo chuku Ichilahele.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu chula jha 12 ade 25, kitabo kichimulila utamo gwa Ulaamo nuhwana mundo Sala pannema.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu chula jha 21 ade 28, kitabo kichimulila utamo gwa Ichaka nuhwana mundo Lebeka pannema nu kujhomwoka kwake, mu chula jha 35.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu chula jha 25 ade 50, kitabo kichimulila utamo gwa Yakobu nuhwana mundo.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu chula jha 37 ade 50, kitabo kichimulila mambu gha Uchupo, mwana jwa pamwojho jwa Yakobu na chahikita kubhehe kilongoche jwaku Michile.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s">Kupanganwa kwa nnema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />Peniya, pukutumbula, Chapanga ngapangina kunane kwa Chapanga na nnema. <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Nnema ukibha ubhonikina jhe ngita chiubhonekana ngohe na ukibha gwa hele na lubhendo lukibha luyekilii panane jha ilendela ya mache. Na Uhuke gwa Chapanga ngajhobhatila panane jha mache. <verse eid="GEN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Chapanga palongila, “Lubhehe lumule,” na lumule ngalupitila. <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Chapanga ngalubhonita lumule lwambone, peniya, ngabhaghanicha lumule na lubhendo. <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />Chapanga lumule ngakemita, “Muhe,” na lubhendo ngakemita, “Kilo.” Ngaibhila kimiye ngaibhila, lukela lichiko lyukutumbula.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />Peniya, Chapanga palongila, “Ibhehe pwache ibhaghanicha mache gha pahe na gha kunane.” <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />Yene, Chapanga ngateila jhenio pwache ibhaghanicha mache gha kunane na kubhaghanicha mache gha pahe, ngaibhila yene. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Chapanga ngalikemita kunane kwenio, “Kuhanga.” Na ngaibhila kimiye na ngaibhila muhe, lichiko lyuubhele.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Chapanga ngalongila, “Mache ghighabhii pannema ghakongane pamonga, na kilambo kijhomo ngakipitila.” Ngaibhila yene. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Chapanga chehemo jhenio ngakemita, “Kilambo kijhomo.” Na mache ghighakongine pamonga ghala ngakemita, “Mbwane.” Chapanga ngalola kubhehe kuhalala. <verse eid="GEN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Bhahe, Chapanga ngalongila, kilambo chenio kimeleka mimeya. “Mikongo jhipambika uhohe hina mbejho.” Ngaibhila yene. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Peniya, kilambo chenio ngakimelita mimeya jhipambika mbejho kwa namuna jhake na mikongo jhipambika uhohe kwa namuna jhake. Chapanga ngaibhonita yene kubhehe kuhalala. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Bhahe, ngaibhila kimiye, ngaibhila lukela lichiko lyuutato.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Chapanga palongila, “Pabhaha lulanga kunane lubhaghanicha muhe na kilo, ilangiye ipinde na machiko na yaka, <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />mule yenio ilangala kunane na kumulikila nnema.” Ngaibhila yene. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Bhahe, Chapanga ngapangina mule ngolongwa ibhele, lukolongwa yane lyobha ling'anyima muhe na luchokombe yane mwehe lung'anyima kilo, hele ngapangina ndondwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Chapanga ngaibhekita mule yene kululanga imulikila nnema, <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />kupala ing'anyima muhe na kilo, nakubhaghanicha lumule na lubhendo. Chapanga ngabhonita kubhehe kuhalala. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Ngaibhila kimiye, ngaibhila lukela lichiko lya ncheche.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Chapanga ngalongila, “Umache itwelela ihumbe ghome ndii yangalandana na ijhune imbuluka kunane.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Bhahe, Chapanga ngapangina ihumbe ikoloikolo hake na yoha itama umbwane na ngapangina ijhune ya namuna jhoha. Chapanga ngabhonita kubhehe kuhalala. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Chapanga ngaipila mota ihumbe yoha palongila, “Ihumbe yoha umbwane ibhelekana na kubhehe ndii, na ijhune ijhonjekeka pannema.” <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Ngaibhila kimiye, ngaibhila lukela lichiko lya nhwano.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Chapanga palongila, “Pannema pabhehe na ihumbe ghome ya kila namuna, yane inyama ya kukoleka, ikwabha na inyama yukumanyahe.” Ngaibhila yene. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Yene, Chapanga ngapangina inyama ya kila namuna ya kumanyahe, inyama ikolekwa na ikwabha yoha. Chapanga ngalola kubhehe kuhalala.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Peniya, Chapanga ngalongila, “Ngohe tumombe mundo alandane na twenga na abhehe anda twenga, bhakalongoche homba yukumbwane na ijhune yukunane na inyama yukukolekwa yoha na ihumbe yoha ikwabha pannema.” <verse eid="GEN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Bhahe, Chapanga ngapangina mundo jhukulandana najwene, na kukulandana na Chapanga ngapangina munalome na mwikeghe. <verse eid="GEN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />Chapanga ngabhapila mota nu kulonge, “Mmelekane mukajhonjekeke na kubhehe ndii mukautweleya nnema nu kuilongocha homba yumbwane na ijhune yukunane na kila kihumbe chikibhii ghome pannema.” <verse eid="GEN 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Peniya, Chapanga ngalongila, “Jhokanikiya, nimpela kila mmeya ghupambika uhohe hina mbejho pannema na kila nkongo ghupambika uhohe hina mbejho yake kibhaha chakulya chino. <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />Nambo inyama yoha pannema na ijhune yukunane na ilebhe yoha ikwabha yane kila kihumbe ghome chakulya chabhe nakibhaha mahamba ghoha gha mimeya.” Ngaibhila yene. <verse eid="GEN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Chapanga ngakilolita kila kilebhe chakipangine kubhehe kihalanao hake ngaibhila kimiye, ngaibhila lukela, lichiko lya chita.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Yene, ndi Chapanga chapangina kunane kwa Chapanga na nnema pamonga na ilebhe yoha ibhii mwenio. <verse eid="GEN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />Lichiko lya chaba Chapanga akibha ajhomolile lihengo lyoha lya kupangana, mulichiko lyene lya chaba Chapanga ngapomolila pajhomolila lihengo lyake lya kupangana. <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Chapanga ngalipila mota lichiko lya chaba na kuitenda lichiko lya kanjika kwa nhwalo gwake, nhwalo kwa lichiko lyene Chapanga ngapomolila pajhomolila lihengo lyake lyoha lya kupangana. <verse eid="GEN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Yene, ndi chipanginwa kunane kwa Chapanga na nnema.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="GEN 2:4">Kijhongo cha Edene</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Machiko ghena Bhambo Chapanga ndi papangina nnema na kunane kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />Pakibha jhe na mmeya mu kilambo hilu mikongo jhiipwike nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga akalekiki jhe hula ikome na hele akibha jhe mundo jhukulema. <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />Mu machiko gheniya, ubhehe ghuhumila pahe ngautepatiya undope.<verse eid="GEN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga ngampangina mundo kwa mandope, ngampulichila umbulo uhuke gwa ughome, mundo jwenio ngabhila ghome.<verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngalenganikiya kijhongo chenio ku Edene upande ghuhumii lyobha, mwenio ngamekita mundo jwenio jwampangina. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" />Bhambo Chapanga ngamelicha mikongo jha kila namuna mihalanao hake jhipambika uhohe ghighapalwa kulyegwa. Panakate jha kijhongo chenio cha Edene pakibha na nkongo ghupambika uhohe ghuleta ghome na nkongo ghugwantenda bhando bhamanye ghanganandela na ghambone.<verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Kwenio ku Edene lukibha lukemba lulukokwila mache na kujhitilila kijhongo cha ku Edene, kubhoke peniya lukemba lwenio ngalubhaghanika ngemba ncheche. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Lukemba lukutumbula lukemitwa Pishoni, lwenio lutindii mu kilambo choha cha Hawila, kwenio kukibha na chaabo. <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />Chaabo jha kilambo chenio jhamaha hake. Kwenio hele ghabhii mahuta ghighanungulila njii, ghighakemwa bedola na maghanga gha bei ngolonga ghighakemwa chohamu. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Liina lya lukemba lubhele lukemwa Gihone, lwenio lutindii mu kilambo choha cha Kuchi. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Lukemba lwa utato lukemwa Tigiliche, lukemba lwenio lukokolocha mache ghake upande ghulihumii lyobha mu kilambo chuku Achulu. Na lukemba lwa ncheche Efulate.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />Bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga ngantola mundo jwenio na kummeka mukijhongo cha ku Edene aleme na kuijhemelela. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />Bhambo Chapanga panaghila mundo jwenio, “Mihoto kulyegha uhohe gwa nkongo ghoghoha ghubhii mukijhongo, <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />nambo mangalyegha uhohe gwa nkongo ghuntenda mundo amanye ghanganandela na ghambone, mana lichiko limpala kulye uhohe gwa nkongo gwenio, chakaka miwegha.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Bhambo Chapanga palongila, “Kuala jhe munalome kubhehe jhika ndo, yene mbakumpangana nnyake jwa kuntangatila jwalanda nako.” <verse eid="GEN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga, akapangine inyama yoha ya kumanyahe na kila kijhune cha kunane, peniya ngampelikila mundo jwenio alole abhapeke maina ghake, na maina ghabhakemita jwenio ghajhakubhehe ndi mahina ghabhe. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Yene, mundo jwenio ngatinita maina gha inyama yoha ikolekwa na inyama yoha yukumanyahe na ijhune ikunane nambo akibha jhe jhukuntangatila jwamaha.<verse eid="GEN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Bhambo Chapanga nganteila aghochele lughono lyoo mundo jwenio, na pakibha mulugholo, Chapanga ngatoila lubhao lumo na lubhao lwenio ngayekilila kwa nyama. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngampangina mwikeghe kubhoka mulubhao lwenio lwatoila kwa munalome jhola, jwenio Chapanga ngampelika mwikeghe kwa munalome jwenio. <verse eid="GEN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Munalome jwenio ngalongila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">“Ka! Ngohe jhonjo kiupa kubhoke miupa yango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">na nyama kubhoke munyama yango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">jwenio nakemwa, ‘Mwikeghe,’ nhwalo ahumii kwa munalome.”<verse eid="GEN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Ndi mana munalome nabhaleka majhe na tate mundo na kulombana na nhwanamundo, na bhabhele bhena bhabhehe yegha jhimo.<verse eid="GEN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Munalome na mwikeghe, bhoha bhabhele bhakibha makengele, nambo bhakibha jhe na hone.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s">Bhando bhinng'alambuka Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Lijhoka likibha likalamwike hake kuipeta inyama yoha yukumanyahe ipanginwe na Chapanga. Ngilinongolila mwikeghe, “Bho, chakaka Chapanga anongilii mangalyengana jhe uhohe gwa nkongo ghoghoha kubhoka mukijhongo?”<verse eid="GEN 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Mwikeghe palijhangwila lijhoka lela, “Tuhoto kulyegha uhohe gwa nkongo ghoghoha ghubhii mukijhongo, <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />nambo Chapanga atulobholile, ‘Twangalye jhe uhohe gwa nkongo ghubhii panakate jha kijhongo hilu kukamula, anda tutei yene natutenda kuwegha.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Lijhoka ngannobholila mwikeghe jhola, “Chakaka miwe ng'o. <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />Chapanga ilonge yene nhwalo akamanye kubhehe anda nnile uhohe gwa nkongo gwenio miho ghino naghayekulilwa na mangotamwe namma ngita Chapanga naumanyangana ghambone na ghanganandela.”<verse eid="GEN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Mwikeghe jhola palolikiya uhohe gwa nkongo gwenio unoghii kwa kulyegha na ihalalii pamiho, ngaholila kubhehe yambone kubhehe na malango. Yene ngatongwila uhohe ngalila na ngampila ungana mundo na jwenio hele ngalila. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Papa miho ghabhe pighayekuka, ndi pibhamanyita kubhehe bhabhii makengele, ku yene pibhalokita mahamba gha nkongo ghukemwa ntine nu kuwala.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Pikiika kimiye, ngabhajhohina nhindo gwa Bhambo Chapanga akatyanga mu kijhongo, peniya mundo jwenio na nhwanamundo ngabhajhobhita mu mikongo. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Nambo Bhambo Chapanga ngankemita munalome jwenio, “Adamo mmii koo?”<verse eid="GEN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Jwenio pajhangwila, “Nyoina luindo ntyangita mukijhongo ndeila kujhoghopa nganyobhita, nhwalo mii makengele.”<verse eid="GEN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Bhambo Chapanga pankonyita, “Mwe, ghane jwannobholile mmii makengele? Amu nnile uhohe ghuninkanikiya nkoto kulye ghola?”<verse eid="GEN 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Munalome jwenio pajhangwila, “Mwikeghe jhumbila abhehe pamonga na nenga ngambekiya uhohe gwa nkongo gwenio na nenga nganila.”<verse eid="GEN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />Pena, Bhambo Chapanga ngankonyita mwikeghe jwenio, “Mwe, nhwalo gwa nike ntei yene?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 3:13">Mwikeghe pajhangwila, “Lijhoka lindehi kungolowa na nenga nganila.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chapanga ihadabula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila lijhoka, “Ninnapii kupeta inyama yoha yukukoleka na kuliku na inyama yoha yukumanyahe, natyangila lutumbo lwino na kulye lutukunda kwa machiko ghoha gha ughome gwino. <verse eid="GEN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />Nameka ulikoko panakate jhino na mwikeghe na panakate jha kibheleko chino choha na machiko ghoha mmangana mulikoko. Kubhoka mu kibheluko cha jwenio jhumo nakintimba muto gwino na mwenga namihonyola ihinginilo yabhe.”<verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila mwikeghe, “Naninyonjekeya lipyanda lya kupapa na kwa lipyanda nampapa yana. Hele nankola wiho kwa unganagwino na jwenio unganagwino nanongocha.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Kubhoke peniya ngannobholila Adamo, “Ngohe, nhwalo munyokanikii nhwana gwino nganila uhohe gwa nkongo ghunikanikiya kubhehe mangalye jhe, ku yene, kwa kulemwa gwangajhoha gwino undope ulapanikilwe. Kwa kuhenga lihengo linonopo nampata chakulyegha, machiko ghoha mughome gwino. <verse eid="GEN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Lundope nalumpapila mibha na michongoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:18">na mwenga milya mahamba gha kung'onda. <verse eid="GEN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Kwa kuhenga lihengo linonopo mipata chakulya, ade pumpala kubhujha mulundope nhwalo mwe nimpangina kwa mandope na namujha mu mandope.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Adamo ngampila nhwana mundo liina lyake “Hawa,” nhwalo akibha majhe jwa bhando bhoha. <verse eid="GEN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />Bhambo Chapanga ngabhatengenichila Adamo na nhwana mundo ngobho ya limbendela na nganhwalicha<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adamo na Hawa bhitenda kubhengwa pakijhongo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngalongila, “Ngohe, mundo jhonjo bhabhii anda twenga, amanye ghamaha na ghanganandela. Ipalwa kunkanikiya angalye jhe uhohe gwa nkongo gwa ughome, nhwalo anda alile natama machiko ghoha ghangapeta.” <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga ngammengita Adamo abhoke pa Edene na ajhende akaleme mulundope kwahembukile. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Pajhomolila kubhengwa Adamo, Bhambo Chapanga ngabhekita nnonda jhuna upanga gwa mwotu ghuutema kone na kone upande ghulihumii lyobha gwa kijhongo chenio cha Edene ailonde ndela jhijhenda kunkongo gwa ughome.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s">Kaine na Abele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Bhahe, Adamo ngagholwika na nhwanamundo Hawa, jwenio ngabhila na ndumbo, ngampapita mwana Kaine. Hawa palongila, “Mbapite mwana munalome kukujhangatilwa na Chapanga.” <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Kubhoke peniya, ngapapita mwana jhonge munalome unnung'una mundo jwakemitwa Abele. Abele akibha nkoleka inyama nambo Kaine ateila kulema. <verse eid="GEN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Pughapetita ghena, Kaine ngampikiya Bhambo Chapanga chadaka kuhumii mu mahuno ghake gha mung'onda, <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />na jwenie Abele hele ngampiikiya Chapanga jhumo jha mambelele ghake kubhoke mwibheluko yukutumbula na ngampiikiya Chapanga chehemo jha nyama jhihatite. Bhambo Chapanga nganyekitila Abele na litambiko lyake, <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />nambo kwa Kaine akanyekiti jhe hilu litambiko lyake. Ku yene Kaine ajhakubhehe na lilaka hake na kumiho kwake kujhakutwele ngenja. <verse eid="GEN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Bhambo Chapanga pankonyita Kaine, “Bho, nhwalo ghane mmii na lilaka na nhwalo ghane kumiho jhino kutwelii ngenja?” <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Bho, anda ntei ghambone mihambuka nanyeketelwa jhe? Anda ntei ghanganandela, bhahe, uhakaho ubhii panyango ipala, intenda kunnyobhela, nambo mipalwa kughahotola.<verse eid="GEN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Bhahe, Kaine ngannobholela unung'unamundo, “Tijha ku nng'onda,” pibhakibha kwenio kunng'onda, Kaine ngankomita unung'unamundo.<verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Bhambo Chapanga pankonyita Kaine, “Unung'una gwino Abele abhiikoo? Kaine pajhangwila,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:9">“Ne manyii jhe, Bho, ne nalonda jwa unung'una gwango?”<verse eid="GEN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />Bhambo palongila, “Mwe mukitei nike? Myahe jhu unung'una gwino inelela kuhumii muundope.” <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Ngohe mwenga nnapanikilwe! Na kubhengwa kubhoka muundope ghola ghujhongite myahe jha unnung'una gwino Abele jhumukomite. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Pipala kulema lundope lwenio nanyambulila jhe mahuno ghoghoha. Chakaka namme ng'o nakitamo pannema, namma kutyanga tyanga.<verse eid="GEN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Kaine pannobholila Bhambo Chapanga, “Luhadabulo lwango luchochite hake, nihote jhe kuhimbilila. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Deleno umengite kuhumii mulundope lulubholile, na kubhehe kutale na mwenga. Bhahe, nama namundo jwakutyanga tyanga pannema, kila mundo jwangonganako nangoma.”<verse eid="GEN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Nambo Bhambo Chapanga panyangwila, “Nahi jhe, mundo jhojhoha jwapala kunkoma mwe ma Kaine umanya mundo jwenio naninepechela mala chaba.” Bhahe, Bhambo ngamekita huna Kaine kupala mundo jhojhoha jwammona angankoma jhe. <verse eid="GEN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Peniya, Kaine ngabhokita palonge jha Chapanga ngajhenda kutama ku kilambo cha Node, kilambo cha Node mana jhake kutyangatyanga kwa upande ghulihumii lyobha mwa Edene.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibheluko ya Kaine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Pighapetita ghena, Kaine ngagholwika nuhwana mundo na jwenio ngabhila na ndumbo ngapapita mwana munalome, ngampila liina lyake Enoke. Kaine ngatumbwila kuchenga muche ngaukemita kwa liina lya mwana mundo Enoke. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Enoke ngampapita Ilade na Ilade ngampapita Meyuyaele na Meyuyaele ngampapita Mituchele na Mitushele ngampapita Lameke. <verse eid="GEN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Lameke ngatolila matala, jhukutumbula akemitwa Ada na jhonge akamitwa Sila. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Ada ngapapita mwana liina lyake akemitwa Yabali, jwenio akibha hokolo jwa bhoha bhibhakololeka inyama na bhibhatama mu ichimba. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Na jwenio unung'una jwa Yabale akemitwa Yubali, jwenio akibha hokolo jwa bhoha bhabhijhemba malimba na itolilo. <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Sila hele ngapapita mwana akemitwa liina lyake Tubale Kaine, jwenio akibha punde kipala jwa yombo yoha ya chaba na choma. Na nnombo mundo Tubale Kaine akemitwa Naama.<verse eid="GEN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Lameke ngabhalobholila akaanamundo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">“Mwe, Ada na Sila unyokanikiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">unyokanikiya ngilonge mangota akaana bha Lameke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">ninkomite mundo nhwalo andei kungochola, hena</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">nganinkomita kangombo nhwalo andei kungochola.<verse eid="GEN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />Anda Kaine nalepechelwa mala chaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:24">chakaka Lameke nalepechelwa mala chabine na chaba.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sete na Enoshe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Adamo ngagholwika kabhele na nhwanamundo Hawa, na ngapapita mwana munalome ngakemita liina lyake Sete mana ghake alongila, “Chapanga ambekii jhonge mwana chehemo jha Abele, jwakomitwe na Kaine.” <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Sete ngapapita mwana munalome ngakemita liina lyake Enoshe. Pena ndi pibhatumbwila bhando kunnyinamila Chapanga.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s">Ibheluko ya Adamo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:1-4">1 Ngongu 1:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Ghanga ndi maina gha ibheluko ya Adamo. Kipinde chela Chapanga papangina mundo, akampangine kukulandana jwenio. <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />Ngampangina munalome na mwikeghe, peniya, ngabhapila mota na kwakema liina lyabhe, “Bhando.” <verse eid="GEN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Adamo pakibha na yaka miya moja na chelachine, ngapapita mwana munalome jwalandine nako jwakibha ngita jwenie na ngampila liina lyake Sete. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Kubhoke pala pabhelwika Sete, Adamo ngatamita yaka henge miya nane, ngapapita yana henge inalome na ikeghe. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Yaka yoha yatamita gwa Adamo ikibha miya ticha na chelechine, peniya, ngajhomwika.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Sete pakibha na yaka miya nu nhwano, ngapapita mwana Enoshe. <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Kubhoke pala pakumpapa Enoshe, Sete ngatamita yaka henge miya nane na chaba, ngapapita yana henge inalome na ikeghe. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Yaka yoha yatamita Sete ikibha miya ticha kome na mibhele, peniya, ngajhomwika.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Kipinde Enoshe pakibha na yaka tichine ngampapita mwana munalome ngampila liina lyake Kenane. <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Kubhoke pala mu kumpapa Kenane, Enoshe ngatamita yaka henge miya nane kome nu nhwano ngapapita yana henge inalome na ikeghe. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Enoshe ngatamita yaka miya ticha nu nhwano, peniya, ngajhomwika.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Kenane pakibha na yaka makome chaba, ngapapita mwana munalome liina lyake Mahalalele. <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Kubhoke pala mu kumpapa Mahalalele, Kenane ngatamita yaka henge miya nane na alobaine ngapapita yana henge inalome na ikeghe. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Kenane ngatamita yaka miya ticha na kome, peniya, ngajhomwika.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Kipinde Mahalalele pakibha na yaka makome chita nu hwano, ngapapita mwana munalome liina lyake Yaledi. <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />Kubhoke pala pakubhelukwa Yaledi, Mahalalele ngatamita yaka henge miya nane na makome matato, na ngapapita yana henge inalome na ikeghe. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Mahalalele ngatamita yaka miya nane na makome ticha nu nhwano, peniya, ngajhomwika.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Kipinde Yaledi pakibha na yaka miya jhimo makome chita na mabhele ngapapita mwana munalome liina lyake Henoke. <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />Kubhoke pala mu kumpapa Henoke, Yaledi ngatamita yaka henge miya nane na ngapapita yana henge inalome na ikeghe. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Yaledi ngatamita yaka miya ticha na chita na mibhele, peniya, ngajhomwika.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Kipinde Henoke pakibha na yaka makome chita nu nhwano ngapapita mwana munalome liina lyake Metushela. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Henoke atamita ngita chapalita Chapanga. Kubhoke pala mu kumpapa Metushela, Henoke ngatamita yaka henge miya tato, na ngapapita yana henge inalome na ikeghe. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Henoke ngatamita yaka miya tato makome chita nu nhwano. <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />Henoke atamita kukunhobholela Chapanga peniya akabhonikine jhe kabhele, nhwalo Chapanga akantoile.<verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Metushela pahikicha yaka miya jhimo makome nane na chaba ngapapita mwana munalome liina lyake Lameke. <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />Kubhoke pala pu kumpapa Lameke, Metushela ngatama yaka henge miya chaba makome nane na mabhele na ngapapita yana henge inalome na ikeghe. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Metushela ngatamita yaka henge miya ticha makome chita na ticha, peniya, ngajhomwika.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Lameke pahikicha yaka miya jhimo makome nane na mabhele ngapapita mwana munalome. <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />Mwana jwenio ngampila liina lyake Nuho, akilongila, “Mwana jhonjo jwapakutupepecha miojho mu mahengo manonopo ghituhenga kwa mabhoko ghito muundope gwalapanikii Chapanga.” <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Kubhoke pala mu kumpapa Nuho, Lameke ngatama yaka henge miya nhwano makome ticha nu nhwano, na ngapapita yana henge inalome na ikeghe. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Lameke ngatamita yaka miya chaba makome chaba na chaba, peniya, ngajhomwika.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Nuho pakibha na yaka miya nhwano, ngabhapapita yana maina ghabhe ndi Shemo na Amu na Yafete.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s">Kulemwa kwa bhando</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Kipinde bhando pibhatumbwila kujhonjekeka na kujhenela pannema na kupapa yana ikeghe, <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />pakate jha yana inalome ya Chapanga ngabhalolita kubhehe achikabhale bha bhando kuhalala. Ngabhatoila bheniya na kubhehe akaana bhabhe. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Peniya, Chapanga palongila, “Naleka jhe bhando bhatame machiko ghoha ghangapeta nhwalo bheniya ndi bhando bha kuwe tugha. Kwa yene, bhilama ng'o kupeta yaka miya jhimo na makome mabhele.” <verse eid="GEN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Kwa machiko gheniya na kujhendelela pakibha bhando akakoloakolo hake pannema bhakemitwa Akanefile. Bheniya bhabhelwika na yana ya inalome ya Chapanga na yana ikeghe ibhelwike na bhando. Bhando bheniya ghakibha malome na bhando bhibhamanyikina hake kipinde chene.<verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />Chapanga palolita bhando bhitenda kila namuna jha uhakaho pannema, na palolita kila lyawachii mundo umwojho lyanganandela tugha machiko ghoha, <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />Chapanga ngabhila na ungolongonde hake umwojho gwake kukumpangana mundo pannema, Chapanga ngakokolika hake umwojho gwake. <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />Bhambo Chapanga palongila, “Nanakomelekeya njwe bhando bhumbangine pannema, bhando na inyama yukumanyahe na inyama ikwabha na ijhune yukunane. Mbaha nganiipangine jhe pannema.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Nambo Nuho ngajheketilwa palonge jha Chapanga.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />Ghanga ndi malobhe gha Nuho na kibheluko chake. Nuho akibha mundo jwajheketilwe na jwahobhilika palonge jha Chapanga, jwangakokolekwa na bhando bha kipinde chake. Kabhele atamita kukunhobholela Chapanga. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Nuho akibha na yana itato inalome Shemu na Amu na Yafete. <verse eid="GEN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Chapanga ngaulolita nnema uhangabhike na utwelii ukokotoko twe. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />Chapanga ngalola nnema, kubhehe ihangabhike, nhwalo kila mundo akengamii ndela jhake jhanganandela.<verse eid="GEN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Chapanga ngannobholila Nuho, “Amwii kwakomelekeya bhando bhoha, nhwalo bhutweliye nnema ukokotoko. Chakaka nanakomelekeya bhando bhoha pamonga na nnema. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Yene, ntendekeye limele lino kwa nkongo nnonopaho, mmeka na yumba na nkilimila lame panja na nkate.” <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Ntendekeya naha, “Kutandamala kwake kubha mita miya jhimo na makome matato na ticha na upana gwake ubha mita makome mabhele nu nhwano na kutondobhala kwake kubha mita likome limo nu nhwano. <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Limele lyene libha gholofa itato na jhina nniango paupele. Ntendekeye kipaghalo, peniya nneka pwache jha nucho mita panakate jha dale na kipaghalo. <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Naleta maheluko gha mache twe pannema kupala ku kikoma kila chikibhii ghome pannema na kila chikipanginwe chikipomola nipala kiweghe. <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />Nambo mbala kubheka lilaghano namwenga. Nanyingila mumele mwenga naanabhino na yana hino pamonga na achikabhana bhino. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Na mwenga nnyingiya mumele ihumbe ipanginwe ibheleibhele yankolo na yankambako kupala ibhe ighome pamonga na mwenga. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Nnyingiya ihumbe ibheibhele ghome ijhune ya kunane na kila kinyama na kila chikikwabha pannema, kupala ibhe ighome. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Hele ntola yakulyegha ya kila namuna ilegwa, mitunje nhwalo gwa chakulya chino na yana hino na inyama yenie.” <verse eid="GEN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Nuho ngateila telatela kila kilebhe ngita chanaghalikiya Chapanga.<verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="s">Nnema uyekelelwa na mache twe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />Bhambo ngannobholila Nuho, “Nnyingile mu mele mwenga pamonga na bhando bhapakajha pino bhoha, nhwalo mwenga ndi jhuninyeketile palonge jhango kupeta bhando bhoha bhubhabhii ngohe. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />Nnyingiya inyama ya kila namuna ijheketelwa palonge jha Chapanga, chaba yankambako na chaba yankolo, nambo inyama yangajheketelwa palonge jha Chapanga ntola ibheleibhele yankambako na yankolo ibheleibhele. <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />Hele nnyingiya ijhune ya kunane ya kila namuna, yankambako na yankolo, yankambako ibha chaba na yankolo chaba kupala mwitunje ibhaha ghome pannema. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Kwa mana pighapeta machiko chaba, mbakuleta hula ikoma machiko makome ncheche muhe na kilo, na kila chikibhii ghome chinikipangine pannema nanikikomelekeya njwe.” <verse eid="GEN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Nuho ngateila ghoha telatela ngita chanaghalikiya Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Kipinde nnema puyekulilwa na mache twe, Nuho akibha na yaka miya chita. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Nuho na unaamundo na yana yabhe pamonga achikabhana mundo ngabhajhingila mu mele kujhepa nnema kuyekelelwa na mache twe. <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Na inyama ijheketilwe palonge jha Chapanga na inyama yangajheketelwa palonge jha Chapanga na ijhune yukunane ibheleibhele na ihumbe yoha ikwabha panane jha nnema, <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />ibheleibhele yankambako na yankolo, ngaijhingila mu mele pamonga na Nuho ngita Chapanga chanaghalikiya. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Kubhoke pa machiko chaba, mache twe ngaghayekelila nnema.<verse eid="GEN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Nuho pakibha na yaka miya chita, lichiko lya kome na chaba lya mwehe gwubhele, lichiko yene yembwe yoha ibhii pahe ngaitumbwila kupiya mache, na kubhoka kunane kumahunde ngiikoma kanonoha hula. <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />Hula ngaikomita pannema machiko makome ncheche muhe na kilo. <verse eid="GEN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Lichiko lele hula puitumbwila kukoma Nuho na yana mundo Shemo na Amu na Yafete na akaana bhabhe ngabhajhingila mu mele. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Ngabhajhingila bhene pamonga na kila inyama yukumanyahe na kila inyama ikolekwa na kila inyama ikwabha na ijhune ya kila namuna. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />Ngabhajhingila nkate jha mele pamonga na Nuho, ihumbe ibheleibhele ya kila namuna ibhii ghome. <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />Inyama yenio ngaijhingila ya namuna jha yankolo na yankambako ngita Chapanga chanaghalikiya Nuho, peniya Bhambo ngadindita nnyango mbu.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Bhahe, mache twe ngaghajhendilela kwa machiko makome ncheche. Mache ngaghajhonjikika kubhehe twe na kuijhinula mele na jhenio ngaitumbula kujhebhela. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Mache ngaghajhendelela kujhonjekeka hake pannema na mele ngaijhebhila panane jhake. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Mache gheniya ngaghatwelila hake pannema ade kuimila itombe itandamaho yoha iibhi pannema. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Mache pighahelwika ade itombe itandamaho ngimilwa na kuika mita chaba na nucho. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Ku yene, ihumbe yoha ikibha ghome pannema ngiwila. Ijhune na inyama yukukoleka na inyama yukumanyahe na kila ihumbe ikwabha na bhando bhoha, <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />chakaka, ihumbe yoha ikibha ghome pannema ngiwila. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Chapanga ngakomelikiya yoha inaughome pannema. Bhando na inyama na ihumbe ikwabha na ijhune yukunane. Ngaighala Nuho ndo na bhala bhakibha nako pamonga mumele. <verse eid="GEN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Mache ghakahighalika pa nnema kwa machiko miya jhimo nu nhwano.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s">Mache twe ghijhomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Peniya, Chapanga ngankomboka Nuho na inyama yoha yukumanyahe na yukukoleka ikibha pamonga na jwenio mu mele. Bhahe, Chapanga ngatumita upepo upoghe pannema, mache ngaghatumbwila kupongoka. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Kipinde chenie yembwe ya mache pamonga na madilicha kunane kwa Chapanga ghajhakudindwa. hula ngailekita kukoma, <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />mache ghajhakujhendele kupongoka kachokochoko pannema. Kubhoke pa machiko miya jhimo na makome nu nhwano, mache pughachochite kupongoka hake. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Lichiko lya kome na chaba lya mwehe gwa chaba, mele ngaijhemita pikitombe cha Alalate. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Mache ngaghajhendelela kupongoka kachokochoko, lichiko lyukutumbula lya mwehe gwa kome, ilegheleghe ya itombe ngaibhonekana.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Kubhoke pa machiko makome ncheche, Nuho ngajhogwila lidilicha lyakatengeniche mu mele jhenio, <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />ngalitumita likongolo lipite panja, na jwene likabhujha jhe ngaligholwika okwe na okwe ade pighajhomita mache pannema. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Peniya, Nuho ngatumita ngunda kupala akalole pange mache ghajhomite pannema. <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />Nambo nhwalo mache ghakibha ghamela ghatwelile pannema, bhahe, ngunda jwenio ngabhujhita kwa Nuho mu mele. Na jwenio ngatondobhiya lubhoko lwake ngampukila na kunnyingii mu mele. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Nuho ngalendila machiko ghange chaba, peniya ngantumita kabhele ngunda jwenio. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Kimiye ngunda jwenio ngabhujha kongo agheghite lihamba libhehe lya ncheitune pannomo gwake. Ku yene, Nuho ngamanya kubhehe mache ghapongwike pannema. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Peniya, ngalendila machiko chaba ghange, ngantumita kabhele ngunda jhola, nambo mwanja ghono ngunda ngahobhilila tyoo.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Nuho akibha na yaka miya chita na chaka chimo, lichiko li kutumbula lya mwehe ghukutumbula, mache ghakibha ghajhomite njwe pannema. Nuho ngayekwila kiyekelelo cha mele, palingulila ngabhonita pannema pajhomite. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Lichiko lya makome mabhele na chaba lya mwehe gwa ubhele, kilambo kikibha kijhomite chwaa.<verse eid="GEN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Peniya, Chapanga pannobholila Nuho, <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />“Mpite mwenio umele mwenga pamonga nhwanagwino na yana hino na achikabhana bhino. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Mwipiye ihumbe yoha ibhii ghome ya kila namuna bhubhabhii pamonga na mwenga. Ijhune na inyama na kila ihumbe ikwabha, ibhelekane na kubhehe ndii pannema kila chehemo.” <verse eid="GEN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Peniya, Nuho ngapita mu mele pamonga na nhwanamundo mundo na yana mundo na achikabhana bhake. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Kila kinyama chikikibha mwenio ngakipitita kulandana na aina jhake. Inyama yukumanyahe na inyama ikwabha na ijhune yoha.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuho ampikii Chapanga litambiko lya kukomelekeya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Bhahe, Nuho nganchengila Chapanga kachangwale kanyahinyahi, ngatoila chimochimo panakate jha inyama na ijhune ijheketilwe palonge jha Chapanga kupiya litambiko, ngapiita litambiko lyu kukomelekeya pamwotu panane jha kachangwale. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />Luumba lwambone lwa litambiko lwenio ngulunhanganicha Bhambo Chapanga, ngalongila jwene, “Nnema niulapanikii jhe kabhele kunhwalo gwa itendwa ya bhando, manye kubhehe mundo iwacha mawacho ghanganandela kuhumii umwana gwake, nikomeleke jhe kabhele ihumbe yoha ngita chindeila. <verse eid="GEN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />Ngohe, nnema chiujhendelela kubhegha, napabhaha na kipinde chikupanda na kuhuna chikipupwe na kilangache na kiuko, muhe na kilo naikotoke ng'o.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga abheka lilaghano na Nuho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Chapanga ngampila mota Nuho na yana mundo ngannobholila, “Mkabhelekane nnyonjekeke na mukaitweleye nnema. <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Inyama yukumanyahe na ijhune yukunane, kila kihumbe chikikwabha na homba yoha kumbwane, bhoha nabhabha mukindendeke gwino na bhene nainyoghopa na kupwelela mangota. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Inyama yoha ghome ibhaha chakulya chino, ngita chinimpelangina mangota mahamba kubhehe chakulya chino. <verse eid="GEN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />Nambo mangalye jhe nyama jhibhii na miyahe jhake nhwalo ughome ubhii umyahe. <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Mundo jhojhoha anda ankomite nnyake nanihadabula aweghe. Na kinyama chochoha chikipala kunkoma mundo, na kinyama chenio nakikomwa. <verse eid="GEN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" />Mundo jhojhoha jwapakunkoma nnyake, na jwenio hele napalwa akomwe na bhando nhwalo Chapanga ampangine mundo kukulandana na jwenio.<verse eid="GEN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />“Ipalwa mmelekane nnyonjekeke, mmelekena hake mukautweleye nnema.”<verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Peniya, Chapanga ngannobholila Nuho na yana mundo, <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />“Ngohe, nibheka lilaghano lyango na mangota pamonga na ibheleko hino, <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />pamonga na ihumbe ibhii ghome ipakubhehe na mangota. Ijhune na inyama yukukoleka na inyama yukumanyahe na ipitita pamonga na mangota mu mele na kila kihumbe chikibhii ghome pannema. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Kwa lilaghano lyango lende kwino, kubhehe ihumbe yoha ghome iwe jhe kabhele kwa mache twe na maheluko gha mache ngita gheniya ghapiti ng'o kabhele ghukukomelekeya nnema.” <verse eid="GEN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />Chapanga ngalongila kabhele, “Jhenje ndi nginyililo jha lilaghano linabheka panakate jhango na mangota, na kila kihumbe chikibhii ghome chimutamanako na kwa ibheluko yoha machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />Nibheka upende gwa matanga mu mahunde, gwenio ubhaha ndi nginyililo jha lilaghano linibheka panakate jhango na nnema. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Kipinde choha pighatanda mahunde gha hula pannema na mpende gwa matanga upitii mu mahunde, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />peniya, nangombokela lilaghano lyango panakate jhango na mangota na ihumbe yoha ya kila namuna ibhii na ughome. Hilu mache twe ghapiti ng'o kabhele kukomelekeya ughome gwabhe. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Kipinde choha chipakupitila mpende gwa matanga kumahunde, naniubhona gwenio nangombokela lilaghano lya machiko ghoha ghangapeta panakate jha Chapanga na ihumbe yoha ibhii ghome ibhii panane jha nnema.” <verse eid="GEN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Peniya, Chapanga ngannobholila Nuho, “Jhenje ndi nginyililo jha lilaghano lyango mekite panakate jhango na ihumbe yoha pannema.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuho na yana mundo inalome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Yana ya Nuho ipitita muchapina ikibha Chemo na Amu na Yafete. Amu ndi tate jwa Kanane. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Bhamba bhatato bhakibha ndi yana ya Nuho, kubhoke kwa bheniya bhando ngabhajhenila pannema gwoha.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Nuho ndi jwatumbwila kulema, na ngalemita nng'onda gwa michabibo. <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Lichiko limo Nuho nganywila hake divaye ngalobhila, ngagholwika makengele mu kichimba chake. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Amu, tate jwa Kanane ngaghabhona matako gha tate mundo, ngapita panja kwalobholela akananung'una mundo bhabhele. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Nambo Chemo na Yafete ngabhatoila ngobho ngibhapukita mumabhegha ghabhe, ngabhajhenda kihengenyume na kuyekelela matako gha tate gwabhe, miho ghabhe ghakalinguli ng'o matako gha tate gwabhe. <verse eid="GEN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Nuho pajhimwika mulughono lukolobhela na pamanyita ghantendi mwana gwake nchokombe, <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />ngalongila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">“Nape likoto Akanane!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">Nabha mmanda jwa pahe hake kwa akaacha mundo.”<verse eid="GEN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Ngalongila kabhele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">“Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwango, ampele mota Chemo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">na Kanane abha mmanda gwake. <verse eid="GEN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Chapanga anyonjekeye mipaka jha kilambo chake Yafete,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">Yafete atame pamonga mu kichimba cha Chemo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">Kanane abha mmanda jwa Shemo.”<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Pughapetita mache twe, Nuho ngatamita yaka miya itato na makome nu nhwano. <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />Peniya, Nuho ngatamita yaka miya ticha na makome nu nhwano, peniya, ngajhomwika.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s">Kibheluko cha Nuho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:5-23">1 Ngongu 1:5-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Nuho akibha na yana itato yane Chemo na Amo na Yafete. Pighajhomwikila maheluko gha mache, yana yene ngabhapapita yana twe.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Yana inalome ya Yafete ndi henge, Gomele na Maghoghu na Madae na Yavane na Tubale na Meshake na Tilaze. <verse eid="GEN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Yana inalome ya Gomale ikibha Ashikenashe na Lifate na Togama. <verse eid="GEN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Yana inalome ya Yavane ikibha Elisha na Tarshishi na Kitimo na Lodanimu. <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Bhamba ndi lihembuko lya bhando panakate jha bhibhajhenda umbwane na mu ilendela, kila bhando na kilonge chabhe na bhikengama ngolo yabhe na ilambo yabhe.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Yana ya inalome ya Amu ikibha Kuche na Michile na Puto na Kanaane. <verse eid="GEN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Yana inalome ya Kushe ikibha Cheba na Hawila na Chabuta na Laama na Sabutaka. Yana inalome ya Laama ikibha Sheba na Dedane. <verse eid="GEN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Kushi ngampapita Nimulode ndi jwakibha lilome jwangajhoghopa kwa makakala ghake pannema. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Kwa kutangatilwa na Bhambo Chapanga ngabhila nnumba jwamaha nkolongwa jwa kuyema, ndi mana bhando ulonge luhomo, “Na Chapanga antenda nnumba ngita Nimulode.” <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Miche jhake jhukutumbu mu ulongoche gwake ikibha, Babele na Eleki na Akade na Ku chinale. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Peniya, kubhoke kwenio Nimulode ngajhenda ku Achulu ngachenga muche gwa kwenio ku Ninawe na Ku Lehobotile na ku Kala, <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />na muche gwaku Leseme ubhii panakate jha muche gwa ku Ninawe gwene ndi muche nkolongwa gwaku Kala.<verse eid="GEN 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Yana ya Michile ikibha Akalude na Akaname na Akaleabe na Akaputue, <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />na Akapatuluche na Akachilue kwabhe bheniya ngabhapitila kwa Akafilichite na Akaputole.<verse eid="GEN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Yana ya Kaanane ikibha Chidone jhu litibho na Hethi, <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />na helahela Kaanane akibha hokolo gwa Akayebuche na Akaamole na Akagiligache, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />na Akaive na Akalike na Akasine, <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />na Akaluvade na Akasemale na Akaamate. Peniya, lukolo lwa bhando bha Akakanane ngalupechengina. <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />Mipaka jha kilambo chuku Akaanane ngaitumbwila ku Chidone ade ku Gelale na kujhenda ku Gacha, peniya, ngaijhendilila ade ku Sodoma na ku Gomola na Adima na Cheboimu ade ku Lasha. <verse eid="GEN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Henge ndi ibheluko ya Amu kukengama ngolo lyabhe na ilonge yabhe na ilambo yabhe.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Shemo ndi akibha nhwacha mundo Yafete, ndi akibha tate jwa Akabulaniya bhoha. <verse eid="GEN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Yana ya Shemo ikibha Elamu na Ashulu na Alipakusade na Lude na Alamu. <verse eid="GEN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Yana inalome ya Alamu ikibha Usi na Ule na Getale na Mashi. <verse eid="GEN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Alupakichade ngampapita Shela na Shela ngampapita Ebele. <verse eid="GEN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Ebele akibha na yana inalome ibhele; nkolo akemitwa Pelege, ankemita yene nhwalo machiko gheniya bhando pannema bhakatei kupechengana na jhuubhele akemitwa Yokitane. <verse eid="GEN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Yokitane akibha tate jwa Alumadade na Shelepu na Ashalimawete na Yela, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />na Hadolamu na Ushale na Dikela, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />na Obale na Abimaele na Sheba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />Ofile na Hawila na Yobabu. Henge yoha ikibha yana ya Yokitane. <verse eid="GEN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Muilambo ibhatamita ikibha kubhoke ku Mesha ade ku Shefele mu ilambo ya itombe kuupande kulihumii lyobha. <verse eid="GEN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Bheniya ndi ibheluko ya Shemo, kukengama makabila ghabhe na ilonge yabhe na ilambo yabhe na ngolo yabhe.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Bhamba ndi ibheluko na yana ya Nuho kwa kukengama na ibheluko yabhe mu ilambo yabhe. Kubhoke bheniya, bhando bha ilambo ngaghajhenila pannema poha pughajhomwikila mache twe ghighayekilila nnema.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s">Nnala gwa Babele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Pukutumbula bhando bhoha pannema bhalongila kilongei chimo na malobhe ghaghalaghala. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Bhahe, bhando ngabhatyanga kuhumii kulipitii lyobha na ngabhaikita pakilambo chapandika cha Shinale ngabhatamita kwenio. <verse eid="GEN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Peniya, ngabhapwepwelina bhene chika, “Denda tupyatu matofale na tujhoche maha kwa mwotu.” Bhakachengite kwa matofale pala pibhapalita maghanga na bhakibha na lame pala pibhapala na chokaa. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Ngabhalongila, “Ngohe, tuchenge muche gwito na nnala, nnala gwenio kilegheleghe chake kiika ade kunane kwa Chapanga, ndi tumanyikane kupala tukoto kupechengana pannema poha.”<verse eid="GEN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga ngauluka kupala aulolekee muche gwenio na nnala gwenio ghuchengwa na bhando. <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />Bhambo Chapanga ngalongila, “Nnola bhando bhamba bha kilambo chimo na kilonge chimo, ghongo ndi utumbulo tu gwa ghala ghibhapala kuhengwa. Ghoghoha ghipalwa kuhengwa naghahengeka telatela. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Denda tuuluke pahe tukahangabhane kilongei chabhe kupala bhakoto kukung'ilana bhene kwa bhene.” <verse eid="GEN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Peniya, Chapanga ngabhapechangane pannema gwoha na bhene ngabhalekita kuchenga muche gwenio. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Muche gwenio ukemitwa Babele nhwalo kwenio ndi Bhambo ndi kwaibhingina ilongei pannema gwoha nu kubhoka kwenio ngabhateila bhando bhapechengane pannema poha.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibheluko ya Shemo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:24-27">1 Ngongu 1:24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Chenje ndi kibheluko cha Shemo. Yaka ibhele puipitita kuhumii mu maheluko gha mache twe, Shemo pakibha na yaka miya, ngampapita Alupakisade. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Pajhomolila kumpapa Alupakichade, Shemo ngatamita nukubhehe yaka henge miya nunhwano ngapapita yana inalome na ikeghe.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Alupakisade pakibha na yaka makome matato nunhwano, ngampapita mwana munalome akemitwa Shela. <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Pajhomolila kumpapa Shela, Alupakisade ngatamita yaka henge miya ncheche na mitato ngapapita yana henge inalome na ikeghe.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Shela pakibha na yaka makome matato, ngampapita mwana munalome Ebele. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Pajhomolila kumpapa Ebele, Shela ngatamita yaka henge miya ncheche na mitato ngapapita yana henge inalome na ikeghe.<verse eid="GEN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Ebele pakibha na yaka makome matato na ncheche, ngampapita mwana munalome akemitwa Pelege. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Pajhomolila kumpapa Pelege, Ebele ngatamita yaka henge miya ncheche na makome matato ngapapita yana henge inalome na ikeghe.<verse eid="GEN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Pelege pahikicha yaka makome matato, ngampapa mwana akemitwa Leu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Pajhomolila kumpapa Leu, Pelege ngatamita yaka henge miya ibhele na ticha ngapapita yana inalome na ikeghe.<verse eid="GEN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Leu pahikicha yaka makome matato na mabhele, ngampapita mwana munalome Seluge. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Pajhomolila kumpapa Seluge, Leu ngatamita yaka henge miya ibhele na chaba, na ngapapita henge yana inalome na ikeghe.<verse eid="GEN 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Seluge pahikichika yaka makome matato, ngapapita mwana munalome Naole. <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Pajhomolila kumpapa Naole, Seluge ngatamita yaka miya ibhele na ngapapita henge yana inalome na ikeghe.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Naole pahikicha yaka makome mabhele na ticha, ngampapita mwana munalome Tela. <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Pajhomolila kumpapa Tela, Naole ngatamita yaka henge miya jhimo likome limo na ticha, na ngapapita henge yana inalome na ikeghe.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Tela pahikicha yaka makome chaba, ngapapa yana inalome itato. Ulaamo na Naole na Halane.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibheluko ya Tela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Henge ndi ibheluko ya Tela, Tela ngampapa Ulaamo na Naole na Halane. Halane ngampapita mwana munalome akemitwa Luto. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Halane ajhomwika, kipinde tate mundo Tela patamita ku muche gwa Ule, kwabhelwikilwe. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Ulaamo na Naole bhakibha bhatolii akakeghe. Nhwana mundo Ulaamo akemitwa Salai na nhwana mundo Naole akemitwa Milika, Milika na Isika ikibha yana ya Halane. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Salai akibha ntonga, akibha jhe na mwana.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Tela ngantola mwana mundo Ulaamo na nchokolo mundo Luto mwana jwa Halane na Salai kamwana mundo, ngabhalongohina bhoha kubhoka Ule, kilambo cha Wakaludayo na kujhenda kilambo cha Kaanane. Nambo pubhahikita ku kilambo chuku Halane ngabhatamita kwenio. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Tela ngajhomwikila koko ku Halane kongo pakibha na yaka miya ibhele nu nhwano.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga inkema Ulaamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />Peniya Chapanga ngannobholila Ulaamo, “Mmoke pa kilambo chino na mwaleke akalongo bhino na nyumba jha tate gwino na nnyende pa kilambo chimbala kunangiya. <verse eid="GEN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />Mwenga mbakummeka mme na ibheluko mbwe na bhene nabhamanyikana hake na mwenga namma na mota na hele nantenda umanyikane na kwape mota bhando.<verse eid="GEN 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />Nanapela mota bhoha bhibhampe mota.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">Jwapala kunapanikii nane nanalapanikiya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">Na bhando bhoha pannema nabhapata mota kupete mwenga.”<verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Yene, Ulaamo ngabhokita ngita Chapanga channobholila na jwenio Luto ngabhajhawila pamonga. Ulaamo pabhokita ku Halane pakibha na yaka makome chaba nu nhwano. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Ulaamo ngabhokita nuhwana mundo Salai na Luto mwana jwa unnung'umundo Halane niilebhe yake yoha pamonga na bhando bhoha bhibhapatita kwenio ku kilambo chuku Halane. Ngabhabhoka kujhenda ku kilambo chuku Kaanane.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 12:5">Pibhaikita ku kilambo chuku Kaanane, <verse eid="GEN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Ulaamo ngapeta panakate jha kilambo chenio ngaikita ku Shekemo, chehemo jha nyahinyahi, pankongo nkolongwa ghukemwa Mwalone gwa Mole. Kipinde chenio Akakaanane ndi akakolo kilambo chenio. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngampitila Ulaamo ngannobholila, “Ibheluko hino nanikipela kilambo chenje.” Yene, Ulaamo ngachengita kachangwale kanyahinyahi kamaghanga, pena kunhwalo Bhambo jwampitile. <verse eid="GEN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Kubhoka kwenio ku Shekemo, Ulaamo ngajhenda kulihumii lyobha mwitombe ya muche gwa ku Betele ngachenga kichimba chake kwenio, ku Betele ibhii kulitipikii lyobha na muche ghuku Ai ubhii kulihumii lyobha. Kwenio hele Ulaamo nganchengila Bhambo kachangwale kanyahinyahi kamaghanga na kunnyinamila Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Peniya, Ulaamo ngajhendilila na mwanja gwake upande gwa lubhoko lwa ngejha.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulaamo mu kilambo chuku Michile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Kipinde chenio mu kilambo chenio chuku Kaanane pakibha na njala ngolongwa hake, yene Ulaamo ngahelila kujhenda kutama kwa kipinde chandina. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Ulaamo pabhandikila ku Michile pannobholila nhwana mundo kubhehe, “Manye mwe, ntei kualala hake. <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />Akamichile pibhammona nabhalonge, ‘Ojho ndi nhwana mundo,’ peniya, mmanya nabhangoma nenga na kunneka mwenga maghome. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Chonde nnongele, nenga mwe malombo bhango, ibhe mbaha kwanenga, kupala me naghome kwa nhwalo gwino mwenga.” <verse eid="GEN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Bhahe, Ulaamo paika ku Michile, Akamichile ngabhammona Salai kubhehe atei kuhalala hake. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Akatumiche bha Falao pabhamona Salai ngabhannumbalila kwa Falao. Peniya, Salai ngapelikwa kajhake Falao. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Kupete kwa Salai, Ulaamo ngabhantendila ghambone nukumpe ng'ombi na mambelele na maponda na ngamiya na akatumiche akanalome na akakeghe.<verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Nambo Bhambo ngannetila mabulo makolongwa Falao na bhando bhoha bha pakajhake kwa nhwalo gwa Salai aana bha Ulaamo. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Falao ngankema Ulaamo na kunkonya, “Mwe, ntei kilebhe ghane? Bho, nhwalo ghane unobholii jhe kubhehe Salai nhwana gwino? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Nhwalo gwa nike nnongila nnombo gwino ade nganintolila kubhehe nhwana gwango? Ngohe, aanabhino ndi bheniya matole mmoke nako!” <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Peniya, Falao ngabhalaghalikiya bhando bhake, kunchindikicha Ulaamo pamonga na nhwana mundo na ilebhe yoha yakibha nayo panja jha Michile.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s">Ulaamo na Luto bhitenda kupechengana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Ulaamo ngabhujha kubhoka ku Michile ngahobhoka kuupande gwa kuchine mwa Kananane, Negebo mana jhake. Kipinde chenio akibha na nhwana mundo pamonga na ilebhe yake yoha na Luto pamonga. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Kipinde chenio, Ulaamo akibha na ilebhe mbwe hake, akibha na ipugho yake ya mambelele na mbuhe na ng'ombi na madine gha feza na chaabo. <verse eid="GEN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Ngajhendilila na mwanja kubhoke upande gwa kuchine na kuika ku muche gwa ku Betele. Ngaikila chehemo jhela, pala makacho pakachengite kichimba panakate jha muche gwa ku Betele na Ai, <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />pena ndi pakanchengii Bhambo chehemo jha maghanga pa kupiya Litambiko. Peniya, ndi Ulaamo ngannyinamila Bhambo.<verse eid="GEN 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Na Luto jwakalongohine na Ulaamo hele akibha na nchambe gwa mambelele na mbuhe na ng'ombi na kichimba. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Nhwalo gwa kujholoka kwa ipugho yabhe, pakuluchila pala pakakwilite jhe Ulaamo na Luto kuluchikii ipugho yabhe. Yene ngabhapechangine. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Bhahe, ngaupitila bhulo panakate jha bhala bhibhalucha ipugho ya Ulaamo na bhala bha Luto. Kipinde chenio Akakanane na Akapeliche ndi bhibhakibha akolo kilambo chenio.<verse eid="GEN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Yene, Ulaamo ngannobholila Luto, “Pangabhe jhe na maghonga panakate jhito hilu akalucha bhango, twenga twalungolo. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Dolekeya, kilambo choha chikibhii palonge jhino. Tupechengane, anda mwe mihaghuu kujhenda lubhoko kwangejha na nenga nanyenda kwalelo.”<verse eid="GEN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Luto ngalolikiya, ngalola ulambo gwa lukemba lwa Yoludane ubhii na mache twe kila chehemo, ngita buchetane jha Bhambo na ngita kilambo chuku Michile kwa upande gwa Soale. Ghanga ghatendika kabula Bhambo anakomelekeya jhe miche jha ku Sodoma na ku Gomola. <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Bhahe, Luto pahagwila ulambo gwoa gwa lukemba lwa Yoludane ngajhendilila upande ghuliumii lyobha. Peniya, ndi pibhapechangina. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Ulaamo ngaighala ku kilambo chuku Kaanane na Luto ngatamita panakate jha miche ibhii mu ulambo, ngachenga ichimba yake pahina na ku muche gwaku Sodoma. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Nambo bhando bhuku Sodoma bhaketei kuchocha kwa gwanganandela na bhatenda uhakaho palonge jha Bhambo.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulaamo bhinangii kilambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Luto papechengina na Ulaamo, Bhambo ngannobholila Ulaamo, “Papa pummii jhinula miho nnoleke pande yoha, kachikachine na lubhoko lwa ngejha na kulihumii lyobha na kulitipikii lyobha. <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />Kilambo chenje choha chimukibhona nanimpela mwenga na ibheluko hino kibhehe chino machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Ibheluko hino naibhaha twe yangabhalangika, anda lutukunda lwa pannnema. Bhahe, na anda chulubhii lutukunda lwa pannema kunonopa kubhalangika ndi ibheluko hino nabhahoto jhe kubhalanga. <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Ngohe, jhinuka na nnyende na mukatyangetyange mu kilambo choha utandamaho gwake na upana gwake, nhwalo nanimpela choha nakibhaha chino.” <verse eid="GEN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Yene, Ulaamo ngahamicha ichimba yake na kujhenda kuchenga pahina pamikongo mikolongwa jha Mamule kola ku Hebulone. Kono nganchengila Bhambo kachangwale ka maghanga kakunnyinamila.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s">Ulaamo ighombo Luto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Kipinde chenio, munahota nkolongwa Amulafele jwa ku Shinale na munahota nkolongwa Alioko jwa ku Elasale na Kedolama munahota nkolongwa jwaku Elamo na Tidale munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Goimo, <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />kwa pamonga ngibhajhenda kukomana ngondo na munahota nkolongwa Bela jwaku Sodoma na munahota nkolongwa Bilisha jwaku Gomola na munahota nkolongwa Shinabo jwaku Adima na munahota nkolongwa Shemebele jwaku Sheboimo na munahota nkolongwa jwaku Bela, liina lenge bhikema Shohale. <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Akanahota akakolongwa bheniya nhwano ngabhakonganicha akakomana ngondo bhabhe kululambo lwa Shidimo, kwa liina lenge bhikema mbwane jha mwinyo. <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Akanahota bheniya bhantembikiya munahota nkolongwa Kedolama kwa yaka kome na mibhele, nambo chaka cha kome na tato ngabhang'alambwika. <verse eid="GEN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Muchaka cha kome na ncheche, munahota nkolongwa Kedolama na bhala akanahota ajhake ngabhaotola kwabula bhando bhaku Lefaimo kwenio Asitaloti Kanaimo na Akazuze kwenio ku Amo na Akaemi kwenio ku Shawe Kiliataimo, <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />na Akahole kwenio kuitombe ya ku Seile na ngabhabhenga ade Elifalamo, mupakane mwa njenga. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Peniya, ngabhabhujhita unyuma ade ku Enimishifate, kwa liina lenge bhikema Kadeche. Ngabhaotwila kilambo choha cha Akameleke, pamonga na Akaamole bhibhatama ku Asasone Tamale.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Pena, munahota nkolongwa jhuku Sodoma na munahota nkolongwa jhuku Gomola na munahota nkolongwa jhuku Adima na munahota nkolongwa jhuku Seboimo na munahota nkolongwa jhuku Bela, ngabhakonganicha akakomana ngondo bhabhe kubulana ngondo mululambo lwa Sedimo, <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />liina lenge bhikema Sohale ngabhabulina ngondo, na munahota nkolongwa Kedolama jhuku Elamo na munahota nkolongwa Tidale jhuku Goimo na munahota nkolongwa Amulafele jhuku Shinale na munahota nkolongwa Alioko jhuku Elasale, akanahota akakolongwa bheniya ncheche ngabhakomina nakanahota bheniya nhwano mululambo lwa ku Sidimo. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Mululambo lwa Sidimo ghakajholwike mabhomba gha lame, yene akanahota bhakolongwa bhaku Chodoma na ku Gomola pibhatilita ngondo, ngabhagwelila mwenio, nambo bhange ngabhatilila muitombe. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Bhahe, bhala akanahota bhakolongwa ncheche bheniya ngabhaotwila na kutola ilebhe yoha yuku Sodoma na ku Gomola pamonga na ilemo yabhe yoha, peniya, ngabhakijhabhulila. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Ngabhampukila ade Luto mwana jhunung'una mundo Ulaamo jwakibha atamita ku Sodoma pamonga na ilebhe yake, peniya, ngabhakijhabhulila.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Mundo jhumo jwakibha anyogholwike ngajhenda kunnobholela Ulaamo Mwibulaniya. Jwatamita pahina na mikongo mikolongwa jha miyalone jha Mamule jha Mwamole. Mamule akibha nnongo mundo Eshikole na Enele. Bheniya bhoha ngabhabheka lilaghano na Ulaamo. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Ulaamo pajhoha kubhehe nnongo mundo atei kupukilwa ngabhokita na bhando bhakajhake miya tato na kome na nane bhibhabholitwe kubulana ngondo. Ngabhakengamila ade ku muche gwa Dane. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Ulaamo ngabhaghina bhando bhake ikundeikunde. Kilo ngabhajhingilila akamakoko bhake na kwabula na kwaotola, ngabhatutwila ade ku muche gwa Oba, kwa upande gwa kachekachine mwa Damechike. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Ulaamo ngaghombwila ilebhe yoha ikatoilwe na akamakoko na ngaghombwila na Luto nnongo mundo pamonga ilebhe yake yoha na akakeghe na bhando bhange.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Melikizedeke impe mota Ulaamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Ulaamo pabhujhita kubhoka kubula munahota nkolongwa Kedolama na bhala akanahota ajhake, munahota jhuku Sodoma ngaika na kukongana na Ulaamo pululambo lwa Shawe, gwenio ndi ulambo lwa munahota nkolongwa. <verse eid="GEN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />Ndi munahota nkolongwa Melikizedeke jhuku Shalemo, akibha Mpiya litambiko jwa Chapanga jwabhii kunane hake, ngaletita libumunda na divaye, <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />ngampila mota Ulaamo, kulonge, “Chapanga jwabhii Nkolongwa hake ampii mota Ulaamo, jwapangine kunane kwa Chapanga na nnema! <verse eid="GEN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />Alombwe Chapanga nkolongwa jwabhii kunane hake, jwateila mwaotole akamakoko bhino!” Peniya, Ulaamo ngampe Melikizedeke lipungo lya kome lya ilebhe yake yoha.<verse eid="GEN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Munahota nkolongwa jhuku Sodoma ngannobholila Ulaamo, “Mwe, umbe bhena bhando bhango, nambo ilebhe yoha ntola mwenga.”<verse eid="GEN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Nambo Ulaamo nganyangwila munahota nkolongwa jwaku Sodoma, “Nilapi kwa Bhambo, Chapanga jwabhii kunane hake, Chapanga jwapangine kanane kwa Chapanga na nnema, <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />kubhehe nipoke jhe kilebhe chochoha chikibhii chino, kibhehe luche hilu lughojhe lwa kilato, kupala nkoto kulonge kubhehe, ‘Nantei Ulaamo bhabhe na ilebhe mbwe.’ <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Nenga nipoke jhe kilebhe chochoha nambo chela tu chibhalila bhando bhango, na lipungo lya bhando bhibhajhawila pamonga na nenga, bhando bhamba ndi Anele na Eshikole na Mamule. Bheniya bhipalwa kupata lipungo lyabhe.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga ibheka lilaghano na Ulaamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Pughapetita gheniya, lilobhe lya Bhambo ngilinhikilila Ulaamo mu maloto kulonge, “Ulaamo! Mangajhoghopa! Nenga naninnonda ngita ngao. Na nenga nanimpela hupo ngolongwa hake.”<verse eid="GEN 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Nambo Ulaamo ngalongila, mwe Mabhambo Chapanga, umbakumbeke kilebhe ghane kone mmi changamwana, na jwapala kubhujhii ilebhe yango ndi jhonjo Eliyazele mundo jhuku Damachiki? <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Ulaamo ngajhendelila kulonge, jhokanikiya! “Umbii jhe yana, yene ntumiche jwa unyumba jhango ndi jwapala kubhujhii ilebhe yango!”<verse eid="GEN 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Peniya, Bhambo ngalongila kabhele, “Jhonjo Eliyazele ntumiche jwino nabhujhii ng'o ilebhe hino! Nambo mwana jhumupakumpapa mabhene ndi jwapala kubhujhii ilebhe hino.” <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" />Bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga ngampiya Ulaamo panja na kunnobholela, “Nnole kunane! Mibhalange ndondo anda chakaka nanhotola kuibhalanga! Yene, ndi chiipala kubhelukana ibheluko twe.”<verse eid="GEN 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />Ulaamo nganhobholela Bhambo Chapanga, kukutenda yene, Chapanga ngamalangila kubhehe jwaumbone palonge jhake.<verse eid="GEN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Chapanga ngannobholila Ulaamo, “Nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga jhuninetite kubhoka ku Ule, kilambo cha Akakaladayo kupala nimpeke mwenga kilambo chenje kibhehe chino.”<verse eid="GEN 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Nambo Ulaamo palongila, “Oko! Chapanga ngohe namanya bho kubhehe kilambo chenjeno nakibhaha chango?”<verse eid="GEN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Chapanga panyangwila, “Unnetele litohe lya ng'ombi jhankolo jha yaka itato na litohe lya mbuhi jhankolo lya yaka itato na limbelele likambako lya yaka itato na njebha na libwele lya ngunda.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Ulaamo ngapelika yenio yoha ngaanja kila kinyama ipande ibhele na ngapangita michitale mibhele jhilolekeana, nambo ngunda hela ngaighalika jhuhilimila. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Matumbui pighatolita kupala kulye mitui jhenio, Ulaamo ateila kughaaka.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Lyobha pilitipika Ulaamo ngabhila lughono tipitipi, ngaluyekelila lubhendo tyoo ngajhogwipa. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" />Peniya, Chapanga pannobholila Ulaamo, “Mmanya chakaka kubhehe ibhuluko hino ngita akaghene mu kilambo changabhehe chabhe, na bhena nabhabha akabhanda na kung'ahichwa kwa yaka miya ncheche. <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Nambo mbakwapwatalila kilambo chikipala kuntenda makabhanda, peniya mangota nammoka kwenio na ilebhe mbwe. <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Nambo mabhene mwenga mipa kulama yaka twe, na kuwe kwa uteeke na kuchikwa maha. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Kibheluko chino cha ncheche nakibujha pamba nhwalo uhakaho gwa Akaamole yamela inatimii jhe kuhadabulwa ngohe.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Lyobha pilitika na kujhingii lubhendo litanule lilihuka malyoi na nime ya mwotu lijhakupeta panakate jha ipande ya nyama. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />Lichiko lyene, Bhambo Chapanga pateila lilaghano na Ulaamo kunnobholela, “Ibheluko hino nanapela kilambo chenje, kubhoke kulukemba lwa Michile ade kulukemba lukolongwa Efulate, <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />yane ndi ilambo ya Akakene na Akakenise, Akadimone, <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />na Akahite na Akapeliche na Akalefai, <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />Akaamole na Akakaanane na Akagiligache na Akayebuche.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s">Ajile na Ichumaile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Bhahe, Salai nhwanamundo Ulaamo kuhumii makacho akibha anampapi jhe mwana. Nambo akibha na ntumiche mwikeghe liina lyake Ajile, jwahumii ku Michile. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Yene, Salai ngannobholila Ulaamo, “Umanye kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga andei ngoto kupapa. Ngohe, nng'oloke na Ajile ntumiche jwango Ajile, pange jhe nambata mwana kuhumii kwa jwenio.” Ulaamo ngajheketila chalongii Salai. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Bhahe, Ulaamo patamita ku kilambo chuku Kaanane kwa yaka kome. Peniya, Salai ngantoila ntumiche gwake Ajile, jwakibha Mmichile na ngampila Ulaamo abhe nhwanamundo. <verse eid="GEN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Ulaamo ngagholwika na Ajile, na Ajile ngapata ndumbo. Nambo Ajile pamanye kubhehe nandumbo, ngatumbu kuloka na kunpucha Salai.<verse eid="GEN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Salai ngannobholila Ulaamo, “Mwe, umanye ghunitendelwa kwa nhwalo gwino. Ne nganimpila ntumiche jwango, nambo papatita ndumbo tugha, andenda kumbucha! Bhambo Chapanga ahadabule panakate jhango na mwenga!”<verse eid="GEN 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Nambo Ulaamo panyangwila Salai, “Ntumiche jwino abhii mukindendeke gwino. Muntende chimipala mabhene.” Peniya, Salai ngang'ahita Ajile, ade nganyogholwika.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Ntumiche jwa Bhambo Chapanga jwa kunane ngankole Ajile pachembwe cha mache kunjenga, chembwe chenio kikibha pandela jhijhenda ku Shulu. <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />Ntumiche jwenio pankonya Ajile, “Ajile, ntumiche jwa Salai! Mibhoka koo na mijhenda koke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:8">Ajile pajhangwila, “Natila akalongwa bhango Asalai.”<verse eid="GEN 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Ndi ntumiche jwenio jwa Chapanga pannobholila Ajile, “Nkelebhuke kwa nkolongwa gwino Salai na mukannyenyekeye.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />Ntumiche jwenio jwa Bhambo Chapanga ngajhendilila kulonge, “Mbakujhonjekeya ibheluko hino ibha twe yangabhalangika. <verse eid="GEN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />Mwenga ngohe mmii na ndumbo nampapa mwana munalome. Liina lyake namtina Ichumaile, mana Chapanga ajhoine malagho ghino. <verse eid="GEN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Nambo mwana gwino Ichumaile chatama na lighoho ngita liponda lyangakolekeka, chakwapana na kila mundo, na kila mundo nakwapa nako. Natama kanjika na akalongo mundo.”<verse eid="GEN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Peniya, Ajile ngampila liina Bhambo Chapanga jwalonge nako, “Mwenga ndi Ma Chapanga Jwimulola,” kwa mana awachila kubhehe, “Chakaka pamba nimwene jwenio Jwamwona nenga.” <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Ndi nhwalo kilibha chela kikemwa Beli Lai Loi, mana ghake kilibha cha Jwabhii Ghome Jwamwona nenga. Kilibha chenio kibhii panakate jha muche gwa Kadeshe na ku Belede.<verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Ajile ngampapila Ulaamo mwana munalome. Ulaamo ngantina liina lya Ichumaile. <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Ulaamo akibha na yaka makome nane na chita kipinde Ajile pampapita Ichumaile.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s">Lilaghano na kujhingii jando</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Kipinde Ulaamo pahikicha yaka makome ticha na ticha, Bhambo Chapanga ngampitila na kunnobholela, “Nenga ndi Chapanga jhunanhotolo. Nkengama ulongoi gwango na ntama kwa kunhalalila nenga. <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />Nane nandenda lilaghano lyango panakate jha nenga na mwenga, nanimpela ibheluko twe.” <verse eid="GEN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Peniya, Ulaamo ghagwila mangukama na Chapanga ngannobholila, <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />“Ne meka lilaghano lende na mwenga, namma matate bha bhando bha ilambo twe. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />Kubhoke ngohe, mikemwa ng'o kabhele ma Ulaamo, nambo nankemwa ma Ulaimo, nhwalo ninteii mme matate bha bhando bha ilambo twe.” <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Nanintenda mma na ibheluko twe hake, na kubhoka kwino nabhapitila bhando bha ilambo twe na panakate jha bheniya nabhapitila akanahota akakolongwa.<verse eid="GEN 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />“Nanitenda lilaghano lyango libhaha lya machiko ghoha ghangapeta. Namma Chapanga gwino na Chapanga jwa ibheluko ino. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />Nanimpela kilambo chenje mwenga na ibheluko ino mwenio ngohe mitama ngita maghene. Yane kilambo choha chuku Kaanane machiko ghoha ghangapeta na nenga namma Chapanga jwabhe.”<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Peniya, Chapanga ngannobholila Ulaimo, “Mwenga namulichokolekeya lilaghano lyango, mabhene pamonga na ibheluko ino na ibheluko yabhe yoha. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />Yene, ndi chimipalwa kulichokolekeya lilaghano lende panakate jhango na mwenga na ibheluko ino, kila munalome panakate jhino ipalwa ajhingila jando. <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Kwenio kujhingila jando ndi naibhaha huna jha lilaghano lyango panakate jhino na nenga. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Kila mwana munalome pahikicha machiko nane pabhoke mu kubhelukwa ajhingiwa jando. Kila munalome mu ibheluko ino pamonga na mmanda jwabhelwikwe munyumba ino amu mmanda jwahemilwe mu mbijha ino kuhumii kwa akaghene bhangabhehe ibheluko ino ajhingila jando. <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />Ena, kila mwana munalome jwabhelwikwe munyumba jhino ata jwahemilwe kwa mbijha ino ipalwa ajhingila jando. Huna jhene naibhaha nginyililo muyegha jhino jha lilaghano lyango lya machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Munalome jhojhoha jwangajhingii jando abhekwa kutale na bhando bhake, nhwalo nabhaha alilemwile lilaghano lyango.”<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Peniya, Chapanga pannobholila Ulaimo, “Kwa nhwana gwino, nakemwa jhe kabhele Salai, nambo nakemwa Sala. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Nanimpela mota na mwenga champapila mwana munalome. Ena, mbakumpe mota Sala nabhaha majhe jwa bhando bha ilambo twe na akanahota akakolongwa bhi ilambo yoha nabhapitila mujwenio.”<verse eid="GEN 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Peniya, Ulaimo ngalita ade pahe kone aekita chumwojho nukuwacha, “Kupapa mwana kwa mundo jwabhii na yaka makome kome? Na bho Sala jwabhii na yaka makome ticha nahotola kupapa mwana?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Peniya, Ulaimo ngannyangwila “Nhwalo gwa nike nkoto kunneka abhujhila ilebhe yango?”<verse eid="GEN 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Chapanga ngalongila, “Nahi jhe! Nambo nhwana gwino Sala apakumpapii mwana munalome, namwe namkema liina lyake Ichaka. Nanilikamula lilaghano lyango kwa jwenio na ibheluko yake kubhehe lilaghano lyango ndi machiko ghoha ghangapeta.” <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />“Panane jha Ichumaile, ne nyohine chinyopite. Mbanimpe mota, nanimpela yana twe na kunyonjekeya hake. Ichumaile nabha tate jwa ilongoche ya makabila kome na mabhele, na ne nimmeka abha tate jwa kilambo kikolongwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Nambo lilaghano lyango lela nalilenganila kwa Ichaka jwene. Na jwene nabhelukwa na Sala kwa chaka chikihika, kipinde ngita chenje.” <verse eid="GEN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Peniya, Chapanga pajhomolila kulongela, nganneka Ulaimo.<verse eid="GEN 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Peniya, lichiko lele Ulaimo nganyingiya mwana mundo Ichumaile jando, na kwajhingii akabhanda bhoha akanalome bhubhabhelwikii munyumba jhake na bhala bhibhahemililwe kwa mbijha yake, ngita Chapanga chinaghalikiya. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Ulaimo pajhingila jando, pakibha na yaka makome ticha na ticha. <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />Na jwenie Ichumaile mwana gwake, akibha na yaka kome na mitato na jwenie ndi pajhingila jando. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Ulaimo na mwanamundo Ichumaile ngabhajhingila jando lichiko limo. <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />Akanalome bhoha bhubhabhelwikile unyumba jhake pamonga na akabhanda bhibhabhelikilwe mbijha yake na bhibhabhelekwii munyumba. Bhoha ngabhajhagila jhando lichiko limo.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga alaghana kumpe mwana Ulaimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngampitila Ulaimo pahina na mikongo mikolongwa jha miyalone jha Mamule. Ulaimo pakibha atamite chehemo jhakujhingilila pakichimba chake pulibhalita hake lyobha. <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" />Ulaimo pajhinwila miho ghake, ngabhabhona akaghene bhatato bhajhemite patale kandina nnongi jhake. Papa pabhabhonita, ngabhabhutikila kubhoke patamite pakichimba ngajhenda kwapokela. Paikita kwa bhando bheniya ngalita pahe kwa ichima, <verse eid="GEN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />nu kulonge, “Makabhambo bhango, chonde mangambeta jhe ne natumiche gwino, nijhopa mpipikiye kwa nenga. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Nanetelwa mache ghandina kupala nkuwe makongono gwino na kongo mupomolela pakiwile cha nkongo ogho. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />Kipinde chimupomolela, nanintelekela chakulya chandina, nlyeghe, nkola makakala ghaghujhendelela na mwanja gwino mana nhwiki nenga natumiche gwino.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:5">Na bhene ngabhajhangwila, “Tela, ntenda ngita chinnongii.”<verse eid="GEN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Ulaimo ngabhujha kajhombe mu kichimba kunnobhole Sala, “Ntende kajhombe ntole ipemo itato ya uhembe gwambone na nteleke mabumunda.” <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Peniya, Ulaimo ngajhenda kajhombe mu kibhajha cha ng'ombi, ngahaghuu litole lya ng'ombi lilihatite na ngampila ntumiche, na jwenio nganchinjita na kunteleka kajhombe. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Peniya, Ulaimo ngatola chiagi na mabhele na nyama jhitelikwe ngabhapelikila chakulya akaghene bheniya. Na kipinde pibhalila pakiwile cha nkongo gwenio ngajhema pahina nabho kwatumikila.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Akaghene bheniya ngabhankonya Ulaimo, “Nhwana gwino Sala abhii koo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:9">Ulaimo pajhangwila, “Abhii mu kichimba.”<verse eid="GEN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />Jhumo panakate jhabhe ngalonge, “Chakaka nanimmujhila kipinde ngita chenje pachaka, nhwana gwino Achala nabhabha na mwana munalome.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:10">Peniya, Sala akibha pakimbokotole cha nnyango gwa kichimba, ngajhoha.<verse eid="GEN 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Ulaimo na Sala bhoha bhakibha bhaghogholwike hake, na Sala machiko ghake gha kupapa ghakapetite. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" />Yene, Sala ngahekita chuumwojho nu kulonge, “Nenga nakimbujha na anganabhango hele aghogholwike. Bho, nahotola bho kuhanganila kilebhe cheneche nukupapa mwana?”<verse eid="GEN 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />Pena, Bhambo ngankonya Ulaimo, “Nhwalo gwa nike Sala ahekite na kukikonya, ‘Chakaka nahoto bhole kubhehe namwana mughogholo mwone?’ <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />Bho, kibhii kilebhe chochoha chikilimba kwa Bhambo? Nanimmujhila kabhele pachaka, kipinde ngita chenje, Sala nabhaha na mwana munalome.”<verse eid="GEN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Nambo Sala kongo abhii na kiholo, ngakana akilongila, “Nhwekite jhe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:15">Bhambo Chapanga ngalongila, “Nahi jhe! Ena, nhwekite ma Sala.”<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulaimo abhajhope bhando bhuku Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Peniya, bhando bhala ngabhabhoka, na Ulaimo ngabhachindikicha, ngabhaikita chehemo jhukuhoto kukibhola muche gwaku Sodoma. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />Bhambo ngawacha umwojho, “Bho, nunhwiye Ulaimo kilebhe chipangite kuhenga? <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />Nhwalo Ulaimo nabhaha tate jwa bhando bhina makakala na kupete kwa jwenio bhando bhoha pannema nabhabha na mota! <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Nihagwii jwenio Ulaimo na kibheluko chake. Jwenie ndi naibhola ibheluko yake kukenga ndela jhango, bhatende ghighahanganicha palonge jhango kupala nenga nhotole kulenganikiya lilaghano lyango.”<verse eid="GEN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Yene, Bhambo Chapanga ngalongila, “Ibhii ngokoleko twe itendwa na bhando bhuku Sodoma na ku Gomola na uhakaho gwabhe uchochite hake. <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />Yene, mbakuuluka ote kujhenda kulola namwene anda chakaka bhatei gwanganandela ngita punijhoa mbala nikamanye.”<verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Peniya, kubhoka peniya, bhando bhala ngabhajhenda ku Sodoma nambo Bhambo Chapanga ngaighila papa bhajhemite pamonga nu Ulaimo. <verse eid="GEN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Ulaimo ngamandikila Bhambo, ngankonya, “Bho, chakaka namakomelekeya bhando bhibhatenda ghambone pamonga na bhanganandela? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Pange bhabhii bhando bhibhatenda ghambone makome nhwano umuche gwenio. Bho, namukomelekeya muche gwenio amu namuuleka nhwalo gwa bhando bheniya bhibhatenda ghambone makome nhwano bhubhii umuche gwenio? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Ne nihole jhe kubhehe nantenda yene! Kwakoma bhando bhibhatenda ghambone pamonga na bhanganandela, bhambone kwatenda tela na bhanganandela! Yene, jwakutemulana nnema ghoha nakotoka jhe kutenda ilebhe ibhii tela!”<verse eid="GEN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Ulaimo kubhehe, “Chakaka anda nakolii bhando makome nhwalo ku muche gwa ku Sodoma, naniuleka muche ghoha gwa ku Sodoma muteeke kwa nhwalo gwabhe.”<verse eid="GEN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Ulaimo ngalonge, “Nenga nyogwipe jhe kulonge na mwenga ma Bhambo Chapanga, ne jhupanginwe kuhuma mundope na malio tugha. <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />Pange pihoto kubhehe na bhando bhibhatenda ghambone makome ncheche nu nhwano chehemo jha bhando makome nhwano. Bho, namukomelekeya muche ghoha nhwalo bhapongwii bhando nhwano abha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">Bhambo Chapanga ngajhangwila, “Niniukomelekeya jhe muche ghoha anda bhabhii bhando bhambone makome ncheche nu nhwano.”<verse eid="GEN 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Ulaimo ngajhendilila kulonge, “Bho, anda bhabhii bhando makome ncheche bhahotwii kubhonekana mwenio.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">Bhambo Chapanga ngalongila, “Kwa nhwalo jha bhando makome ncheche bhibhatenda ghambone naniukomelekeya jhe muche gwenio.”<verse eid="GEN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Ulaimo ngajhendilila kulonge, “Ma Mabhambo, chonde nnyopa mangayome jhe, ne mbakulonge kabhena. Pange jhe nabhabhonekana bhando bhibhatenda ghambone makome matato.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">Bhambo Chapanga ngajhangwila, “Nandendi jhe gheniya anda nakolii bhando makome matato bhibhatenda ghambone.”<verse eid="GEN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Ulaimo ngalonge, “Bhambo nijhopa unyeketelete kulonge na mwenga kabhele. Bho, pange nabhabhonikana bhando bhibhatenda ghambone makome mabhele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">Bhambo Chapanga ngajhangwila, “Kwa nhwalo jha bhando makome mabhele, nikikomelekeya jhe muche gwenio.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Kubhoke peniya Ulaimo ngalonge, “Ma Mabhambo ninyopa mangayoma jhe, nambo mbakulonge kibhele chimo tu. Bho, pange nabhabhonekana bhando bhibhatenda ghambone likome limo tugha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">Bhambo Chapanga ngajhangwila, “Kwa nhwalo jha bheniya kome nikikomelekeya jhe muche gwenio.” <verse eid="GEN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Bhambo Chapanga pajhomolila kulonge nu Ulaimo ngabhokita na Ulaimo hele ngabhujhita kajhake.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s">Uhakaho gwa bhando bhuku Chodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Pihikita kimiye akatumiche bheniya bhabhele bha kunane kwa Chapanga ngabhaika ku Sodoma. Luto akatamite pannyango nkolo gwakujhingilila muche gwaku Chodoma. Pabhabhona ngajhinuka na kujhenda kwapokela na ngalita kwa ichima, <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />ngalongela, “Akanahota bhango nhwikengane pakajhango ne natumiche bhino. Ngholola magholo ghino nukugholoka unyumba jha natumiche gwino dele kilo, kilabho putepute mihoto kujhendelela na mwanja gwino.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:2">Nambo bhene ngabhalongila, “Nahi jhe! Twe natugholoka palubhanja pano.”<verse eid="GEN 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Luto ngabhapembikiya hake, na paligha ngabhajheketila kuheghele kajhake na kujhingi unyumba kupala bhagholoke. Luto ngabhalenganikila chakulya. Ngajhocha mabumunda jhangaleke ngedule. Na bhene ngabhalila<verse eid="GEN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Nambo kilo nakugholoka jhe, akanalome bhoha bha muche gwa ku Sodoma na achikangombo na ighoghololo nakuhighalika jhe hilu jhumo, ngabhaitindikiya nyumba jha Luto tii ngote. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />Ngabhankema Luto nukunkonya, “Bhajhingii kojhe akanalome bhibhabhetwikii uhiko pakajhino pano? Mwapiyengane panja twe tupala kugholoka nabho.”<verse eid="GEN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Luto ngapitita panja na ngadinda nnyango kihengauyuma, <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />ngalongila, “Makalongo bhango, chonde ninyopa mangatendangana jhe ubhoho gwenio. <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Dola, pamba ngwete achikabhale bhabhele bhamela bhinagholoka jhe na munalome. Mbaha nimpelengane bheniya mwatende chimupala. Nambo mwangatendele jhe chochoha akanalome bhamba nhwalo akaghene bhango.”<verse eid="GEN 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Nambo bhene ngabhalongila, “Bhokela oko, mwe maghene! Mwe mihoto bho kutulongelela twe chitupala kuhenga? Bhahe, natuntendela kilebhe kibhoho hake kupeta akaghene bhino.” Peniya ngabhankangila Luto unyuma pahina nukubomo nnyango gwake. <verse eid="GEN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Nambo akaghene bheniya ngabhatondobhiya mabhoko ghabhe nukuhutii Luto nkate jha unyumba jhake na kudinda nnyango. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />Peniya, akaghane bheniya ngabhabhulita ulwalo gwa ngalola bhando bhoha bhubhakibha pannyango gwa nyumba jwenio, akanahota kwa achikakombo, yene bhakauwe ng'o nnyango.<verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luto ibhoka ku Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />Bhando bhala bhabhele ngabhanobholila Luto, “Bho, abhii mundo jhonge pamba, yana ino na achikabhale na achikabhana bhino na akalongo bhino bhange bhubhabhii umuche ghongo? Mwapiye kajhombe pamuche pano, <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />nhwalo Bhambo atutumite kukomelekeya muche ghongo, mana kukokoleka kwa bhando pamba kujhokanikike kukolongwa hake na ghanhikilile Bhambo, jwenie ndi atutumite kuika kukomelekeya.”<verse eid="GEN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Bhahe, Luto ngabhajhendila achikabhana mundo kwalobholela,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:14">“Mmokengane kajhombe pamuche ghongo, Bhambo apakukomelekeya.” Nambo bhene ngabhammona alonge ubhiche tu. <verse eid="GEN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Putepute, akatumiche bheniya bha kunane kwa Chapanga, ngabhanyendila Luto kunnobholela, “Ntenda kajhombe, mutole aanabhino na achikabhale bhino bhabhele bhubhabhii pambano nakutenda yene nakomelekelwa pamonga kipende muche ghongo puukomeekelwa.” <verse eid="GEN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Peniya Luto ngabhila na kiyoto kubhoka. Nambo Bhambo nhwalo akankolii Kiya Luto, akatumiche bheniya ngabhankamuu lubhoko jwenie na nhwana mundo na longe lubhoko yana mundo ibhena, ngabhapiya panja jha muche gwenio. <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Pibhapiita panja jha muche, ntumiche jhumo pakate jha bhala bhabhele ngabhalobholila, “Ntilangane kupala mughombole ughome gwino! Mangaghalambuka jhe unyuma hilu kujhema pandika! Mutukile ku kwiitombe anda jhe nakomelekelwa papa.”<verse eid="GEN 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Luto ngalongila, “Nai jhe, chonde manahota bhango, mangandende jhe yene. <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Ndi chakaka kubhehe ne natumiche gwino mbatite kujheketelwa palonge jhino, na mangota umonii kiya na kughombo ughome gwango. Nambo nhotwi jhe kutilii kwiitombe nhwalo ndi kutale, lukomelekelo lwenio nalungolela nakuika jhe kwenio nanenga nahwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Dola, pabhii na muche nchokombe pahina kwenio nhotwii kutilila. Uneke ndilile kwenio, na kwenio namaa njelembo.”<verse eid="GEN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Jwenio nganyangwila, “Tela, nnyeketile kujhopa kwino nikikomelekeya jhe muche gwenio chenio ghumulongela. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Aya nnyomboteke! Mmutikila kwenio. Ne nitenda hote jhe kilebhe chochoha ade pumpakuika.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:22">Yene, muche gwenio ngaukemwa Choale, mana ghake, “Ukepa.”<verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukomelekelwa kwa muche gwaku Sodoma na Gomola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Lyobha pulipitita Luto akibha aikite ku muche gwaku Choale. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />Peniya Bhambo ngauluya mwoto nkale na maghanga ghighajhaka gha balute pamuche gwaku Sodoma na Gomola kubhoka kunane kwa Chapanga, <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />ngaijhochita miche jhene na ndika jhoha, na bhando bhoha na mikongo jhoha jhimelite pannema jha muche gwenio. <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" />Nambo nhwana mundo Luto jwakibha unyuma jha Luto, ngalolita unyuma papa ngaghalambwika na kubhehe lighanga lya mwinyo.<verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Lukela pe lichiko lilikengima, Ulaimo ngajhimuka na kujhenda chehemo pakajhemite palonge jha Bhambo. <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />Pakibha pena, ngalola upande gwa ku Sodoma na ku Gomola na chehemo jhoha jha lulambo, ngahechwika kubhona malyoi matopau ghakauka, malyoi gha mwoto nkolongwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Nambo Chapanga paikomelekeya miche jhibhii mululambo mwatamita Luto, ngankomboka Ulaimo kwa kummoa Luto mu miche jwenio, kupala akoto kukomelekelwa pamonga na miche jhenio jha Sodoma na Gomola.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutumbula kwa makabila gha Moabo na Akaamone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Luto ngajhoghopa kutama ku muche gwa ku Soale, yene ngaama muche gwenio pamonga na achikabhale bhake bhabhele, ngabhajhenda kutama mukwembe kwiitombe. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Lichiko limo pakibha kwenio kamwale nkolo ngannobholila unung'una, “Tate gwino aghoime, na abhii jhe munalome jhukututolela twenga mu kilambo chenje chitutama kupala tupape yana. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Deleno tunkenge divaye jhibhabha anyweghe ade alobhele, kubhoke peniya tugholoke nako kupala tupate yana lukolo lwito tujhonjekeke.” <verse eid="GEN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Kilo jhenio ngabhankengita tate gwabhe divaye jhibhabha ngalobhila na kamwale nkolo jhola ngajhenda kugholoka nako tate mundo, nambo tate mundo akamanyii jhe hilu pabhokita.<verse eid="GEN 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Kilabho jhake kamwale nkolo ngannobholila unung'una, “Nanjino dicho kilo ng'olwike nako tate gwango. Na deleno hele tunkenge divaye jhibhabha, peniya makagholoke nako mwenga, tuhoto kujhonjekeya lukolo lwito kwa kupata yana.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Na kilo ghola hele naha ngabhankengita divaye jhibhabha tate mundo na kamwale nchoko jhola ngajhenda kugholoka nako. Na tate mundo akamanyite jhe pagholwika hilu pabhokita kamwale. <verse eid="GEN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Yene, achikabhale bheniya bha Luto bhoha bhabhele ngabhabhila na ndumbo kwa kugholoka na tate gwabhe. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Kamwale jhola nkolongwa ngapapa mwana munalome, ngankema liina lyake Moabo. Jwenio ndi tate jwa likabila lya Akamoabo ade deleno. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Unung'una ngapapa mwana ngankema Bene Ame, jwenio ndi tate jwa likabila lya Akaamone ade deleno.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s">Ulaimo na Abimeleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Kuhumii Mamle, Ulaimo ngabhokita kujhenda chehemo jha lubhoko lwa ngejha, na kutama kweno, panakate jha ilambo ya Kadeche na ku Chule, kubhoke pena ngajhenda kutama kwa machiko ghandina ku Gelale. <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />Machiko ghughakibha kweno, ngabhalobholila bhando kubhehe Sala ndi nnombo mundo. Kwenio munahota nkolongwa Abimeleke jwa kilambo chuku Galale ngantola Sala kubhehe nhwana mundo. <verse eid="GEN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Nambo Chapanga nganhikila Abimeleke ngalotila kilo na kunnobholela, “Mwenga nanhwa kunhwalo jha mwikeghe jhumuntolile, jhono abhii na ungana mundo.”<verse eid="GEN 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Abimeleke akibha anagholoka nako jhe, ngalongila, “Bhambo namakoma bhando bhangalemwa? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Ulaimo jweno ndi jwalongila, kubhehe jhonjo Sala ndi nnombo mundo! Kabhele Sala jwenio ngalongila Ulaimo ndi nhwacha mundo! Ne ndeile gheniya chindeile kwa mwojho gwambone kubhehe mii namalemwa.”<verse eid="GEN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Chapanga panyangwila Abimeleke mukulote kubhehe, “Tela, manye nteila gheniya kwa mwojho gwambone kubhehe nkwete malemwa. Nenga ndi jhunihibhilikiya mwe mangatenda jhe gwanganandela. Ndi nhwalo ninnekite jhe nng'oloke na mwikeghe jhono. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Ngohe, mumujhiche mwikeghe jwenio kwa unganamundo. Ulaimo nnondole jwango, nanyopela kwa Chapanga nanama. Nambo nakumujhicha jhe, chakaka umanya mwenga pamonga na bhando bhino bhoha mipuluta.”<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Peniya, Abimeleke ngajhimuka putepute ngabhakema akatumiche bhoha na kwalobholela ghaghabwene pang'amatila, na bhene akatumiche ngabhajhogwipa hake. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Yene, Abimeleke ngankema Ulaimo na kunkonya, “Mundendi nike? Nanjii ninemwi nike mpaka mwe kunete uhakaho ghongo, nenga na unahota gwango nkolongwa? Undendi kitendwa changapaligwa kutendelwa.” <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Kabhele Abimeleke ngajhendilila kunkonya Ulaimo, “Nike chikinkangite ntende yeneye?”<verse eid="GEN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Ulaimo ngajhangula, “Ndeila gheniya ambwika abhii jhe mundo jwannyoghopa Chapanga pamba na kabhele ngaungomite kupala kuntola nhwana gwango. <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Chakaka, jhonjo ndi alombo bhango, tate jwito jhumo nambo tulekine kimajhe, ndi nhwalo ngabhila nhwana gwango. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Kipinde Chapanga pandeila nileke nyumba jha tate gwango nukujhenda kuughene, nganinobholila nhwana gwango, ‘Putupa kujhenda popoha, chonde ungema naacha bhino!’ ”<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Abimeleke ngakamwiya Ulaimo nhwanamundo Sala ngampila mambelele na ng'ombi pamonga na akabhanda akanalome na akakeghe. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Abimeleke ngannobholila Ulaimo, kilambo chenje choha jha nenga, ngohe nhaghule popoha ntame. <verse eid="GEN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Peniya, ngannobholila Sala, “Jhokanikiya, aachabhino napi ipande ya madine gha feza elufo jhimo ya kwalangii bhabhii nako palonge jhino bhakweti jhe malemwa. Chakaka bhoha bhakweti jhe malemwa.”<verse eid="GEN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17" />Peniya, Ulaimo ngannyopa Chapanga na Chapanga ngannamiya Abimeleke, nhwanamundo na akabhanda bhake na akakeghe, kupala bhahoto kupapa yana. <verse eid="GEN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18" />Kwa nhwalo, Bhambo akatei kwatabha akakeghe bhoha bhubhabhii muunahota nkolongwa gwa Abimeleke bhakoto kupapa yana, nhwalo gwa Sala nhwana mundo Ulaimo.<verse eid="GEN 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s">Kubhelukwa kwa Ichaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngankomboka Sala, ngantendila ngita chalaaghila. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Ulaimo mughogholo na Sala pakibha na ndumbo, ngapapa mwana munalome, kipinde cheche chalongila Chapanga. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Ulaimo ngampila mwana jhono jwampapite Sala liina lyake Ichaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />Ichaka pahikicha machiko nane, Ulaimo nganyingiya jando ngita channaghilwa na Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Ulaimo akibha na yaka makome kome ndi kipinde chabhelwika Ichaka mwana mundo. <verse eid="GEN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Na jwenio Sala palongila, “Chapanga ambii luweko, kila mundo jwapakujhoa kilebhe chenje, naheka pamo na nenga.” <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Sala ngajhendilila kulonge, “Mene ngahotwii kunnobhole Ulaimo ne Nachala nanyongecha yana? Kabhele nanipapila mwana munalome mughoe gwake!”<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Ichaka ngajhendilila kukola na lichiko lyalekichwa kujhonga, Ulaimo ngatenda unyagho nkolongwa.<verse eid="GEN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ajile itenda kubhengwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Lichiko limo Sala ngammona Ichumaile mwana jwa Ulaaimo jwabhelwike na Ajile Mmichile, akikina na Ichaka mwana mundo. <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />Peniya Sala ngannobholila Ulaimo, “Mummenge mmanda ojho pamo na mwana mundo. Ichindikine mwana jwa mmanda kubhujhii pamo na mwana gwango Ichaka.” <verse eid="GEN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Kilebhe chenie kikanhechwii hake Ulaimo nhwalo Ichumaile hele akibha mwana mundo. <verse eid="GEN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Nambo Chapanga ngannobholila Ulaimo, “Nkoto kuhechuka kwa nhwalo jha mwana ojho hilu mmanda gwino mwikeghe. Kilebhe chochoha chapakunnobholela Sala, mukihenge. Nhwalo kupete Ichaka namma na kibheluko chino ngita chininaghila. <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Na kunhwalo jwa mwana jwa mmanda gwino mwikeghe nanimmeka abhe na yana twe na kubhehe kilambo kikolongwa nhwalo jhono hele ndi mwana gwino.”<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Kilabho jhake putepute Ulaimo ngatola chakulya na lidengo lya mache ngampila Ajile na kuntweka pilibhegha, ngannobholila mmoke pamonga na mwana gwino. Ajile ngabhoka, ngabhila atindilatindila munjenga jha Beli Cheba. <verse eid="GEN 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Kwenio kunjenga paghajhomwikila mache mulidengwane, Ajile nganng'oneka mwana mundo panhwile pahe jha nkongo. <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />Jwene ngajhema kutale ngatama kulipa kwake ngita mita miya jhimo na kone akilongolila umwojho, “Mbaha ngota kulola mwanango akiwagha.” Pakibha atamike peniya mwana ngalela kanonoya.<verse eid="GEN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Chapanga ngajhoa mwana jhono akilela na ntumiche jwa kunane kwa Chapanga ngankema Ajile kubhoke kunane na kunkonya, “Malola ghino nike Ajile? Mangapwelela, Chapanga ajhoine lilobhe lya mwana kwenio kwabhile. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Nnyeme na mwinyinule mwana na mupaghate maha mu mabhoko gwino, nhwalo mbakuntenda abhehe yana twe na abhehe tate jwa kilambo kikolongwa.” <verse eid="GEN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Chapanga ngahyeku miho Ajile, na jwenie ngakibhona kilibha. Ngajhenda kutweleya mache mulidengwane, peniya ngankengita mwana mundo. <verse eid="GEN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Chapanga ngabhila pamonga na mwana jwenio, ngajhendilila kukola. Na jwenio ngatama panjenga na akibha nhyema jwamaha kwa kutumii upende. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Akibha atamita panjenga jha Palane na majhe mundo ngapakiya mwikeghe kubhoka mu kilambo chuku Michile kupala antolele.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilaghano panakate jha Ulaimo na Abimeleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Kipinde chenio Abimeleke pamonga na Fikone nkolongwa jwa akakomana ngondo bhake, ngabhajhenda kwa Ulaimo na kunnobholela, “Chapanga abhii pamo na mwenga mu kila kilebhe chimuhenga. <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Yene unapile kwa liina lya Chapanga kubhehe ungolo jhe nenga andajhe yanango amu ibheluko yango. Anda ne chimii jwahobholeka kwino mwenga, na mwe hele mme mihobholeka kwango nenga na mu kilambo chimutama.”<verse eid="GEN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Ulaimo ngalongila, “Ndenda kulapila.”<verse eid="GEN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Kipende cheneche Ulaimo kita apelike maghonga ghake gha kukokoleka nhwalo gha kilibh chibhampokitwa na akatumiche bhake Abimeleke. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Abimeleke ngalongila, “Nenga niumanyi jhe jwatei gheniya, mpaka deleno jhino mwe unongoli jhe, wala nenga nanajhoa jhe malobhe gweniya ade ngohe.” <verse eid="GEN 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Bhahe, Ulaimo ngantola limbelele pamonga na ng'ombi ngampila Abimeleke na bhoha bhabhele ngabhapekita lilaghano. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Ulaimo ngahaghu mambelele chaba ghankolo. <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />Abimeleke ngankonya Ulaimo, “Nhwalo gwa nike mihaghuu mambelele ghankolo chaba?”<verse eid="GEN 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Ulaimo pajhangwila, “Ntole mambelele ghanga chaba ghankolo, nimpe mwenga kwa mabhoko ghango namwete kulangii kubhehe nenga ndi jhuhembita kilibha chenje.” <verse eid="GEN 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Yene, kilibha chenio ngabhakemita Beli Cheba, mana jhake bhoha bhabhele bhakalapiline peniya.<verse eid="GEN 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Bhahe, ngabhateila lilaghano ku Beli Cheba, Abimeleke na Pikone, nkolongwa jwa akakomana ngondo, ngabhokita na kubhujha mu kilambo cha Akafilichite. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Ulaimo ngapanda nkongo gwa nkwajho kwenio ku Beli Cheba, pajhomolila ngannyinamila Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Ulaimo ngatama machiko twe mu kilambo cha Akafilichite.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga annyighanikiya Ulaimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Pikipetita kipinde kichoko, Chapanga nganyigha Ulaimo. Ngankema Ulaimo, “Ulaimo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:1">Jwene ngajhekita, “Iye, mikujhoa.”<verse eid="GEN 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />Chapanga ngannobholila, “Muntole mwana gwino Ichaka, mwana gwino jwakanjika jwapamwojho, nnyende ade ku kilambo chuku Moliya, mukapiye litambiko lyukukomelekeya panane jha kitombe chimba kunangiya.”<verse eid="GEN 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Kilabho jhake, ngajhimuka putepute, ngalenganikiya liponda lyake ngabhatola akatumiche bhake bhabhele pamonga na mwana mundo Ichaka. Ngatina hanjo yukutinikiya litambiko lyenio, kubhoke peniya ngatumbu mwanja kujhenda chehemo jhanangii Chapanga. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Mulichiko lya utato, Ulaimo ngajhinu miho ngabhona chehemo jhene chukutale, <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />ngabhalobholila akatumiche bhake bhala, “Unende pamba pamonga na liponda nenga na mwanango ojho tujhenda ade palongolo kunnyinamila Chapanga, peniya natubhujha pamba.”<verse eid="GEN 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Bhahe, Ulaimo ngatola hanjo hela, na ngantweka mwana mundo Ichaka. Jwene ngatola mwotu na kihembe mu lubhoko, ngabhalongoina pamonga. <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Ichaka ngankonya tate mundo, “Ma tate!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Tate mundo ngajhekita, “Nnonge bho mwanango.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Ichaka palongila, “Mwotu na hanjo tunkwete, bho, limbelele lya litambiko lya litambiko lyukukomelekeya abhii kojhe?”<verse eid="GEN 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Ulaimo ngajhangwila, “Mwanango, Chapanga jwene natupela limbelele lya litambiko lya kukomelekeya.” Peniya ngabhajhendilila na mwanja gwabhe.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Pubhaikita chehemo jhanaghila Chapanga, Ulaimo ngachenga kachangwale kanyahinyahi nu kubheka hanjo panane jhake. Peniya ngantabha Ichaka mwana mundo na kung'onecha panane jha hanjo ibhii panane jha kachangwale kanyahinyahi. <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Ulaimo ngatondobhe lubhoko lwake, ngatola kihembe kupala kunchinja mwana mundo. <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Nambo ntumiche jwa kunane kwa Chapanga jwa Bhambo Chapanga, ngankema kubhoke kunane, “Ulaimo, Ulaimo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Ulaimo ngajhekita, “Nenga, mikujhoa!”<verse eid="GEN 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Ntumiche ngannobholila, “Mangankocholana jhe mwana gwino hilu kuntenda kilebhe chochoha! Ngohe manye kubhehe undembekeya Chapanga, nhwalo mwinhibhiliki jhe mwana gwino jwakanjika.”<verse eid="GEN 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Peniya, Ulaimo ngajhinula miho, ngalibhona limbelele lyankambako, manyelo ghake ghatangii pakiheghejha. Ngajhenda kulitola limbelele lyenio ngalipiita litambiko lya kukomelekeya chehemo jha mwana mundo. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Yene, Ulaimo ngapakema chehemo jhene, “Chapanga napiya,” ade deleno bhando bhilonge, “Pakitombe cha Bhambo bhando upelwa.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Ntumiche jwa Bhambo Chapanga ngankema Ulaimo kabhele, kubhoke kunane, <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />ngannobholila, “Bhambo Chapanga alonge yene, ‘Napile kwa liina lyango namwene kubhehe ndei yene, hilu unyimite jhe mwana gwino jwakanjika, <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />chakaka mbakumpe mota na ibheluko ino naibhaha twe anda ndondo yukunane na anda ncheke gwa kumbwane. Ibheluko ino naibhatola miche jha akamakoko bhabhe na kwitenda miche jhabhe. <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />Kubhoke mu ibheluko ino ilambo yoha pannnema naipata mota kwa nhwalo mwenga ntembekii chela chininobholila.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Ulaimo ngabhabhujhii akatumiche bhake, bhoha pamonga ngabhabhujhita ku Beli Cheba. Ulaimo ngatama kwenio ku Beli Cheba.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yana ya Naole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />Pughapetita gheniya, Ulaimo ngajhoa kubhehe, Milika hele ampapii Naole, unung'una mundo, yana inalome. <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />Mwana jwalitibho jwa Naole, Uchi, Buzi unung'una mundo, Kemwele tate mundo Alamo. <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />Kechede na Acho na Pilidachi na Yilidafu na Betuele. <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />Betuele ngampapa Lebeka. Milika ngampapila Naole, unung'una mundo Ulaimo, yana nane. <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Kabhele, Leuma, kilaghe cha Naole hele ngampapipla yana, Teba na Gaamo na Taachi na Maaka.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s">Kuwe kwa Sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Sala ngatama yaka miya jhimo na makome mabhele na chaba. Jhene ndi yaka yatamita Sala. <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />Ajhomokila kwenio Kiliati Aluba, yane ku Ebulone kilambo chuku Kaanane. Ulaimo ngannelila na ngabheka matanga kwa nhwalo jha nhwanamundo Sala.<verse eid="GEN 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Ulaimo ngaleka malelo gha nhwanamundo na kujhenda kulonge na Akahite ngabhalobholila, <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />“Nenga nitama anda naghene panakate jhino. Nijhopa unjuluchile chehemo jha kuchikila.”<verse eid="GEN 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Akahite ngabhanyangwila, <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />“Mwe anahota bhito mutujhokanikiye, mwenga makilongoche makolongwa hake panakate jhito, makachike aanabhino chehemo jhojhoha pimpakuhaghula, abhii jhe mundo pamba jwapakunnyima chehemo pukuchikila, amu kunhibhikiya kunchika nhwana gwino.”<verse eid="GEN 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Peniya Ulaimo ngajhema na kulita kwa ichima palonge jha bhando bha kilambo cha Akahite, <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />ngalongila, “Anda chakaka nnyeketile nachike aanabhango, chonde nijhopa makanyopele kwa Epolone mwana jwa Choale, <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />anjuluchile linkwembe lyake lya Makapela lilibhii kumpaka gwa nng'onda gwake. Mumpembelekeye anjuluchile palonge jhino chehemo jhene kwa bei jhapala, na nenga naniitenda kubhehe makabule ghango.”<verse eid="GEN 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Jwene Epulone akibha panakate jha Akahite bhibhakibha peniya pibhakonganike pannyango gwa kujhingilila muche gwenio. Yene, Epulone Mhite nganyangwila Ulaimo palonge jha bhando bhoha pannyango gwenio, <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />“Nai jhe manahota. Chonde unnyokanikiye. Nimpe nng'onda gwoha pamonga na nkwembe ghubhii mwenio, kabhele nimpe palonge jha akajhango. Machike mwenio aanabhino.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Ulaimo ngalita kabhele kwa ichima palonge jha Akahite, <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />ngannobholila Epulone kongo bhando bhoha bhakijhoa, “Chonde ninnyopa unyokanikiye. Mbakunnepa nhilimila bei jha nng'onda gwino, nijhopa mupokele malepo ghanga kupala nachike aanabhango.”<verse eid="GEN 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Epulone nganyangwila Ulaimo kubhehe, manahota, unyokanikiye, <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />“Nng'onda ghubhii na bei jha ipande ya feza miya incheche tu ndi kilebhe ghane panakate jhino na nenga? Makachike aanabhino.” <verse eid="GEN 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Ulaimo ngabhakung'ilana na Epulone, ngampemela kwa ipande miya ncheche ya madine ya feza palonge jha Akahite bhoha, ipande miya ncheche ya madine gha feza ngita kipemo bhadno bhibhachulwicha kwa machiko gheniya.<verse eid="GEN 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Bhahe, nng'onda gwa Epulone ghukibha ku Makapela, kwa upande kulihumii lyobha mwa Mamule mikwembe na mikongo jhoha jhikibha mung'onda gwenio ngabhampila na kubhehe lyake, <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />Ulaimo palonge jha Akahite bhoha bhubhakongine pannyango gwa kujhingilila muche gwenio.<verse eid="GEN 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Pughajhomwikila gheniya, Ulaimo nganchika nhwanamundo munkwembe gwenio ghubhii mung'onda gwa Makapela, upande ghulihumii lyobha mwa Mamule, mana jhake ku Ebulone, kukilambo chuku Kaanane. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Yene, Akahite ngabhampila Ulaimo nng'onda ghola ghukibha lyabhe kupala nchike mwenio nhwanamundo.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s">Ichaka itole mwikeghe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Ulaimo akibha aghogholwike hake. Bhambo ngampila mota mu ilebhe yoha. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Lichiko limo Ulaimo ngannobholila ntumiche jwake jwakibha aghogholwike hake kupeta bhange bhoha najwenio ndi jwajhemelela ilebhe yoha, ngalonge, “Chonde mmeke lubhoko lwino kue jha libhondo lyango. <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />Na mwenga nnapile kwa liina lya Bhambo, Chapanga jhukunane na jwa pannema, kubhehe mangantola jhe manango na kujhenda kuntolekecha achikabhale bha Akakaanane bhindama nabho. <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />Nambo nnyende ade mu kilambo chimelwikilwe kwenio mukampalikiya mwikeghe manango Ichaka kakalongo bhango.”<verse eid="GEN 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Ntumiche jwenio ngalonge, “Pangejhe mwikeghe jwenio ajheketii jhe kulongoana nanenga kuika ku kilambo chenje, bho nimpeleka mwana gwino mu kilambo chinhumila?”<verse eid="GEN 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Ulaimo ngajhangwila, “Nai jhe! Mme miho mangamujhicha jhe manango ku kilambo chenio. <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />Bhambo, Chapanga jwa kunane jwamoita kwa tate gwango mu kilambo chimelwikilwe, na jwenio jwalonge nanenga napila kulonge, naipela ibheluko yango kilambo chenje. Chapanga jwenio nantuma ntumiche gwake annongolele kupala annetele mwana gwango mwikeghe kubhoke kwenio. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Anda mwikeghe jwenio akanite kulongoana na mwenga bhahe, kulapii kwango kuntabha jhe, nambo ikabhiibhole mwanango mangamujhicha jhe kwenio.” <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Peniya ntumiche jhola ngabheka lubhoko lwake palibhondo lyu Ulaimo, munahota gwake, ngalapii kwa nhwalo gwenio.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Pena ndi ntumiche jhola ngatola ngamiya kome ya nahota gwake ngabhoka kongo abhii na hupo twe yukuhalala. Ngajhenda ku muche chitamita Naole kwenio mu kilambo chuku Mechipotaniya. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Paika kwenio ngatamika makilikite ngamiya yake pahina na kilibha chikibhii panja na muche. Ikibha kimiye kipinde cha akakeghe bhijhenda kukilibha kuteka mache. <verse eid="GEN 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Peniya ntumiche jhola ngannyopa kulonge, “Mwe, ma Bhanbo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa anahota bhango Ulaimo, nninyopa nhotoye deleno na matendele ghambone anahota bhango Ulaimo. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Nnole! mmi pamba pahina jha kilibha pibhaika achikabhale bha akolo muche kuteka mache. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Nyopa yene, kamwale jhumbakunobhole atole lidengwane lyake lya mache ambe mache anyweghe, na jwenio kamwale ambii mache nywile pamonga na kughaikengha ngamiya yango, bhahe, jwenio abhe ndi jhunihaghulii ntumiche gwino Ichaka. Kilebhe chenio nakilangiya kubhehe muntendii ghambone anahota bhango.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Jwenio pakibha anajhomole jhe kujhopa, papa ngaika Lebeka bite Betuele mwana jwa Milika, nhwanamundo Naole, nnongomundo Ulaimo, ngaika kongo agheghite lidengwane lyake lyukuteke mache palibhegha. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Kamwale jwenio akibha lembulembu hake kabhele akibha anagholoka jhe na munalome. Jwenio ngaelila pakilibha ngatwele mache mu lidengwane lyake ngakitweka nu kubhoka. <verse eid="GEN 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Peniya ntumiche jhola ngajhenda kajhombe kukongana nako ngalonge, “Chonde nanjii umbe mache nywe kubhoke mulidengwane lino.”<verse eid="GEN 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Kamwale ngalonge, “Ajha unyweghe manahota bhango.” Papa ngatola lidengwane lyake kachoko kone haukamulii kupala, ankenga. <verse eid="GEN 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Pajhomolila kunkenga kamwale ngalonge, “Helahela nanighakenga mache ngamiya ino inyweghe ade ikole.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Peniya ngajhombiana, ngajhakina mache muchombo chukunywele inyama, ngajhombiana kujhenda kuteka ghange mache ku kilibha na kuikenga ngamiya yoha. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Mundo jwenio ngannolikiya ndwii changalonge kilebhe, kupala amanye anda kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga ajhojwiye mwanja gwake amu ajhojwii jhe.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Ngamiya piikolita kunywe mache, mundo jwenio ngampila kamwale jwenio pete jha chaabo bei ngolongwa hake na bangile ibhele ngolongolo ya chaabo ya bei ngolongwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />Ngankonya, “Chonde unobholele mwe mabite mene? Bho, kibhii chumbe chukugholoka twenga kajhino?”<verse eid="GEN 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Lebeka ngajhangwila, “Ne nabite Betuele, mwana jwa Milika nhwanamundo Naole.” <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Ngajhendilila kulonge, “Kajhito ghabhii manyahe na chehemo jha kuchungii inyama na chehemo jhukugholoka akaghene.”<verse eid="GEN 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Peniya mundo jhola ngajhinamicha muto gwake, ngannyinamila Chapanga, <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />ngalonge, “Alombwe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa anahota bhango Ulaimo, jwenio alangiye upalo gwake nu kuhobholeka kwake kwa anahota bhango. Bhambo anongwiye ade kwa kakalongo bha anahota bhango.”<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Peniya kamwale jhola ngabhutuka lubhelo ade kwakalongo bha majhe mundo kwalobhole nhwalo gwenio. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />Lebeka akibha nhwachamundo jwakemitwa Labane. Labane ngabhutwika lubhelo kujhenda kukilibha kukongana na mundo jwenio. <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />Labane ngalubhona lupete na bangile ibhele mu lubhoko lwa nnombo mundo Lebeka, nu kujhoa ilebhe yachimulila kwa nhwalo jha mundo jwenio. Labane ngankolila mundo jwenio ajhemite pamonga na ngamiya yake pahina jha kilibha. <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Labane ngannobholila mundo jhola, “Nhwike ukajha mwe jhumii na mota ya Bhambo. Nhwalo gwa nike mijhema panja? Nenga nenganikiye pukopomolela mwenga pamonga na ngamiya ino.”<verse eid="GEN 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Peniya ntumiche jwa Ulaimo jhola ngajhenda ukajha kwa Labane. Na Labane ngaulwiya mihigho mungamiya ngaipila manyahe kulye na ngampila ntumiche jwenio mache ghukugholo magholo ghake pamonga na bhando bhake. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Ngabhantelikila chakulya nambo jwenio ngalonge, “Nilye ote jhe ade nongele chanhikila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:33">Labane ngalonge, “Ajha, tulobholela.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Mundo jhola ngalonge, “Ne natumiche jwa Ulaimo.” <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" />“Bhambo Chapanga ampii mota mbwe anahota bhango, na jwenio abhii mundo jhuna ilebhe mbwe hake. Ampii malongo gha mambelele na mbuhe na ng'ombi na madine gha feza na madine gha chaabo, akatumiche akakeghe na akatumiche akanalome na ngamiya na maponda! <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Sala nhwana jwa anahota bhango, mughohe gwake akampapii munahota mwana munalome, na munahota jwenio ngampila mwana jwenio ilebhe yake yoha. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Munahota gwanga nganapicha nenga kwa kulonge, ‘Nangantolekecha jhe kangombo gwango kwa kamwale Nkakaanane bhindama mu kilambo chabhe. <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />Nambo nnyende ade ku kilambo chango kwa akalongo bha tate gwango kupala mukampalikiya mwikeghe mwanango Ichaka.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Nanenga nganinkonyita munahota gwango, ‘Naibha bho, anda kamwale jwenio akanite kulongoana nane kuika kongone?’ <verse eid="GEN 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />Nambo jwenio ngajhangwila kulonge, ‘Bhambo Chapanga jwalongwiya ughome gwango, ndi jhojho nantuma ntumiche gwake jwa kunane alongoane na mwenga kupala antangatile umwanja gwino. Na mwenga mukammupalikiya mwanango mwikeghe kubhoke kwa akalongo mundo na umuche gwa tate gwango. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Anda nhwikite kwa akalongo bhango na kumpe jhe mwikeghe jwenio bhahe kulapii kwango kuntabha jhe.’<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />“Deleno puhikita pakilibha nyakunnyopa, ‘Mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa ananhota bhango Ulaimo, ninnyopa ghabhehe tela ghoha ghinhikilila deleno. <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Nenga nyemite pamba pahina na kilibha. Kamwale jwapakuika kuteka mache na jwenio naninnyopa mache ghandina ghunywegha kubhoka mu lidengwane lyake, <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />na jwenio ata ambii na kughateke mache ngamiya yango, jwenio ndi abha jhumuhagwile kubhehe mwikeghe jwa mwana jwa ananhota bhango.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />Nukujhomole jhe kujhopa kwango, papa Lebeka ngaika na lidengwane lyake palibhegha, ngaele pikilibha kuteka mache. Nanenga nganinobholila, ‘Chonde nanjii umbe mache nyweghe.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />Na jwenio ngatenda kajhombe kutola lidengwane kubhoke mu libhegha lyake nukulonge, ‘Ajha unyweghe, manahota bhango. Nanatekela mache na kughakenga hele ngamiya ino.’ Bhahe, nganywila na ngamiya yango ngaipila mache hele. <verse eid="GEN 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />Peniya nganinkonya, ‘Mwe mabite mene?’ Nganyangwila, ‘Nenga nabite Betuele mwana jwa Milika, aana bha Naole.’ Ndi pinimpila lupete na kuhwalicha bangile mu lubhoko lwake. <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Peniya nganitita na kunyinamila Bhambo Chapanga. Nganinomba Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa ananhota bhango Ulaimo, ndi jwenio jwannongwiye chomola ade kwa kamwale jwa lukolo lwa ananhota bhango na nhwalo jwa mwana mundo Ichaka. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Ngohe, unobholele anda nnyeketile kwatendela ananhota bhango ghambone na ghighapalwa palonge jha Bhambo anda jhe nane namanya chakutenda.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Kubhoke pukujhoa gheniya, Labane na Betuele ngabhajhanga, “Kilebhe chenje kihumii kwa Bhambo Chapanga, twenga tupalwa jhe kulonge kilebhe chochoha. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Lebeka jhonjo pamba, muntole nnyende nako. Na abhe nhwana jwa mwana jwa ananhota bhino andi hela Bhambo Chapanga chalongila.” <verse eid="GEN 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Ntumiche jwa Ulaimo jhola pajhoina malobhe gheniya, ngalita ade pahe na kunnomba Bhambo. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Peniya ntumiche jwa Ulaimo jhola, ngapiya ilebhe ya kukilembelekeya itengenichwe kwamadine gha feza na madine gha chaabo pamonga na ngobho ngampila Lebeka. Hele ngabhapila akalongo mundo Lebeka na majhe mundo ilebhe twe ya bei ngolongwa.<verse eid="GEN 24:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Ntumiche jwa Ulaimo pamonga na bhando bhubhakibha peniya ngabhalila nukunywelekeya nukugholoka kwenio. Pibhajhimuka lukela, ntumiche jhola palongila, “Nanjii nyopa ngelebhuke kanahota bhango.”<verse eid="GEN 24:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Nambo akaachamundo na pamonga na majhe mundo ngabhajhangwila, “Munneke kamwale atame na twenga machiko kome amu kupeta gheniya, peniya nnyendengana.”<verse eid="GEN 24:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Nambo ntumiche jwenio ngalonge, “Chonde manganjeluu jhe kubhoka, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga alenganikiye mwanja gwango, ninnyopa ngelebhuke kanahota bhango.”<verse eid="GEN 24:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Nabhene ngabhalonge, “Deka, tunkeme jwene kamwale, tunkonye, tunyohe nalongela nike.” <verse eid="GEN 24:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Yene, ngabhankema Lebeka nukunkonya, “Bho, nanyenda na mundo ojhojho?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Na jwene ngalonge, “Ena, nanyenda nako.”<verse eid="GEN 24:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Bhahe, jwannelita Lebeka nnongo mundo ajhende na pamonga na ntumiche jwa Ulaimo na bhando bhake. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Peniya ngannyopila mota Lebeka kwa kulonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">“Mwe malombo bhito, mme majhe ya mbwe yangabhalangika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">Kibheluko chino bhatola miche jha akamakoko bhabhe, nakubhehe jhabhe.”<verse eid="GEN 24:60" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Peniya Lebeka na akabhanda bhake akakeghe ngabhaobhikila ngamiya na kunkengima ntumiche jwa Ulaimo, na bhoha ngabhabhokita.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Kipinde chenio, Ichaka akibha abhokite kwenio ku Beli Lailoi ngabhila atamita upande gwa lubhoko lwangejha mwa kilambo chaku Kaanane. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Lichiko limo kimiye, Ichaka ngajhenda kumighonda kuwachii ilebhe kwenio ngaibhona ngamiya ikaika. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Na Lebeka pammonita Ichaka, ngaulwika pahe kubhoke pangamiya jhola, <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />nu kunkonya ntumiche jwa Ulaimo jhola, “Jwajho meneke, jwatyanga munng'onda, jwaika kutupokela?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">Ntumiche jhola ngajhanguu kulonge, “Ndi ananhota bhango.” Bhahe, Lebeka ngatola ngobho na kukipuka kumiho kwake.<verse eid="GEN 24:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Ntumiche jhola nganchimulila Ichaka ghoha ghighatendika kwenio. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Bhahe, Ichaka nganyingiya Lebeka mu kichimba chichikibha cha Sala, majhe mundo, ngabhila nhwanamundo. Ichaka ngampala hake Lebeka, yene Lebeka ngampepicha Ichaka kwa kujhomokelwa kwa majhe mundo.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s">Ibheluko henge ya Ulaimo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:32-33">1 Ngongu 1:32-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Ulaimo ngatolela jhonge mwikeghe, liina lyake akemitwa Ketula. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Ketula ngampapila Ulaimo yana mahina ghabhe ndi ghanga, Chimulane na Yokichane na Medane na Midiane na Ichibake na Chua <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Yokishane ngapapa mwana Sheba na Dedane, yana ya Dedane ikibha Akashulu na Akaletuchi na Akaleumi. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Yana ya Medane ikibha Efa na Efeli na Enoke na Abida na Elida. Chenio kikibha ndi kibheluko cha Ketula.<verse eid="GEN 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Ulaimo ngampila Ichaka kila kilebhe chakibha nacho. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Nambo yana inalome yapapii mu kilaghe, ngaipila hupo, kipinde pakibha ghome, na ngaipelika yana yene mu kilambo chikibhii upande kulihumii lyobha, kutale na Ichaka mwana mundo.<verse eid="GEN 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwe kwa Ulaimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Ulaimo ngalama yaka miya jhimo na makome chaba nhwano. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Ajhomwika pakubhoke mukutama yaka twe na inamota, pajhomwika ngakongina na akahoko mundo bhibhalongolile. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Ichaka na Ichumaile yana ya Ulaimo, ngabhanchika tate gwabhe mu linkwembe lya Makipela, lilibhii pahina na Mamule mung'onda ghukibha gwa Epulone mwana gwa Chohale Mhite. <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />Ulaimo akaemii nng'onda gwenio kubhoka kwa Akahite. Kwenio ndi kwachikwite Ulaimo na Sala nhwanamundo. <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Ulaimo pajhomwika, Chapanga ngampila mota Ichaka mwana mundo. Ichaka atamita pahina na kilibha cha Beli Lailoi, mana jhake jwajho jwabhii ghome jwalola.<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibheluko ya Ichumaile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:28-31">1 Ngongu 1:28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Henge ndi ibheluko ya Ichumaile mwana jwa Ulaimo, jwabhelwike kwa Ajile Mmichile, jwakibha mmanda mwikeghe jwa Sala. <verse eid="GEN 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Ghanga ndi mahina ghabhe kulongohana na chibhabhelwike, Nabeyote ndi mwana jwa litibho na Kedele na Adibele na Mibuchamo, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />Mishima na Duma na Macha, <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />Adade na Tema na Yetule na Nafiche na Kedema. <verse eid="GEN 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Henge ndi yana inalome ya Ichumaile ikibha chembwe cha makabila kome na mabhele. Itamo na chenda yabhe imanyikina kwa mahina ghabhe. <verse eid="GEN 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Ichumaile pajhomwika akibha na yaka miya jhimo na makome matato na chaba, na jwenio ngagholwika pamonga na akahokomundo. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Ibheluko ya Ichumaile itamita panakate jha Hawila na Shuli upande kulihumii lyobha gwa kilambo chuku Michile kujhendelela ku Achulu. Bhatamita njelembo na ibheluko henge ya Ulaimo.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhelukwa kwa Yakobu na Echau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Henge ndi ibheluko ya Ichaka mwana jwa Ulaimo. <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Ichaka pakibha na yaka makome ncheche ngatolana na Lebeka, bite Betuele jwa likabila lya Mwalamo, jhuku muche gwa Padane Alamo, Lebeka akibha nnombo mundo Labane. <verse eid="GEN 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Lebeka akibha ntonga, yene Ichaka ngannyopa Bhambo Chapanga, na jwenio Bhambo ngajhoa lujhopo lwake, Lebeka ngabhila na ndumbo. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Ndumbo jhenio ikibha jha mabhela. Yana yenio ngaitaungana mulutumbo lwa Lebeka na jwenio ngalonge, “Anda naha ndi chiibhile, kulama kilebhe ghane?” Peniya ngajhenda kunkonya Chapanga.<verse eid="GEN 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />Na Chapanga ngannobholila Lebeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">“Ilambo ibhele ibhii mulutumbo lwino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">makabila mabhele ghipakupapa mwenga naghakomana</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Limo nalibhaha na likakala kupeta lenge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">nkolo nantumukila unung'una mundo.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Machiko ghake gha kupapa pighabhandikila, Lebeka ngapapa mabhela. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Jhukutumbula akibha nkele na yegha jhoha ikajhenii majhunjo, yene ngankema liina lyake Echau. <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Na jhuubhele pabhelwika kongo ankamwii kiinginilo Echau, ngabhankema liina lyake Yakobu. Ichaka akibha na yaka makome chita kipinde Echau na Yakobu pibhabhelwika.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Echau achulucha ukolo gwake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Yana yenio ngaukola, Echau akibha jwakuyema jwamaha. Jwapalita hake kutyangatyanga kumanayahe. Yakobu akibha jwanuu, jwapalita kutama pakajha. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Yene, Ichaka ngampala hake Echau nhwalo gwa kulye ipika yukumanyahe nambo Lebeka ngampala Yakobu.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Lichiko limo, Yakobu pakibha atelika ngonde, Echau pabhujhita mukuyema ngaika pakajha kongo abhii na njala hake. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Echau ngannobholila Yakobu, “Ne nhwe njala, chonde umbongolele mito nhope.” Ndi nhwalo bhankema liina lya Edomo, mana jhake nkele.<verse eid="GEN 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Yakobu ngajhangwila, “Unjuluchila ote ukolo gwino yane kutumbu kubhelukwa kwino.”<verse eid="GEN 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Echau palongela, “Tela! Ne mandikii kuhwe ilebhe yoha imbakupata nhwalo gwa kutumbuu kubhelekwa kwango, imba kundangatii nike?”<verse eid="GEN 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Yakobu palongila, “Unapii ote.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 25:33">Bhahe, Echau nganapila na kunchuluchii ukolo gwake kubhehe jhukutumbula. <verse eid="GEN 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Yene, Yakobu ngampila Echau libumunda na ngonde. Ngalila, nganywe, peniya ngakijhendila. Yene ndi Echau chaupuchita ukolo gwake ghukutumbula kubhelukwa.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s">Ichaka ahamii ku Gelale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Peniya ngaipitila njala mu kilambo chenio, njala jhenio ikibha ngolongwa kupeta njala jhipitila kipinde cha ughome gwa Ulaimo. Ichaka ngajhenda ku muche gwa ku Gelale kwa Abemileke munahota nkolongwa jwa Akafiliste. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Bhambo Chapanga ngampitii Ichaka nu kunnobholela, “Mangajhenda jhe ku Michile, nambo ntama mu kilambo chimbakunnobholela. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Ntama mu kilambo chenio kwa machiko ghandina, nane nama pamonga na mwenga nukumpe mota. Mana mbakumpe mwenga na ibheluko ino ilambo yenio yoha. Mbakulenganikiya lilaghano linabheka na tate gwino Ulaimo. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Mbakujhonjekeya ibheluko ino ibhaha mbwe ngita ndondo ya kunane kwa Chapanga na kwape ilambo henge yoha. Kubhoke mu ibheluko ino ilambo yoha pannema naibhaha na mota. <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />Mbakumpe mota, nhwalo Ulaimo akatembekii na kunyokanikiya na ngakamwila malaghalikilo ghango na mihilo jhango.”<verse eid="GEN 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Peniya Ichaka ngatama ku muche gwa ku Gelale. <verse eid="GEN 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />Bhando bha ku Gelale pubhankonya panane jha nhwanamundo ngalonge, “Bheniya alombo bhango.” Nhwalo ajhogwipa kulonge nhwanamundo, abhajhogwipa akolo muche kunkoma kwa nhwalo jha Lebeka, mana Lebeka akibha lembulembu hake. <verse eid="GEN 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Ichaka ngatamita pala machiko ghamahele, Abimeleke munahota nkolongwa jwa Akafiliste ngalingulii palidilicha ngammona Ichaka ankumbatii Lebeka nhwanamundo. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Abimeleke ngankema Ichaka na kulonge, “Aka aanabhino! Nhwalo gwa nike nnongila nnombo gwino?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:9">Ichaka ngalonge, “Nhwalo nyogwipa mangota naundenda kungoma na kuntola nhwana gwango.”<verse eid="GEN 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Abimeleke ngankonya, “Chenio ndi kilebhe ghane chimututendile? Jhumo jha bhando bhango ngahotwi kugholoka na nhwanagwino, kabhele ngamutujhingiye mu malemwa.” <verse eid="GEN 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Peniya Abimeleke ngalaghalikiya bhando bhoha kulonge, “Mundo jhojhoha jwapakunkunyu mundo ojho amu nhwanamundo, jhono nakomwa.”<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Chaka cheche Ichaka ngapanda mbejho mu kilambo chenio, ngauna mala miya chapandita, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga akampii mota. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />Ichaka ngabhila jhuna ilebhe mbwe. Ngachocha kubhehe na ilebhe mbwe hake. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Akibha na malongo gha mambelele na ng'ombi na akatumiche twe ade Akafiliste kummonela wiho. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Yene Akafilisite ngabhayelila ilibha yoha ya mache ibhahembita akatumiche bha Ulahimo, pala Ulahimo pakibha ghome.<verse eid="GEN 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Peniya Abimeleke ngannobholila Ichaka kubhehe, “Mmoke pakilambo chito, nhawalo mwe mutuchochite hake kwa makakala.” <verse eid="GEN 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Bhahe, Ichaka ngabhoka kwenio ngabheka kighono mululambo lwa Gelale. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Ichaka ngahembulina kabhele ilibha ikibha kipinde cha tate mundo Ulaimo pakibha ghome, ilibha ibhayelila Akafiliste kubhoke pukujhomoka Ulaimo. Ichaka ngaikema mahina ghagha gha tate mundo.<verse eid="GEN 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Yene akatumiche bha Ichaka ngabhaemba pa lulambo ngabhakolela mache. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Nambo akalucha bhuku Gelale ngabhang'aulina na akalucha bha Ichaka kwa kulonge, “Mache ghanga ndi ghito.” Yene Ichaka ngakikema kilibha chenio Eseki, mana jhake, “Kung'aulana.”<verse eid="GEN 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Akatumiche bha Ichaka ngabhahemba chenge kilibha, na chenio hele ngabhang'aulina, yene Ichaka ngakikema kilibha chenio Sitina, mana jhake, “Kung'aulana.” <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Bhahe, Ichaka ngabhoka peniya ngajhenda kuemba chenge kilibha chehemo jhenge. Nambo chenio ngabhang'auline jhe. Yene Ichaka ngakikema kilibha chenio, Leobote mana jhake pwache. Kulonge, “Ngohe Bhambo Chapanga atuleki pwache tukonde pa kilambo chenje.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Ichaka ngabhoka kwenio nu kujhenda ku muche gwa ku Belicheba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Kilo jhela Bhambo ngampitii nu kulonge, “Nenga Chapanga jwa tate gwino Ulaimo. Mangajhoghopa jhe, mi pamonga na mwenga, mbakumpe mota nu kujhonjekeya ibheluko ino kwa Lilaghano limekita na Ulaimo, ntumiche gwango.” <verse eid="GEN 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Yene Ichaka ngachenga kachangwale kamaghanga kakupiya litambiko kwenio nukunyinamila Bhambo Chapanga. Ngabheka kighono kwenio, na akatumiche bhake ngabhahemba kilibha chenge.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichaka na Abimeleke bhijhelana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Abimeleke pamonga na nkoche gwake Ausate na Fikole jwakibha nkomana ngondo nkolongwa ngabhabhoka ku Gelale, ngabhannyendila Ichaka. <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Ichaka ngabhakonya, “Mbone nhwikite kajhango, mangota mindenda kunjimwa na undei kumenga kwino?”<verse eid="GEN 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Bhene ngabhajhangwila, “Ngohe tumanye hotuhotu kubhehe Chapanga abhii pamonga na mwenga. Kwa yene tuwacha ngaibhii mbone tulapilane nu kubheka lilaghano, <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />kubhehe namutubhengwa jhe na twe helahela natumengwa jhe. Nambo ghumuntendi ghambone, ngatunneka nnyende kwa uteeke, changantenda kilebhe chochoha kibhoho mwe Bhambo Chapanga ampii mota.” <verse eid="GEN 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Ichaka ngabhantendila kaunyagho, na bhena ngabhalila nu kunywegha. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Kilabho jhake ngabhajhimuka putepute ngabhalapilina. Kubhoke peniya Ichaka ngabhachindikicha na kutabhukana kwa uteeke.<verse eid="GEN 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Lichiko lele akatumiche bha Ichaka ngabhaika nu kunnobholela nhwalo gwa kilibha chenio chibhaembita kubhehe, “Tughakolii mache!” <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Peniya Ichaka ngakikema kilibha chenio Shiba, mana jhake, “Kulapilana.” Yene muche gweno ukemwa Belicheba ade ngohe.<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akaanamundo Echau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Echau pahikicha yaka makome ncheche, ngatolela matala likabila lya Akaite, Yudithi bite Beli na Basemate bite Elone. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Akakeghe bheniya ngabhantenda utamo gwa Ichaka na Lebeka kubhehe mungolongonde.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s">Ichaka impekee mota Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Ichaka akibha kighogholo na miho ghake ghalolita jhe, ngankemita mwana mundo nkolo Echau ngannobholila, “Mwanango!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:1">Na jwene pajhangwila, “Ne pamba matate!”<verse eid="GEN 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Ichaka ngannobholila, “Dola ngohe nakighogholo manyiti jhe lichiko lya kunhwe kwango. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Ntole upende na mahonga ghino, nnyende kumapololo mukayeme kinyama. <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />Peniya undelekela chakulya chikinoghi, unetela nyakila, mbakumpeke mota mwenga nukuwe jhe.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Lebeka atehila kujhokanikiya, Ichaka palongila na mwana mundo. Echau pajhawila kunjenga kuyema, <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Lebeka ngannobholila mwana mundo Yakobu, Ninyohine tate gwino akilongela na nhwacha gwino Echau, <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />akilongila, Undelekela chakulya chikinogha nyakila, mbakumpeke mota palonge jha Bhambo nukuwe jhe. <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Lebeka ngajhendelila kulonge, “Ngohe mwanango, unyokanikiya maha na mughakamula ghala ghuninnobholela. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Ngohe nnyende mulilongo lya mbuhe mukatole matole mabhele ghighahatite, unetela nintelekela tate gwino chakulya chikinogha chela chakipala. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Peniya ntole chukulye chenio na mupelekela tate gwino alyeghe kupala ampela mota nukuwe jhe.”<verse eid="GEN 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Nambo Yakobu ngannobholila majhe mundo, “Majhe, mwe umanye kubhehe Echau abhii na majhunjo tyee yegha jhoha nambo ne ngwete jhe. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Naibhabhole tate gwango ambapiye? Anda amanye kubhee ndenda kunkopokeya nambela likoto, peniya nambela jhe mota.”<verse eid="GEN 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Majhe mundo pannobholila, “Mwanango, ngohe likoto lino lingolela nenga, mwe ntende chininaghalikiya. Kanetela mbuhe.” <verse eid="GEN 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Peniya Yakobu ngajhenda kutola mbuhe yene na kunnete majhe mundo, na majhe mundo ngatelika chakulya chikinogha chakipala hake tate mundo. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Bhahe, Lebeka ngatoila ngobho yamaha ya Echau, mwanamundo nkolo, ghughakibha unyumba, ngawalikiya mwanamundo Yakobu unung'una. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Lebeka ngatoila limbendela lya mbuhe ngabhilingila mu mabhoko na chehemo nyebhejhabho jha muntandala. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Peniya ngampila Yakobu chakulya chikinoghi chela na libumunda lyakalenganikiye.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Yakobu ngajhingila nkate na kukema, “Ma tate!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">Na jwenio pajhangwila, “Ne pamba mwanango! Mwe maghane?”<verse eid="GEN 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Yakobu panyangwila tate mundo, “Ne Naechau, mwana gwino jwa litibho. Ndehi ngita chiunaghalikiya. Chonde matate ntame nnyeghe kupala umbeke mota.”<verse eid="GEN 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Nambo Ichaka pankonyita, “Mwanango, mboni nnyombiine hake kupata kipeka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:20">Yakobu pajhangwila, “Nhwalo Bhambo, Bhambo Chapanga gwino andangatile.”<verse eid="GEN 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Peniya Ichaka pannobholila Yakobu, “Tela, mwanango heghelela pahina nimpapaye, manye chakaka kubhehe mwenga ndi ma Echau amu mwe ndeka.” <verse eid="GEN 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Yakobu ngabhandikila tate mundo, na jwene Ichaka ngampapiya na kulonge, “Milonge anda ma Yakobu nambo mabhoko ghanga ngita mabhoko gha Echau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Akaumanyite jhe kubhehe Yakobu nhwalo mabhoko ghake ghakibha na majhunjo tyee ngita gha nhwacha mundo Echau, yene ngapaila kumpe mota. <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />Ichaka pankonyita kabhena, “Bho, mwe ndi ma mwanango chakaka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">Yakobu pajhangwila, “Ndi nenga.”<verse eid="GEN 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Yene Ichaka ngannobholila, “Mwanango unete kipeka chene nyakile, nimpeke mota.” Yakobu pampelikila chakulya na jwene ngalila na helehela ngampila divaye nganywila. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Peniya tate mundo pannobholila Yakobu, “Mwanango, heghelela pahina jhango, ungumbatile.” <verse eid="GEN 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Bhahe, Yakobu panheghilila pahina tate mundo na kukumbatila, Ichaka pajhohina luumba lwa ngobho yake, ngampila mota kone alongila, “Dola, mwanango chiminungi mbone ngita luumba lwa nng'onda ghubhii na mota jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="GEN 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Ninnyopa Chapanga ankutulila mangame kuhumii kunane na nng'onda gwino ubhaha ghubholile! Mahuno na divaye innyolekela. <verse eid="GEN 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />Bhando bha pannema nabhantumikila, nabhantamila makilikite. Namalongocha akalongo bhino na yana ya majhe gwino nabhantamila makilikite. Bhando bhibhannyope likoto lyabhujhila bhene na jhola jwannyope mota na jwenio hele abha na mota!”<verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Echau ipembeke tate mundo ampe mota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Ichaka pajhomolila kumpe mota Yakobu, papa Yakobu pabhokita tugha kwa tate mundo na Echau ngahuma kuyema kumapololo. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Echau hele ngannenganikiya tate gwake chakulya chikinoghi na ngampelikila tate mundo na kunnobholela, “Ajha tate jhimuka nnyeghe kipeka chiniyemile, mbala umbe mota.”<verse eid="GEN 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Ichaka pankonyagha, “Mwe maghane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:32">Na jwene ngajhangwila, “Ne Naechau, mwana gwino nkolo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Ichaka ngalendema hake na ngalongila, “Ngohe ghane jhola jwayemita na kunnete kipeka? Nane nile kipeka mwe nakuhika jhe, nane ninumbile mota na chakaka abhi na mota.”<verse eid="GEN 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Echau pajhohina malobhe gha tate mundo ngalelita kanonoho kwa lipyanda. Peniya ngalongila, “Mwe matate bhango, chonde unumbii nane mota helahela!”<verse eid="GEN 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Nambo Ichaka panyangwila, “Unung'una gwino aikite kungolowa na atoi mota jhino.”<verse eid="GEN 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Echau palongila, “Ndi nhwalo akemwa Yakobu! Angolwiye pabhele, pukutumbula ngatola chehemo jhango jhukubhelukwa na ngohe atoii mota yango.” Peniya ngankonya tate mundo, “Bho, matate gwango ibhijhe mota jhango jhumekile?”<verse eid="GEN 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Ichaka pajhangwila, “Nyomwolile kuntenda Yakobu annongoche na kumpe akanung'una bhino kubhehe akatumiche bhake. Nimpekii mahuno na divaye. Ngohe nintendela nike ma mwanango?”<verse eid="GEN 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Echau ngannobholila tate gwake, “Bho, ma tate mwe nkwete jhe mota jhenge? Na nenga helahela tate nijhopa umbeke mota!” Peniya Echau ngalela kanonoha kwa lipyanda.<verse eid="GEN 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Peniya Ichaka palongila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">“Kitamo chino kibhaha kutale na pipabholile na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">mma kutale gha hula jha kunane kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="GEN 27:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />Nnama kwa kukoma kwino</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">na mutumikila unung'una gwino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">nambo anda nnkengelwike</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">nanongochwa jhe kabhele.”<verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Peniya Echau nganchimwa Yakobu nhwalo tate gwake akampi mota Yakobo. Echau ngawacha umwojho gwake, “Machiko gha matanga gha tate gwango ghabhandikile, peniya naninkoma unung'una gwango Yakobu.”<verse eid="GEN 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Nambo Lebeka akajhoine kilebhe chapai kuhenga Echau, ngankemita Yakobu unung'una nu kunnobholela, “Dola, nhwacha gwino Echau apala kunkoma. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Ngohe ma mwanango nhenge chininnobholela. Mmutukila kajhombe kwa nhwacha gwango Labane kola ku muche gwa ku Halane. <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />Ntame kwenio kwa machiko ghandina ade lilaka lya nhwacha gwino pulipakupola. <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />Lilaka lyake pulipakupola na kulibhilila ghumuntendi, nanintuma mundo ammujhiche ukajha. Nhwalo gwa nike nhwelwelwe na yana ibhele kwa lichiko limo?”<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichaka impeleka Yakobu kwa Labane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Lebeka ngannobholila Ichaka, “Njimwite kutama nhwalo gwa akakeghe bheniya Akahite. Anda Yakobu atolii akakeghe bha kilambo chenje, mwikeghe pakate jha akakeghe bhamba Akahite, nahangana jhe kujhendelela kubhehe ghome.”<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Yene ndi Ichaka ngankema Yakobu nganumbi mota, nganaghila nu kunnobholela, “Mangatole jhe mwikeghe jhojhoha kuhuma ku Kaanane. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Nnyende kajhombe ku muche gwa ku Padane Alamu, kajhake okogwino Betuele, makatolele panakate jha yana ya njomba gwino Labane. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Bhambo Chapanga Jhuna Makakala ampe mota mma na ibheluko mbwe na kujhonjekeka, kupala mma matate bha ilambo twee. <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Chapanga ampe mota mwenga na ibheluko hino anda hela champila mota Ulaimo, kupala mmujhila kilambo chimutama ngohe anda maghene, kilambo chenio Chapanga akampeki Ulaimo!” <verse eid="GEN 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Yene Ichaka ngantuma Yakobu na jwene ngajhenda ku Padane Alamu kwa Labane mwana jwa Batuele mundo jwa likabila lya Mwalami, nhwacha mundo Lebeka, majhe mundo Yakobu na Echau.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Echau itole mwikeghe jhonge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Echau pamanya kubhehe Ichaka ampii mota Yakobu na kuntuma ajhende kutolela mwikeghe ku Padane likabila lya Alamu na kuntenda pakibha ampii mota, ngankanikiya akoto kutolela mwikeghe kuhuma kukilambo cha ku Kaanane. <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />Helahela Yakobu ngamanya kubhehe abhajhokanikiya majhe mundo na tate mundo, ngajhenda ku Padane Alamu. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Echau ngamanya kubhehe Ichaka tate mundo abhapahi jhe akakeghe bha ku Kaanane. <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />Bhahe, Echau ngajhenda kujhonjeke mwikeghe jhonge, kwa Ichumaile mwana jwa Ulaamo, ngantolila Maalate bite Ichumaile, nnombo mundo Nebayote.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulote kwa Yakobu ku Betele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Yakobu ngabhoka ku Belicheba na kujhenda ku Halane. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Na Pahikita chehemo jhimo, ngabheka kighono nhwalo lyobha likibha litipike. Ngatoila lighanga limo lya chehemo jhene, ngateila nchaghamilo, ngagholwika. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />Ngalotila, na mu kulote kwenio ngaibhona ngache ijhemikwe kuhumii pannema ade kunane kwa Chapanga. Akatumiche bha kunane kwa Chapanga bhakibha bhahulwika na kukwela mungache jhenio. <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />Bhambo Chapanga akibha ajhemite mungache jhenio ngannobholila, “Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa tate gwino Ulaimo na Chapanga jwa Ichaka. Kilambo chinng'olwike cheno, mbakumpe mwenga na kibheluko chino. <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />Kibheluko chino nakibhaha twe ngita lutukunda lwa pannema. Nabhajhenela kila chehemo, upande kulitipiki lyobha na upande kulihumii lyobha na upande gwa kachekachine na upande gwa kuchine, kupete mwenga, na ibheluko hino na ilambo yoha pannema naibhaha na mota. <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Nkombokela machiko ghoha tubhii pamonga na mwenga, naninonda popoha pumujhenda na kumujhicha mu kilambo chino chenje. Nanineke jhe ade nenganikiye ghala ghininnobholila.”<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Yakobu pang'ang'anwika mulughono ngalongila, “Chakaka Bhambo Chapanga abhii pamba, nikamanyi jhe!” <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Yakobu ngajhogwipa nukulonge, “Jhojho pamba pajhogwiye hake! Nihola pamba ndi pakajha pa Chapanga na ndi ghutangala gwa kunane kwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Yakobu ngajhimuka putepute, ngatoila lighanga lela lyakatei nchaghamilo ngajhemika ngita luheke na kulijhelebhula kwa kulijhitii mahuta panane jhake. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Chehemo jhene ngapakema Betele, mana jhake Nyumba jha Chapanga, nambo liina lya muche gwenio limanyikina Luzu. <verse eid="GEN 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Peniya Yakobu ngalapila kulonge, “Mwe ma Chapanga anda mmi pamo nanenga na kunonda umwanja gwango, kongo umbekii yakulya na ngobho, <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />na anda mujhite kajha kwa tate gwango njelembo, mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga namma ndi ma Chapanga bhango. <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Lighanga lende linyemike pamba ngita luheke, nalibhaha ndi nyumba jhino mwe ma Chapanga jha kunnyinamila nanenga nambiya lipungu lya kome kuilebhe yoha yumbakumbela.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu iika pakajha kwa Labane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Yakobu ngajhendilila na mwanja gwake, ngaikita ku kilambo cha bhando kwa upande ghulihumii lyobha. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Kwenio ngakibhona kilibha kumanyahe, na paupele jhake ngaghabhona malongo matato gha mambelele ghagholwike. Mambelele gheniya ghanywila mache kubhoka pakilibha chenio chikiyekwililwe na lighanga likolongwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Malongo gha mambelele pighakongina peniya, bhibhalucha bhoha bhitenda kulibhilimbiya lighanga lyenio kubhoka pikilibha chenio kupala ghanywe mambelele ghabhe. Pibhajhomolila ughubikila pikilibha.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Yakobu ngabhakonya bhibhalucha bheniya, “Akalongo nhumii koo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:4">Ngabhajhangwila, “Tuhumii kumuche gwaku Alane.”<verse eid="GEN 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Jwenio ngankonya kabhele, “Mumanye Labane mwana gwa Naole?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:5">Ngabhajhangwila, “Hena, tummanye.”<verse eid="GEN 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Ngajhendilila kwakonya, “Bho, kubhii kunchela?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:6">Bhene ngabhajhangwila, “Kubhii kunchelela, nchikana gwabhe Lahele jwajho itenda kuika na mambelele ghake!”<verse eid="GEN 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Peniya Yakobu ngalongila, “Ngohe nola kuhumii muhi, kipinde chukughaleta mambelele jhe. Bhahe, mughanyweche mache mambelele, kubhoke peniya mukaghaluche.”<verse eid="GEN 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Nambo bheniye ngabhalongila, “Twe, tuhoto jhe kuhenga gheniya ade malongo ghoha ghabhehe pamonga, kupala tuhoto kubhilimbiya lighanga kutale na kilibha, peniya tughanywecha mache.”<verse eid="GEN 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Yakobu pajhendilila kulonge nabho bhibhalucha bheniya, Lahele ngaika na mambelele gha tatemundo, nhwalo jwenio ndi jwakibha aghaluchita. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Yakobu pamonita Lahele, mwana jwa Labane nnjomba mundo pamonga na mambelele gha njomba mundo ngajhenda na kulibhilimbiya lighanga na kughanywecha mache mambelele gha njomba gwake. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Peniya Yakobu ngakumbatila Lahele nu kulela kanonoha kwa kuhangana hake. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Yakobu ngannobholila Lahele, nenga ndi nnongo jwa tate mundo na mwana jwa Lebeka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:12">Lebeka ngabhutwika lubhelo ade kajhake kwalobholela tate mundo. <verse eid="GEN 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Papa Labane pajhohina nhwalo gwa Yakobu, nnjomba mundo, ngajhenda kajhombe kukongana nako, ngankumbatila nu kujhenda nako kajhake. Yakobu nganchimulila ilebhe yoha ipitile. <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Labane ngannobholila, “Chakaka mwe malongo bhango, tuhumii lukolo lumo!” Yakobu ngatamita nako kwa mwehe ghumo.<verse eid="GEN 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu itolana na ichikana ya Labane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Lichiko limo Labane ngannobholila Yakobu, “Nhwalo mwe malongo bhango mbala jhe nhenga jhajhe lihengo lyango, nnobhole mipala ninepa nike?” <verse eid="GEN 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Labane akibha na achikabhale bhabhele, nkolo akemitwa Leya na unung'una akemitwa Lahele. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Leya akibha na miho ghambone ghighahutila, nambo Lahele akibha na yegha jhambone na akibha lembulembu.<verse eid="GEN 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Yakobu ngampala Lahele, ngannobholila Labane, “Naninhengela mahengo kwa yaka chaba mbala nitolele mwana gwino nchoko.”<verse eid="GEN 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Labane nganyangwila, “Mbaha Lahele nintolanikiye mwenga kuliku kuntoleke mundo jhonge. Nnyendelele kutama nanenga.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Yene, Yakobu ngakundika mahengo kwa Labane kwa yaka chaba kupala antolele Lahele, nambo kwa yaka chaba kilebhe nacho kwa Yakobu kwa kumpala Lahele.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Peniya Yakobu ngannobholila Labane, “Kipinde chango kihikite mbela aanabhango nintolele.” <verse eid="GEN 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Yene Labane ngabheka ngundila jha unyagho gwa ndowa na ngalalika bhando bha kwenio. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Nambo kilo jhela, Labane ngantola Leya, kamwale jwake nkolo ngankamuya Yakobu na Yakobu ngagholwika nako. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Labane ngantola Zilipa ntumiche jwake mwikeghe abhe ntumiche jwa Leya. <verse eid="GEN 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Lukela, Yakobu ngakangicha kubhehe kumbe Leya! Yene ngankonya Labane, “Nanjino untendi kilebhe ghane? Ne ndumika kwa nhwalo jha Lahele. Ngohe mwe nhwalo ghane ungolwiye naha?”<verse eid="GEN 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Labane ngajhangwila, “Luhomo lwito jhe kilambo chenje kutumbuu kuntolanicha unung'una kone nkolo amela. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Ntimichila hote Leya machiko ghake chaba gha ndowa, na peniya tuntolanikiya Lahele ntumika kwa yaka henge chaba.”<verse eid="GEN 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Yakobu ngajheketila. Kipinde Yakobu pajhomolila machiko chaba gha ndowa kwa Leya, Labane ngantolanikicha Lahele. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Labane ngampiya Biliya ntumiche jwake mwikeghe, abhe ntumiche jwa Lahele. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Yakobu ngagholoka na Lahele hele. Nambo Yakobu ngampala hake Lahele kupeta Leya. Ngatumika kwa Labane kwa yaka henge chaba.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yana inalome ya Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />Bhambo Chapanga palolita Leya apalwa jhe ngita Lahele, Chapanga ngampila Leya upapo, Lahele ngantenda abhe ntonga. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Leya ngabhila na ndumbo, ngapapa mwana munalome ngankema liina lyake Lubene, Leya ngalongila “Bhambo mughawene malagho ghango. Chakaka ngohe nngana gwango nambala.” <verse eid="GEN 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Helahela Leya ngapata ndumbo jhenge, ngapapa mwana munalome, ngalongila, “Bhambo Chapanga ambii kabhele mwana munalome nhwalo alolite chanjimwa.” Yene ngankemita mwana jhono liina lyake Chimeone. <verse eid="GEN 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Leya ngabhila na jhenge ndumbo, ngapapa mwana munalome, “Ngohe nngana gwango natubhaa maghumba nde, nhwalo nimpapi yana itato inalome.” Yene ngankemita mwana jhono lihina lyake Lawe. <verse eid="GEN 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Ngaghelika jhenge ndumbo, ngapapa mwana jhonge munalome, ngalonge, “Mwanja ghongo ninnomba Bhambo Chapanga.” Yene mwana jhono ngankema liina lyake Yuda. Peniya Leya ngaleka kupapa.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Lahele pabhonita ampapi jhe Yakobu yana, ngammonela wiho nnombo mundo, ngannobholila Yakobu, “Umbe yana, anda jhe mbakuwe!”<verse eid="GEN 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Yakobu ngayomila Lahele nu kunnobholela, “Bho, deleno ne Nachapanga jhunnitei mwe mangabhe jhe na yana?”<verse eid="GEN 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Lahele pajhangwila, “Ntumiche jwango Biliya abhile. Nng'oloke nako ambapile yana, kupete jwenio nane hele mbate kibheluko.” <verse eid="GEN 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Yene, Lahele ngampila Yakobu ntumiche jwake mwikeghe Biliya abhe nhwanamundo, Yakobu ngagholwika nako. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Biliya ngabhila na ndumbo ngampapila Yakobu mwana munalome. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Yene Lahele palongila, “Chapanga andendi maha na ajhoine kulela kwango na ambi mwana munalome.” Yene ngankema liina lyake Dane. <verse eid="GEN 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Biliya, ntumiche jwa Lahele ngabhila na jhenge ndumbo ngampapila Yakobu mwana jhuubhele munalome. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Peniya Lahele palongila, “Ngomine hake na alombo bhango, nambo nahotwile.” Yene ngankemwa mwana jwenio liina lyake Nafutale mana ghake, kukomana.<verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Leya palolita alekite kupapa, ngantola Zilifa, ntumiche jwake mwikeghe ngankamuya Yakobu abhe nhwanamundo. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Zilipa ngampapila Yakobu mwana munalome. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Leya palongila, “Mmi na mota!” Kwa yene ngankemwa mwana jwenio liina lyake Gade <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:11 </char></note>mana jhake bahati. <verse eid="GEN 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Zilipa ntumiche jwa Leya, ngampapila Yakobu mwana jhubhele munalome. <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Leya ngalonge, “Hangine hake! Ngohe akakeghe bhingema naluheko.” Yene ngankema mwana jwenio Asheli mana jhake naluheko.<verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Ngaghaika machiko gha mahuno gha ngano, Lubene ngajhenda kunng'onda na kwenio ntela jhitumika ngita chemeko, ngannetela majhe gwake Leya ntela gwenio. Lahele ngannobholila Leya, “Chonde umaghulile kandina ntela gwa mwana gwino.”<verse eid="GEN 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Nambo Leya ngajhangwila, “Mwe nkita kilebhe chukinila kumboka nngana gwango, na ngohe mpakuto ntela gwa mwanango?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Lahele pajhangwila, “Anda umbi ntela gwa mwana gwino deleno jheno, umanya Yakobu nang'oloka nako.”<verse eid="GEN 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Yakobu pabhujha kimiye kunng'onda, Leya ngajhenda kumpokela nu kunobholela, “Deleno mpaka mkagholoke na nenga nhwalo minhemi kwa chemeko jha mwanango.” Yene Yakobu ngajhenda kugholoka kwa Leya uhiko gwenio.<verse eid="GEN 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Chapanga ngajhowa kujhopa kwa Leya, ngapata ndumbo ngampapila Yakobu mwana jhu nhwano. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Leya ngalonge, “Chapanga anhupite nhwalo angana bhango nakape ntumiche jwango mwikeghe.” Yene ngankema mwana jwenio Ichakale, mana jhake hupo. <verse eid="GEN 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Leya ngapata jhenge ndumbo na kumpapii Yakobu mwana munalome jwa chita. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Yene Leya ngalongila, “Chapanga ambii hupo jhambone. Ngohe angana bhango nabhandembekeya nhwalo napapii yana chita inalome.” Yene ngankema mwana jwenio liina lyake Chabulone, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:20 </char></note>mana ghake, “Utembekeho.” <verse eid="GEN 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Peniya, Leya ngapapa mwana mwikeghe, ngankema liina lyake Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Peniya, Chapanga ngankomboka Lahele, nganyoa kujhopa kwake yane ngamopwila lutumbo lwake na kupapa. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Lahele ngapata ndumbo, ngapapa mwana munalome ngalonge, “Chapanga amohite hone jhango.” <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Yene ngankema mwana jwenio liina lyake Uchupo, ngalonge, “Bhambo Chapanga anyonjekeye jhonge mwana munalome.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:24 </char></note> Mana jha liina lya Uchupo, ambekee jhonge mwana.<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu abhe ni ilebhe mbwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Lahele pampapita Uchupo, Yakobu ngannobholila Labane, “Uneke mujhe ukajhango, mu kilambo chango. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Umbeke akaana bhango na yana yango inipapite kubhoke mukuhenga kwango mahengo kwino, mbala moke nako. Umanye kubhehe nitumikii maha tugha.”<verse eid="GEN 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Nambo Labane palongila, “Chonde nijhopa nnonge kilebhe chimo. Manye kukulondola kwango kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga ambii mota kwa nhwalo jhino mwenga. <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Nnongele malepo ghimipala, naninepa.”<verse eid="GEN 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Yakobu ngalonge, “Mabhene umanye punihengii mahengo kwino na panuchita ipugho hino. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Mana ne panakibhajhe kwino mukibha na ilebhe yandina, nambo ngohe kubhoke mukuika nenga, ilebhe ijhonjikike kubhehe mbwe hake na Bhambo Chapanga ampii mota mbwe kila pimijhenda. Nambo ligha nandenda ilebhe ya pakajhango?”<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Labane ngankonya, “Ninepe kilebhe ghane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:31">Yakobu pajhangwila, “Nikipaijhe kilebhe chochoha unepa, nambo anda undendi limo leno, nannyendelela kulucha na kuilonda ipugho hino. <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Unyeketele mbete mwiipugho hino yoha deleno, maghule kila kinyama chikibhii na mabakamabaka amu malembo, kila limbelele lipile, na kila mbuhe jhuna malembo amu mabakamabaka. Ibha malepo ghango. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Yene kuhobholeka kwango namukubhona machiko gha palongolo, kila pumikaghula malepo ghango. Anda ngwete mambelele amu mbuhe yangamabaka amu limbelele lyolyoha lyangabhehe lipile, umanya litei kujhibwa.”<verse eid="GEN 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Labane ngalonge, “Lyene lyamaha, libha ngita chinongii.” <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Nambo lichiko lyene, Labane ngajhenda kubheka pakanjika mapongo ghoha ghina mabaka na ghina malembelo, na mbuhe yankolo yoha ghina mabakamabaka na malembo amu malembelo mahuo, nambo mambelele mapile ghoha ngaibheka ijhemelelwe na yana yake. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Labane ngakumwika naipugho yake ngajhenda kutama kutale na Yakobu, kolepa kwake tela na mwanja gwa machiko matato. Yakobu ngaighila papa akilucha inyama ya Labane iighilike.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Peniya Yakobu ngatola ndela mbehe imikongo mulubina na mulozi na mwalamone, ngakobhila kupala jhibhonekane malembo manhuu mundela yenio. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Peniya ngahemika ndela yenio yakobhile nnonge jha inyama, piinywe mache inyama. Nhwalo inyama ibhobhotela peniya kipinde pinywe mache, <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />ngimitita nnonge jha ndela yenio, ngaipapita yana ina michitale na mabakamabaka na malembelo.<verse eid="GEN 30:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Yakobu ngaibheka pakanjika mambelele na mbuhe, peniya ghabhatenda ghalolehane na inyama ina michitale na inyama bhapile mulilongo lya Labane. Kwa kutenda yene, Yakobu ngabhila na kibhajha chake cha inyama na akahangalini ng'o na Labane.<verse eid="GEN 30:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Kila pikiika kipinde cha inyama ina makakala kumita, Yakobu ngabheka ndela yenio, inamalembelo kuimika nnonge jha inyama piinywe mache, kupala ibhobhotela pahina na ndela yenio. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Nambo ndela yenio abheka jhe nnonge mu inyama imitite ikombile. Yene inyama yoha ikombile ngabhila ya Labane na inyama yoha ina makakala ngabhila ya Yakobu. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Yene, Yakobu ngabhila na ilebhe mbwe hake, ngabhila na michambe ndii jha inyama na akatumiche akakeghe na akanalome, ngamiya na maponda.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu antila Labane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Yakobu ngajhoha kubhehe yana ya Labane ibhii kukokoleka nu kulonge, “Yakobu ajholite kila kilebhe cha tate gwito, ndi nhwalo abhii na ilebhe mbwe hake kuhumii kwa tate gwito.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Helehela Yakobu akamanye kubhehe Labane ujhelano ghabhe ubhii jhe ngita makacho. <verse eid="GEN 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Peniya Bhambo Chapanga pannobholila Yakobu, “Nkelebhuke ku kilambo cha akahokolo bhino na akalongo bhino, nanenga mbakubhe pamonga na mwenga.”<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Peniya Yakobu ngabhalaghii Leya na Lahele, bhakongane kwachungii inyama yake. <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />Yakobu ngabhalobholila, “Ne nilola kubhehe tate gwino ujhelano gwito ubhii jhe ngita makacho. Nambo Chapanga jwa tate gwango abhii pamonga na nenga. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Mmanyingine kubhehe ndumike kwa tate gwino kwa makakala ghango ghoha. <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />Pamo na gheniya, tate gwino andei kungolowa na kughalambuu malepo ghango mala kome. Nambo Chapanga akannekiti jhe andendele kilebhe chukumengwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Kila palongila tate gwino, ‘Inyama ina mabakamabaka ndi yango,’ yene inyama yoha ngaitumbu kubhelekana ibhii na mabakamabaka. Na palonge, ‘Inyama ina michitale ibha hino,’ bhahe, inyama yoha ngaitumbu kubhehe na michitale. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />Yene ndi Chapanga patola inyama ya tate gwino nu kumbe nenga.<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />“Machiko gha kumita inyama, nganota maloto, mu maloto gheniya nganyinwila miho na kulola mapongo gha mbuhe ibhobhote yankolo ina michitale na mabakamabaka na malembelo. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Ntumiche jwa kunane kwa Chapanga ngalongela nanenga mu maloto gheniya nu kungema, ‘Yakobu!’ Nane nganyekita, ‘Ne pamba.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Na jwene ngalongila, ‘Nnole, mapongo ghoha ghina malembo na mabakamabaka na michitale ghaibhobhotela yankolo. Kilebhe chenio kibhii yene mweni ghantendii Labane. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Ne ndi Chapanga jhola jhunimpitila ku Betele, chehemo jhela pumekita ujhelubhulo lighanga kwa kujhilitii mahuta na kubheka kilapo kwa nenga. Na ngohe mmoke mu kilambo chenje nnyende mu kilambo chimmelukilwe.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Lahele na Leya ngabhanyangwila Yakobu, “Twenga kibhii jhe chakubhujhii chikihighilike amu uliche ghoghoha kubhoka kwa tate gwito! <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Jwenio atubhona ngita akaghene, mana atuchulwiche na inyaghabhule, ndi yanomenekeya. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Ilebhe yoha yatoi Chapanga kubhoka kwa tate gwito ndi ya twenga na yana hito. Yene ntende kila kilebhe chanaghii Chapanga!”<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Peniya Yakobu ngalenganikiya mwanja, ngahobhokeya yana mundo na akaanamundo panng'ongo gwa kinyama chikikemwa ngamiya. <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />Yakobu ngatola inyama yoha pamonga na ilebhe yachumita ku kilambo chuku Padane Alamu, ngatumbu mwanja kukelebhuka ku kilambo chaku Kaanane kwa tatemundo Ichaka. <verse eid="GEN 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Kabula jha Yakobu na akaana mundo kubhoka, Labane pakibha kutale mukuchekuu mangoma inyama yake, peniya Lahele ngapata pwache jhu kukwatuu inyagho ichapanga ya tate mundo. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Yakobu akatei kunkoloya Labane, mundo jwa ku likabila lya Mwalamu, ngatila changantabhuka. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Yakobu ngatola ilebhe yake yoha, nganyogholwika nako. Papa ngajhombwika lukemba lwa Efulate, ngajhenda ku kilambo chiitombe, ku Gileade.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Labane ankengama Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Pughapetita machiko matato, Labane ngajhoa kubhehe Yakobu anyogholwike. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Peniya Labane ngabhatola akalongo mundo, ngankengima Yakobu kwa machiko chaba na ngankolila mu itombe yaku Gileade. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Nambo uhiko gwenio, Chapanga ngampitila Labane mundo jwaku Mwalamu mu maloto ngannobholila, “Chonde mukilolekeye! Mangalonge jhe kwa Yakobu kilebhe chochoha chikibhii kibhoho amu chamaha.” <verse eid="GEN 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Peniya Labane ngaika pabhii Yakobu. Kipinde chenio Yakobu akibha abhekite kighono chake pikitombe. Labane na akalongo mundo, ngabhabheka kighono ku kilambo chiitombe yuku Gileade.<verse eid="GEN 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Labane ngannobholila Yakobu, “Mikitei nike, mboni undei kungolowa, ngamitola yana yango ikeghe ngita ipukililwe kungondo? <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Nhwalo gwa nike ntei kunyogholoka? Nhwalo ghane ungolwiye? Nhwalo ghane undawike jhe? Ngaunnobholela, nganitawike kwa kuhangana, kwa mihambo nu kunhone ng'oma na malimba. <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Mbone umbii jhe pwache kupala nakumbatile natabhuke yana yango na ichokolo yango? Chakaka ungohite hake! <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Mmii na kindendeke chukummengwa, nambo Chapanga jwa tate gwino ambitii uhiko gwa kujhimukii deleno, ngalonge, ‘Chonde mukilolekeye! Mangalonge jhe kilebhe chochoha kwa Yakobu kibhaha kibhoho amu chamaha.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Manye unyogholwika nhwalo mmi na kilolo hake kukelebhuka kajhino kwa tate gwino. Nambo nhwalo gwa nike nkwatii inyagho ya ichapanga yango?”<verse eid="GEN 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Yakobu pannyangwila Labane, “Ndeila kujhoghopa pange naumboka yana hino. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Nambo jhumumpala kunkolela na inyagho ichapanga hino akomwe! Nnonge jha akalongo bhito, nnangiye chochoha chikibhii chino, ntole.” Yakobu akamanyii jhe kubhehe, Lahele ndi jwakwatwii inyagho ya ichapanga ya Labane.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Peniya Labane ngapaliya inyagho ichapanga yake mu kichimba cha Yakobu, na mu kichimba cha Leya na mu kichimba cha akatumiche akakeghe bhabhele, nambo akaimweni ndeka. Ngapita mu kichimba cha Leya nu kujhingii mu kichimba cha Lahele. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Lahele ndi jwakwatwila inyagho yenio nu kuwininika mulitandiko panane jha ngamiya nukutamii panane jhake. Labane ngalyungita kupalaya mu kichimba choha nambo akaimweni ndeka. <verse eid="GEN 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Peniya Lahele ngannobholila tate mundo, “Matate nihoto jhe kujhema nnonge jhino nhwalo mmi piye.” Peniya Labane ngalyunga kupalaya, nambo akaimweni ndeka.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Peniya Yakobu ngachimwa, ngapwatalila na ngankonya Labane kulonge, “Ne lilemwa lyango nike?” Ngankonya Labane, “Ndei kilebhe ghane kibhoho ade uyeme? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Bho, mpatite nike punhambulina miigho jhango jhoha? Mikibheke nnonge jha akalongo bhino na akalongo bhango kupala bhajhino bhatuhadabule panakate jha twe bhabhele! <verse eid="GEN 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />Ndamite na mwenga kwa yaka makome mabhele. Kipinde chenio choha mambelele ghino na mbuhe hino ghinahopo jhe ndumbo, hilu nni jhe lipongo lya limbelele. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Hilu lichiko limo ninannete jhe nnyama jwino jwakwapitwe na kinyama chuku manyahe, nambo lighambo lyenio niligheghita namwete. Kabhele ngunongila nannepa chochoha chikikwatwilwe pangaloleke kubhehe bhakwatwii kilo amu muhe! <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Yene muhe ngahimbilila lyobha na kilo ngahimbilila malile, ng'ochii jhe ata pandina. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Yaka yenio makome mabhele ndamita na mwenga kajhino. Ndumike yaka makome mabhele na ncheche, kwa nhwalo gwa yana hino ibhele. Yaka chita kwa nhwalo gwa kulucha ipugho hino. Nambo mwe ngang'alambwiya malepo ghango mala kome. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Chapanga jwa tate gwango Chapanga gwa Ulaimo, ndi Chapanga jwanteila Ichaka alendeme nukubhehe jhe lubhoko lwango, chakaka ngaunekite moke mabhoko matopo. Nambo Chapanga alolite kulagha kwango na lihengo lindei kwa mabhoko ghango, nganakalila uhiko gwa kujhimukii deleno.”<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu na Labane bhilaghilana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Peniya Labane pannobholila Yakobu, “Ikeghe henge ndi yanango na yenio ichokolo ndi umbombwe gwango na inyama yenio ndi inyama yango na yoha yankwete yanenga. Bho, deleno nandenda nike bhahighilike yanango na umbombe gwabhe? <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Yene tubheke lilaghano panakate jha mwenga na nenga, lilangiye ghitulaghine.”<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Peniya Yakobu ngatola lighanga, ngahimika andi luheke lwa ukombokelo. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Yakobu ngabhalobholila akalongo mundo, “Nnokote maghanga.” Na bhene ngabhalundika lilundo. Peniya ngabhalila chakulya pahina na lilundo lyenio. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Labane ngalikema lilundo lyenio Yegale Saahaduta nambo Yakobu akemita Galedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Labane ngannobholila Yakobu, “Lilundo lende lya maghanga ndi uchaile panakate jha mwenga nanenga deleno.” <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />Chehemo jhene limanyikina Misipa, nhwalo Labane ngalongila, “Bhambo Chapanga nalolekeya putupakubhehe kutale changakongana.” <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Labane pajhendilila kulonge, “Anda mang'ahite yanango amu kutole akakeghe bhange, mmanya kubhehe Chapanga ndi jwalola.” <verse eid="GEN 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Peniya Labane ngannobholila Yakobu, “Nnole lilundo lende lya maghanga, ndi luheke lunyemike panakate jhino nanenga. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Lilundo lende ndi uchaile na luheke londo uchaile gwakukombokela kubhehe nenga nihomba jhe lilundo lende kuhika kwino kumengwa. Mwenga hele mihomba jhe lilundo lende na luheke londo kuhika kwa nenga kumengwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Chapanga jwa Ulaimo na Chapanga jwa Nahole na Chapanga jwa akahokolo bhito nabhatuhadabula panakate jhito.” Peniya Yakobu ngalapila kwa Chapanga jwammeka Ichaka alendeme, kubhehe alikomboke lilaghano lende. <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Peniya Yakobu ngapiya litambiko lya kuchinja kinyama kuitombe na ngabhalalika akalongo mundo kujhenda kulye yakulya. Pubhajhomolila kulye ngabhakelwiya kwenio kelo ndaa. <verse eid="GEN 31:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Lukela jhake putepute, Labane ngajhimwika, ngajhenda kuikumbatila ichokolo na yana mundo ikeghe na kuijhope mota. Peniya ngabhoka kukelebhuka kajhake.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu akilenganikiya kukongana na Echau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Yakobu ngajhendelila na mwanja gwake. Bhahe, ngakonganika na akatumiche bha kunane kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Yakobu pakonganika ngalonge, “Ka, abha ndi akakomana ngondo bha Chapanga!” Yene, ngapakema peniya Mahanaimu, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:2 </char></note>mana ghake pamba ndi paighono ibhele ya akakomana ngondo.<verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Yakobu ngatuma bhando bhalongolele kujhenda kwa nhwacha mundo Echau kuitombe ya ku Seile, ibhii mu kilambo cha ku Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />Yakobu ngalaghila kukulonge, “Ahacha bhango Echau, makalobholela naha, ntumiche gwino Yakobu ilonge naha, ndamite kwa njomba Labane ade ngohe. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Mmi na ng'ombe na maponda na nchambe gwa mambelele na mbuhe na akatumiche akanalome na akakeghe. Ninnete lilobhe lende nhwacha bhango kupala nihika umonele kiya.”<verse eid="GEN 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Bheniya ngabhajhenda, ngabhannobholela Yakobu, “Tuikite kwa nhwacha gwino na abhii undela kuika kumpokela, abhii na nchambe gwa bhando miya ncheche.” <verse eid="GEN 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Peniya Yakobu ngabhe na kiholo hake na uechuko, ngabhaghanicha bhando bhakibha nabho makunde mabhele, helahela bhando bhubhakibha pamo na mambelele na ngamiya na henge ipugho. <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />Yakobu ahololila kubhehe, “Anda Echau aikite nu koma, bhahe, nchambe ghumo ghupakuighalika na unyogholoka.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Peniya Yakobu ngannyopa Chapanga kwa kulonge, “Mwe ma Chapanga bha tate gwango Ulaimo na Chapanga jwa tate gwango Ichaka! Mwe ndi Bhambo Chapanga jhonnobholila kubhehe, ngelebhuke mu kilambo cha tate gwango na akalongo bhango, ngatulaghana naundendela ghambone. <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />Ne nipalwa jhe hilu pandina kutangatilwa ngita chundangatila kukuaminika kwino, ne natumiche nganyombwika lukemba lwa Yoludane, nakibha jhe chochoha, nambo nga nkongocho tugha na ngohe mmi na makunde ghanga mabhele. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Ninnyopa ung'ombole mumabhoko gha nhwacha gwango Echau, mana mii na kiholo nu kutukoma twabhoha, akamajhe na yana yabhe. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />Nambo mwenga ngatulaghina na nenga kundende ghambone, na ibheluko yango ngita ncheke gwa kumbwane gwanga bhalangika.”<verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />Kilo jhenio Yakobu ngagholwika pena, peniya ngahagwila ipugho yake kupala ampele nhwacha mundo Echau hupo. <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />Hupo jhene ikibha mbuhe yankolo miya ibhele na mapongo makome mabhele na mambelele ghankolo miya ibhele na mapongo makome mabhele, <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />ngamiya ijhongecha makome matato pamo na yana yabhe na ng'ombi yankolo makome ncheche na mapongo kome na maponda ghankolo makome mabhele na mapongo kome. <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Ngabhakamuya akatumiche bhake kila mundo na nchambe gwake, ngalongila, “Nnongolele nambo mwileka pwache panakate jha nchambe ghumo na ghonge.” <verse eid="GEN 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Nganaghalikiya jhola jwalongoli kulonge, “Nhwacha gwango Echau pupakukongana nako na anda ankonyite, ‘Mwe matumiche bha ghane? Na koo mijhenda? Na inyama ilongolile ndi ya ghane?’ <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />Mwe munyangula kulonge, ‘Henge ndi ilebhe ya ntumiche gwino Yakobu, henge ndi hupo ina mwenga manahota bhango Echau. Kabhele jwenio Yakobu akengama unyuma.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Hele naha nganaghilikiya kwa bhoha ntumiche jhubhele na jwautato kukulonge, “Pumpa kukongana na Echau munnobholela malobhe gheniya. <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />Nnongela naha, ‘Ntumiche gwino Yakobu abhii kuika.’ ” Yakobu ateila yene aholila kubhehe, “Kwa hupo yalongwiye pibhapakukongana pange jhe nampokela mbone.” <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Peniya ngalongwiya hupo yake, nambo jwenio kilo jhenio ngagholwika koko pakighono.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu ilimbana na mundo kweno Panuele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Kilo jhenio Yakobu ngajhimuka, ngatola matala ghake na akatumiche bhabhele na yana mundo kome na jhumo, ngabhajhombwika lukemba lwa Yaboke. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Pibhajhomolila kujhomboka kwiye helahela ngajhombwiya na male ghake ghoha. <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />Yene Yakobu ngahighila kanjika ndo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:24">Peniya ngaika mundo jhumo, ngabhalimbana malimba ade pulipitita lyobha. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Mundo jwenio palolita Yakobu anhotwi jhe, jwenio ngantilighula kibhuno. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Mundo jwenio ngannobholila Yakobu, “Uneke nyabhule, unhwalo ngo kuchile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">Yakobu ngalonge, “Nineka ng'o mpaka umbe ote mota.”<verse eid="GEN 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Mundo ngankonya, “Mwe liina lino maghane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:27">Yakobu ngajhangwila, “Ne Yakobu.”<verse eid="GEN 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Mundo jwenio pannobholila Yakobu, “Mikemwa jhe ma Yakobu kabhele, nankemwa Ichilahele nhwalo nnimbine na Chapanga na bhando nu kuhotola.”<verse eid="GEN 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Papa Yakobu ngalonge, “Chonde nyopa unnobholele liina lino.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:29">Nambo mundo jwenio ngalonge, “Nhwalo gwa nike ungonya liina lyango?” Peniya ngampila mota Yakobu.<verse eid="GEN 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Yakobu ngapakema chehemo jhenio kubhehe, “Panuele, tela nukulonge nimwene Chapanga miho kwa miho na nenga nhwi jhe.” <verse eid="GEN 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Yakobu ngabhoka ku Panuele lyobha likibha lipitite na itenda kuchepela nhwalo gwa kibhuno chake. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Ade ngohe Akaichilahele bhimemena jhe ncheketa gwa kibhuno, nhwalo mundo jwenio akantegwii ncheketa gwa kibhuno.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu na Echau bhikongana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Bhahe, Yakobu pajhinwila miho ngammona nhwacha mundo Echau akaika na nchambe gwa bhando miya ncheche. Yakobu ngabhaghanicha yana panakate jha Leya na Lahele na akatumiche bhake bhabhele. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Ngabheka akatumiche na yana yabhe nnonge na Leya na yana yake na kujhomolela Lahele na mwana mundo Uchupo. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Peniya Yakobu ngalongolila nnonge, ngalita pahe kwa ichima mala chaba ade pamandikila nhwacha mundo Echau. <verse eid="GEN 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Nambo Echau ngamutukila lubhelo kumpokela Yakobu, ngankumbatila na bhoha bhabhele ngabhalela. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Echau palola na kwabhona akakeghe na yana yabhe, ngankonya, “Bho, angota achighane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Yakobu ngajhangwila, “Yenio ndi yana yambii Chapanga natumiche gwake kukuchulo gwake.” <verse eid="GEN 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Peniya akatumiche akakeghe ngabhaeghelela na yana yabhe ngabhalitita kwa ichima. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Yene Leya na yanamundo na ngabhalita na ngajhomole Uchupo na Lahele ngabhalitita.<verse eid="GEN 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Echau pankonya, “Nchambe gwa inyama ingongine nako undela mana ghake nike?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">Yakobu pajhangwila, “Yene ndi hupo hino kupala umone kiya munahota gwango.”<verse eid="GEN 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Nambo Echau ngalonge, “Ngwete ilebhe mbwe nnongo gwango Yakobu, yene ntamanako mabhene.”<verse eid="GEN 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Yakobu ngalonge, “Nahi jhe, chonde anda chakaka unyeketile, mpokele ilebhe yango. Chakaka kukubhona kumiho jhino ndi tela kummona Chapanga nhwalo umbokii kwa umbone hake. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Chonde ninyopa mpokele hupo yango ininetila, nhwalo nane hele kwa umbone gwake Chapanga ambii ilebhe mbwe.” Yakobu ndi ngampembilikiya Echau, ade jwenio ngapokela.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Echau ngalonge, “Ajha! Tujhendelele na mwanja gwito, nenga nanninongolela.”<verse eid="GEN 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Nambo Yakobu ngajhangwila, “Manahota mwe umanye kubhehe yana eye kuhumii ilemba, na mambelele na ng'ombi na mbuhe ijhongecha yana yabhe, nanenga ipalwa nitunje. Anda nibhutwiye mbelo kajhombe ata kwa lichiko limo, mmanya inyama yoha ipakuwe. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Ninnyopa mwe manahota nnongolele na nenga natumiche bhino nangengama unyuma kachokochoko, ngita chiipa kutyanga inyama yenio na yana ade pumbakukongana kwenio ku Seile.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Echau ngalonge, “Bhahe, nanenga natumiche gwino ninneka na bhange bhando bhango.” Nambo Yakobu ngakonya, “Nhwalo gwa nike kutenda yene? Ne chang'anita ungole kiya tu anahota bhango.”<verse eid="GEN 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Lichiko lele Echau ngatumbuu mwanja gwa kubhujha ku Seile. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Nambo Yakobu ngajhenda ku kilambo chi Sukoti, na kwenio ngachenga nyumba na kibhajha kwa nhwalo gwa inyama yake. Kwa nhwalo gwenio chehemo jhenio ngapakemitwa muche gwa Sukoti.<verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Yakobu ngabhoka ku Padane Alamu, ngatyanga kwa njelembo ade ku muche gwa ku Chekemo ghubhii mu kilambo chaku ku Kaanane, ngabheka kighono chake pahina na muche gwenio. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />Chehemo jwabheka kighono chake pahemilwa kubhoka mu yana ya Akaamole, atate bha Chekemo kwa ipande miya jhimo ya mbijha. <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Peniya, ngachenga kachangwale ka maghanga ngapakema, Eli Elohe Ichilahele, yane Chapanga ndi Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele.<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s">Dina ilimbwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Lichiko limo, Dina bite Yakobu, mwana jwa Leya ngajhenda kwatyangii akakeghe bhubhatamita pena. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Peniya, Chekemo mwana jwa Amole jwa likabila lya Mhive, munahota nkolongwa jwa kilambo chenio, pammonita Dina, nganhutita, nu kunnimba. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Mwojho gwake ngang'ate hake Dina bite Yakobu, yene ngatumbuu kulonge nako kwa malobhe matepetebho. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Yene, Chekemo ngannobholila tatemunde, “Chonde unnokeye kamwale ojho, ndolane nako.”<verse eid="GEN 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Yakobu ngaujhoa nhwalo gwenio kubhehe Dina, mwanamundo atei kulimbwa na Chekemo, nhwalo yana mundo ikibha kujhemelela ipugho, ngalendila ibhujhite ote kulucha. <verse eid="GEN 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Yene Amole tatemundo Chekemo, ngajhenda kwa Yakobu kulonge nako. <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />Kipinde chenio yana mundo Yakobu ikibha ibhujhite kulucha. Pibhajhoa nhwalo gwenio, ngabhayoma hake nhwalo Chekemo akatei kilebhe cha hone kwa aka Ichilahele chukunnimba mwana jwa Yakobu, mana kilebhe chenio nhwilo hake kwa aka Ichilaele. <verse eid="GEN 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Nambo Amole ngalongila, “Mwanango Chekemo ang'anite hake kamwale gwino Dina, chonde munnyeketele antolane nako. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Maleke tutolane, mangota mututolanikiye achikabhale bhino na twenga tutolanikiya achikabhale bhito. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Peniya, ntamangana kwa uteeke na twenga, namma makabhanda jhe, ntamangana pamba na kuchulucha ilebhe mpata ulohe.”<verse eid="GEN 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Peniya Chekemo ngannobholila tatemundo Dina na akalongo mundo kubhehe, “Chonde, nanjii ungole kiya, nintolele nambiya chochoha chimpa kulongela. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Unnobholele kinyaghabhule na hupo ghane, ata kijholoka bhole, ne nambiya, kupala ndolane nako ojho.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Peniya, yana ya Yakobu ngainyangu Chekemo pamonga na Amole tatemundo kuwange, nhwalo Chekemo annimbite njwe nnombo gwito Dina. <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />Ngabhalonge, “Twe tuhoto jhe kuntolanikiya nnombo gwito na mundo jwangajhingii jando. Kutenda yene, twe natukola hone. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Natunyeketela anda nnyeketile kubhehe ngita twe, kila munalome panakate jhino ajhingila jando. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Peniya ndi pitupa kuntolanicha mangota na achikabhale bhito na twenga kutolela achikabhale bhino. Peniya natutama pamonga nu kubhehe kilebhe chimo. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Nambo anda nnyeketii jhe nhwalo gwenio gwa kujhingii jando, mmanya twe natubhoka nako nnombo gwito.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Nhwalo gwenio ngaghunhanganicha Chekemo na tate gwake Amole. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Kangombo jwenio ndi jwatopila hake mu nyumba jha tate gwake, akibha jha nikiyoto kuhenga kilebhe chenie nhwalo akampai bite Yakobu.<verse eid="GEN 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Peniya Amole na mwanamundo Chekemo, ngabhabhujhita pannyango gwa kilambo, na kulonge na bhando bha muche gwabhe. <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />Ngabhalobholila, “Bhando bhamba ndi akakoche bhito. Twapokele bhatame pikilambo chito na bhachuluche ilebhe, nhwalo tubhii na kilambo kikolongwa kutama twabhoha. Kabhele natutolana na achikabhale bhabhe na twe kwatolanikicha achikabhale bhito. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Nambo ajhito nabhajheketela kutama na twenga anda na kubhehe kilebhe chimo kwa nhwilo ghongo akanalome bhoha bhajhingila jando ngita bhena. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Bho, milola jhe ipugho yabhe na ilebhe yabhe yoha naibhaha ito? Ngohe twajheketele ajhito tutame nako pamonga.” <verse eid="GEN 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Akanalome bhoha bhibhakakongine pannyango gwa kilambo, peniya ngabhajheketelana na Amole na mwanamundo Chekemo. Peniya akanalome bhoha ngajhingila jando.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Pighapetita machiko matato, akanalome bhibhajhingii jando bhibhabhii mukuchotachota, yana ibhele ya Yakobu Chimeone na Lawe, akaacha mundo Dina, ngabhatola mapanga ghabhe nu kujhingilila kwa kupwitikilila akanalome bha muche gwenio na kwakoma bhoha. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Ngabhankoma Amole na mwana mundo Chekemo kwa upanga, ngabhampiya Dina munyumba jha Chekemo, ngabhakijhendila. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Yana henge ya Yakobu ngabhajhendila bhando bhibhanhwile mu kilambo nukutola ilebhe ya mwenio, nhwalo nnombo gwabhe akete kulimbwa. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Ngabhatola mbuhe na ng'ombi na mambelele na maponda na ilebhe yoha ikibha pabomane na kunng'onda. <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />Ngabhatola ilebhe yoha, yana na akakeghe na ilebhe yabhe yoha ikibha mu majhumba ghabhe.<verse eid="GEN 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Peniya, Yakobu ngabhalobholila Chimeone na Lawe kubhehe, “Mangota mwe unnete mang'ahe kundenda nungwe na bhando bha kilambo chenje cha Akakaanane na Akapeliche. Mmanya nabhayenganila kungoma nenga pamonga na akalongo bhango.”<verse eid="GEN 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Nambo ngabhajhangula, “Bho, twe tuhekelela tugha kuntenda nnombo gwito ngita nngongola?”<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga impe mota Yakobu kwenio ku Betele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />Yene Chapanga, ngannobholila Yakobu kubhehe, “Nnenganikiye mwanja, nnyende ku Betele mukatame kwono, mukanjenge kachangwale kanyahinyahi kwenio. Nenga Chapanga gwino jhunnimpitila kipinde chimtilita nhwacha gwino Echau.”<verse eid="GEN 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Peniya, Yakobu ngabhalobholila akalongo mundo na bhando bhakibha nabho, “Mwileke inyagho ya ichapanga jhikighene inkwete na mukijhelebhule nhwala henge ngobho. <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />Tujhenda ku Betele kwenio natunchengela Chapanga kachangwale kanyahinyahi, Chapanga jwantangatila mu malola ghango na kubhehe nane kila kunnyenda.” <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Yene bhando ngabhampila Yakobu inyagho yoha imilongo jha kighene ibhakibha nabho pamo na ndondolo ibhiwalite mumachikilo ghabhe. Na Yakobu ngajhenda kuhiya pahe jha nkongo nkolongwa ghumanyikana mwalomi ghubhii mu kilambo chuku Chekemu.<verse eid="GEN 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Yakobu na yana mundo pubhakibha mumwanja, Chapanga ngabhaleke kiholo akolo muche bhapahina hilu bhakahotwi jhe kwakengama. <verse eid="GEN 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Peniya, Yakobu na bhando bhoha bhubhakibha nako ngaika kumuche gwaku Luzu, yane kukilambo chuku Kaanane. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />Kwenio ngachenga kachangwale na chehemo jhenio ngapakema El Betele, nhwalo peniya ndi pakilangiya Chapanga kipinde chantila nkolo mundo Echau. <verse eid="GEN 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Peniya Debola jwannelita Lebeka pakibha mwana, pajhomwika ngabhanchika pahe jha nkongo gwa mwalone ghubhii ku Betele. Yene Yakobu ngapakema chehemo jhenio, “Alone Bakute.” Mana ghake nkongo gwa kulela.<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Yakobu pabhujhita kuhuma Padone Alamo, Chapanga ngampitii kabhele nu kumpe mota. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />Chapanga ngannobholila, “Liina lino Yakobu, nambo mikemwa kabhele jhe lyenio, nambo ngohe liina lino nankemwa Ichilahele.” <verse eid="GEN 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />Chapanga ngannobholila kabhele, “Nenga ndi Chapanga jhuna Makakala. Kibheluko china kibhaha twe. Bhando bhilambo yoha nabhapitila kuhumii kwino na akanahota akakolongwa nabhapitila kuhumii muyegha jhino. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Ilambo inimpila Ulahimo na Ichaka, ngohe nanimpa mwenga na kibheluko chino.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Chapanga pajhomolila kulonge nako Yakobu, ngannekita na kubhoka. <verse eid="GEN 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Yakobu ngahimika luheke lwa lighanga kupala apakombokela chehemo jhenio palongela na Chapanga, ngapajhelebhula kwa kujhiti litambiko divaye pamo na mahuta kwa nhwalo jha bhambo. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Yakobu ngapakema Betele chehemo jhenio jhalongila na chapanga.<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lahele itenda kuwegha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Yakobu na akalongo mundo ngabhabhoka ku Betele. Pibhaheghelila kuhika ku muche gwaku Efulata, Lahele ngajhoa lipyanda lyukupapa. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Najwene pakibha mulipyanda lyenio, nkunga ngannobholila Lahele, “Mangajhoghopa jhe, namupapa mwana jhonge munalome.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Lahele abhi mukuhandahanda, ngantina mwana gwake liina lya Benione, mana ghake mwana jhilipyanda, nambo tatemundo ngankema, Benjamine, mana ghake mwana jwa lubhoko lwalelo.<verse eid="GEN 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Peniya Lahele ngajhomwika, ngabhanchika mupele jha ndela jhijhenda ku Efulata, ngohe pimanyikana ku Betelehemo. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Yakobu ngajhemika luheke lwa lighanga panane jha mambe jha Lahele na ade ngoheno lubhii peniya. <verse eid="GEN 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Peniya, Yakobo helahela jwakemitwa Ichilahele ngajhendilila na mwanja gwake nu kubheka kighono chake kwiye jha nnala gwa Edele.<verse eid="GEN 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yana inalome ya Yakobu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 2:1-2">1 Ngongu 2:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />Yakobu patama mu kilambo chenio, mwanamundo Leubene ngagholoka na Biliya, kilaghe cha tate mundo na jwenio Yakobu ngajhohina nhwalo gwenio.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Yakobu akibha na yana kome nibhele.<verse eid="GEN 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Yana ya Leya ikibha Leubene ndi mwana jwa litibho jwa Yakobu na Chimione na Lawe na Yuda na Ichakale pamonga na Zabulone. <verse eid="GEN 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Yana inalome ya Lahele ikibha Uchupo na Benjamine. <verse eid="GEN 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Yana inalome ya Biliya, ntumiche jwa Lahele ikibha Dane na Nafutale. <verse eid="GEN 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Yana ya Zilipa, ntumiche jwa Leya ikibha Gade na Achele. Bhamba ndi yana inalome ya Yakobu yapapita pakibha ku kilambo chuku Padane Alamu.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichaka itenda kuwegha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Yakobu ngajhenda kwa tatemundo Ichaka kumuche gwa ku Mamule kubomane Kiliate Aluba, ngohe umanyikana Ebulone, kwenio ndi kubhakibha bhatamita Ulahimo na Ichaka. <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Kipinde chene Ichaka ngabhila na yaka miya jhimo na makome nane. <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />Ichaka ngapumwila uhuke gwa mwicho nu kuwegha, ngawila ngita chibhawila akalongo mundo, mughoe hake. Nabhene Echau na Yakobu yana mundo, ngabhanchika tate gwabhe.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s">Ibheluko ya Echau</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:34-37">1 Ngongu 1:34-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Ghongo ndi ibheluko ya Echau helahela ukemwa Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Echau ngatolila akakeghe bha kilambo chu Kanaane, ngantolila Ada mwana jwa Elone gwa likabila lya Wahite na Ohalibama mwana jwa Anahie mwana jwa Chabulone hele mundo jwa likabila lya Wahive, <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />helahela ghantolila Basemate bite Ichumaile na hele nnombo mundo Nebayote. <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Ada ngampapila Echau mwana munalome jwakemwa Elifazi na Basemate ngampapila mwana munalome Leuele. <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />Ohalibama ngampapa Yeuchi na Yalamu na Kola. Yenio ndi yana inalome ya Echau yaipapa pakibha atamita kukilambo chuku Kaanane.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Yene Echau ngatola akaanamundo na yana mundo, inalome na ikeghe na bhando bhatamita nabho na ng'ombi yake na inyama yake ni ilebhe yapata kukilambo cha ku Kaanane, ngahami chenge kilambo chichikibha kutale na Yakobu. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Bhateila yene nhwalo ilebhe yabhe ikajhilokine hake ata bhakanhotwi jhe kutama pamonga mu kilambo chene. Kilambo chibhatamita ngita akaghene jhakakwelite jhe, nhwalo kujholoka kwa inyama yabhe. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Yene Echau helahela akemitwa Edomu ngajhenda kutama kukilambo chikwiitombe yuku Seile.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Henge ndi ibheluko ya Echau hokolo jwa Edomu bhibhatama kukilambo chiitombe ya ku Seile. <verse eid="GEN 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Ghanga ndi mahina gha yana inalome ya Echau Elifazi mwana jwa Ada nhwana mundo Echau, Leuele mwana jwa Basemate nhwana mundo Echau. <verse eid="GEN 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Yana inalome ya Elifazi ikibha Temani na Umale na Zepo na Gatamu na Kenaze. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Elifazi akibha mwana jwa Echau jwapapii kwa kilaghe chake liina lyake Timuna. Jwenio ngampapila mwana munalome liina lyake Ameleke. Bhamba ndi bhakibha ichokolo ya Echau kwa nkeghe Ada.<verse eid="GEN 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Basemate nhwana mundo Echau, ngampapila mwana munalome Leuele. Yana inalome ya Leuele ndi Nahate na Zela na Shama na Miza.<verse eid="GEN 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Ohalibama nhwanamundo Echau bite Anahe mwana jwa Zabulone, ngampapila yana inalome itato, Yeuchi na Yalamu na Kola.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Henge ndi ngolo ihumi kwa Echau, Elifazi mwana jwa litibho ikibha Tamale na Umale na Zepo na Kenaze, <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />na Kola na Gatamu na Ameleke. Bheniya bhoha bhakibha ngolo ya likabila lyabhe ihumila mu kilambo chuku Edomo. Yoha yenio ndi yana inalome ya Echau kwa nhwana mundo Ada.<verse eid="GEN 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Leuele mwana munalome jwa Echau ngampapa Nahate na Zela na Shama na Miza kila jhumo ngabhila nkolongwa jwa ngolo yabhe. Yene yoha ndi yana inalome ya Echau kwa nhwana mundo Basemete. <verse eid="GEN 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Ibheluko ya Echau kwa mwikeghe Ohalibama, kila jhumo ngabhila nkolo jwa ngolo yake, Yeuchi na Jalamo na Kola. Yoha ndi yana inalome ya Ohalibama bite Ana, nhwana mundo Echau. <verse eid="GEN 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Yene, ndi ibheluko ya Echau kwa liina lenge akemitwa Edomu. Kila mundo akibha nkolo jwa likabila lyake.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibheluko ya Seile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:38-42">1 Ngongu 1:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Henge ndi yana ya Seile likabila lya Muhole bhibhakibha akolo kilambo chaku Edomu Lotane na Shobale na Chibeone na Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />na Dichone na Eshele na Dichane, kila mundo akibha nkolo jwa ngolo yake panakate jha Akahole bha kibheluko cha Akaseile, mu kilambo chuku Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Henge ndi yana inalome ya Lotane akibha Hole na Hemane na nnombo mundo Lotane akemitwa, Timuna.<verse eid="GEN 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Yana inalome ya Shobale ikibha, Alovane na Manahate na Ebale na Shepo na Onamu.<verse eid="GEN 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Zibeone ngapapita yana ibhele, Aya na Ana. Ana ndi yakibhona chembwe cha mache mapyoo kola ku njenga, pakibha achungita maponda gha tatemundo Zibeone. <verse eid="GEN 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Yana ya Ana ikibha Dishone na nnombo mundo jhumo jwakemitwa Oholibama. <verse eid="GEN 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Dishone ngapapita yana inalome, Emudane na Eshibane na Itilane na Kelane.<verse eid="GEN 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Yana inalome ya Ezele ikibha, Biliyane na Sawane na Akane.<verse eid="GEN 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Yana inalome ya Dishone ikibha Usi na Alane.<verse eid="GEN 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Bhamba ndi akakolongwa bha ngolo jha Akahole, Lotane na Shobale na Shibeone na Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />Dishone na Ezele na Dishane. Kila mundo akibha nkolo jwa likabila lyake, mu kilambo chuku Seile.<verse eid="GEN 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akanahota akakolongwa bhuku Edomu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:43-54">1 Ngongu 1:43-54</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Bhamba ndi akanahota akakolongwa kilambo chuku Edomu, kabula Akaichilahele nu kulongochwa jhe na munahota nkolongwa jhojhoha.<verse eid="GEN 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Bela mwana jwa Beole, jwenio jwatumbwila alongwicha kilambo chuku Edomu, atamita ku muche chikikemwa Diniaba.<verse eid="GEN 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Bela pajhomwika, Yobabu mwana jwa Zela kubhoka ku muche gwa Bosela ngabhila munahota nkolongwa.<verse eid="GEN 36:33" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Yobabu pajhomwika, Hushamu kubhoke ku kilambo Akatemane ngabhehe munahota nkolongwa.<verse eid="GEN 36:34" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Hushamu pajhomwika, Hadade mwana jwa Bedade ngabhehe munahota nkolongwa, kitamo chake kikibha ku kilambo cha Awite, jwenio ndi jwabhabulita na kwahotola Midiane mu kilambo chuku Moabu.<verse eid="GEN 36:35" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Hadade pajhomwika, pwache jhake jha unahota nkolongwa ngatola Samula, kubhoka ku muche gwaku Maseleka, ngalongwicha.<verse eid="GEN 36:36" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Samula pajhomwika, Saule kubhoka ku muche gwaku Lehobote, chikibhii pahina na lukemba Efulate ngalongwicha.<verse eid="GEN 36:37" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Saule pajhomwika, Bale Hanane mwana jwa Akibole ngalongwicha.<verse eid="GEN 36:38" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Bale Hanane pajhomwika, Hadale ngalongwicha, kitamo chake kikolongwa kikibha ku Pau, na liina lya nhwana mundo likibha Mehetabele bite Matilede, na nchokolo jwa Mezahabu.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Ghanga ndi mahina gha ngolo bhubhahumila kwa Echau, kulongohana na mahina ghabhe, na kilambo chibhahumila na miche ibhalongwicha. Ikibha Timuna na Alova na Yateti, <verse eid="GEN 36:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />Oholibama na Ela na Pinone, <verse eid="GEN 36:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />Kenaze na Timane na Mibusale, <verse eid="GEN 36:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />Magidiele na Ilamu. Bhamba ndi akanahota bha lungolo lwa Edomu. Echau akibha hokolo jwa Edomu. Bhamanyikina kwa miche na ilambo ibhalongwicha.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s">Uchupo na akaacha mundo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Yakobu ngajhendilila kutama mu kilambo chuku Kaanane, mwatamita tatemundo ngita ng'ene. <verse eid="GEN 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />Ghanga ndi malobhe gha yana ya Yakobu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Uchupo pakibha na yaka likome limo na chaba, akibha achungita mambelele na mbuhe pamonga na akahacha mundo, Biliya na Zilifa akaana bha tate bhake. Uchupo ngannobholela tatemundo itendwa ibhoho ya akacha mundo.<verse eid="GEN 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Yakobu akate kumpala hake Uchupo kupeta yana yoha, nhwalo mwana jwampapite muighoe. Nganchone likanjo lililembelikwii hake. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Nambo akahacha mundo pibhalola kubhehe tate gwabhe atei kumpala hake Uchupo kupeta bhange, ngabhanchimwa ade kubhehe na maghonga.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Kilo jhimo, Uchupo ngalota maloto, nambo pabhachimulila akahacha mundo, bheniya ngabhachocha kunchimwa hake. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Ngabhalobholila, “Nnyokanikiye maloto ghanotite. <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />Nakaloti naha, tukibha twabhoa kung'onda, tukatabha ng'anda, papa pena ng'anda jhango, ngijhijhinuka nukujhema gwema. Ng'anda hino ngaikongana nu kuilitila ng'anda jhango.”<verse eid="GEN 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Akakolo mundo ngabhankonya, “Bho, mpakulongole kubhehe namutulongocha twenga? Amu mpakubhehe na ukindendeke kwa twenga?” Peniya ngabhachocha kunchimwa, nhwalo gwa maloto ghake pamo na malobhe ghake.<verse eid="GEN 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Peniya, Uchupo ngalota ghange maloto. Ngabhachimulila akahacha mundo kulonge, “Nnyokanikiye maha, notite maloto, lyobha na mwehe na ndondwa kome na lumo ikanitila nenga.”<verse eid="GEN 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Nambo panchimulila tatemundo na akaacha mundo maloto gheniya, tate mundo ngampwatalila kulonge, “Ndi maloto ghane gheniya ghinotite? Bho, chakaka kubhehe nenga na amajhe bhino pamonga na akaacha bhino natuika kuntami makilikite mwenga?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />Akaacha mundo ngabhammone wiho Uchupo, nambo tatemundo ngajhendelila kulinhwachila kilebhe chene.<verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uchupo bhitenda kunchulucha nukupelekwa ku Michile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Lichiko limo, akakolo mundo Uchupo ngabhajhenda kulucha inyama ya tate gwabhe pahina na ku Shekemo, <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />Yakobu ngannobholila Uchupo, “Mwenga mimanye, akalongo mundo bhijhenda ku Shekemo kulucha inyama.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:13">Uchupo ngajhangwila, “Tela tate, nanyenda.”<verse eid="GEN 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Yene, tatemundo ngalonge, “Nnyende makalole akaacha bhino na mambelele anda bhabhii njelembo, peniya mmujha kunnobholela, anda kwachela amu kwachela jhe.” Peniya Yakobu nganchindikicha Uchupo kubhoke pulikemba lyuku Hebulone.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:14">Uchupo pabhandikila ku Shekemo, <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />ngankole Uchupo akilyungalyunga palulambo, ngankonya, “Mwe nike mipalaha?”<verse eid="GEN 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Uchupo ngajhangwila, “Napalaha akakolo bhango, chonde unobholele kubhaluchi mambelele.”<verse eid="GEN 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Mundo jwenio nganyangwila, “Niwachii bhabhokite, nhwalo najhoina bhakalongela, bhijhenda ku Dotane.” Peniya, Uchupo ngabhakengima akakolo mundo, ngabhakole kwenio ku Dotane.<verse eid="GEN 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Akaacha bhake pibhammona abhii kutale, kabula anabhandikii jhe chehemo jhenio ngabhabheka ntemela gwa kunkoma. <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Ngabhapwepwelina, “Angota ahika jhola nnota maloto. <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Denda tunkome tukantaghila mu libhomba lyolyoha pakate jha ghanga, natwe twakalobholela atate kubhehe alegwitwe ni kinyama chikumanyahe. Peniya tughalole maloto ghake naghabha bho.”<verse eid="GEN 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Nambo Leubene pajhoha malobhe gheniya, ngapala kunkombo Uchupo mumabhoko ghabhe, yene ngabhalobhole akanung'una bhake, “Chonde tangankoma jhe.” <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />Leubene ngajhendelila kulonge, “Mbaha tuntumbukii mulibhomba lende panjenga nambo twangamengwa jhe.” Leubene palongila gheniya apata kunkombo Uchupo mumabhoko ghabhe. Peniya amujhiche kwa tate gwake. <verse eid="GEN 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Uchupo paika kwa akakolo mundo ngabhampukila kwa makakala nukenju likanjo lililembelikii maha. <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />Peniya, ngabhantaghila mulibhomba lyanga kilebhe hilu mache.<verse eid="GEN 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Pibhakibha bhalila chakulya ngabhapeta aka Ichumaile, bhakityanga tyanga kubhoke ku Gileade kujhenda ku Michile. Ngamiya yabhe igheghite miigho jha ubane na ntela ghulandana na ntomone na manemane. <verse eid="GEN 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Yuda ngabhalobhole akaacha mundo, “Natujhambulila nike anda tunkomite unung'una gwito na kuiya malelo ghake? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Mbaha tunchuluche kwa aka Ichumaile, nambo tupalwa jhe kunkoma nhwalo jwenio nnongo gwito kabhele ndi myahe jhimo.” Akalongo mundo ngabhannyeketile. <verse eid="GEN 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />Akachulucha ilebhe bhuku Midiane pibhaika chehemo jhenio, akakolo mundo ngabhampiya Uchupo mulibhomba lyenio ngubhanchulucha kwa Akaichumaile kwa ipande makome mabhele gha madine gha feza, na bheniya ngabhantola kujhenda nako ku Michile.<verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Leubene pabhujha kulingukii libhomba lela, amweni jhe Uchupo ngajwepu ngobho yake kwa ungolongonde, <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />ngabhajhendila akanung'una mundo, ngabhalobholila, “Kangombo abhii jhe mwono! Ngohe, ndenda bhole?”<verse eid="GEN 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Yene, ngabhachinja mbuhe, ngabhatola kanjo jha Uchupo nu kuchwiya mumyahe jha mbuhe jwenio. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Ngabhatoila likanjo na ngabhampelikila tate mundo nu kulonge, “Tulokwite likanjo lende, mililingukiye ote maha, pange lya mwanagwino.”<verse eid="GEN 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Tate gwabhe ngaimanya likanjo lyenio, ngalonge, “Chakaka likanjo lya mwanango! Kinyama chukumanyahe kite kunkwalakwata nu kummemena. Chakaka Uchupo alegwite nu kuanjwaanjwa.” <verse eid="GEN 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Peniya, Yakobu ngajwepwila nng'olole gwake kwa ungolongonde na ngawalita majafafa. Ngannelila mwana mundo kwa machiko ghamahele. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Yana yake inalome na ikeghe ngaikita kumpepecha tate gwabhe nambo jwenio ngakanita kupepechwa, yene, “Uneke, nanyendelela kulela malelo gha mwanango ade pumba kujhomoka.” Yene tate gwake ngajhendelila kunnelela Uchupo mwana gwake.<verse eid="GEN 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Machiko gheniya, kola ku Michile, Akamidiane ngubhanchulwicha Uchupo kwa mundo jwakemwa Potifa, jhumo panakate jha akatumiche bha Falao, jwenio akibha nkolongwa jwa ulonda jwa nyumba jha unahota.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s">Yuda na Tamale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Machiko gheniya Yuda, ngalekana na akalongo bhake, ngajhenda kutama na mundo jhumo, jwakemwa Hila jwa ku muche gwa Adulami. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Pakibha kwenio, Yuda ngammona bite Shuwa, jwaku Kaanane, ngatolana nako. <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />Bite Shuwa ngabhila na ndumbo ngapapa mwana munalome, na Yuda ngankema liina lyake Eri. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Peniya, ngapata jhenge ndumbo ngapapa mwana munalome, ngankema liina lyake Onani. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Ngajhendelila kupapa mwana jhonge munalome, ngankema liina lyake Shela. Shela pabhelwika, Yuda atamita ku muche gwa ku Kezibu.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Peniya, Yuda ngantolekecha mwikeghe mwana gwake jhulitibho, mwikeghe jwenio akemitwa Tamali. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Eri akibha jwanganandela palonge jha Bhambo, yene Bhambo Chapanga ngankomita. <verse eid="GEN 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Yene, Yuda ngannobholila Onani, “Mmujhii lipwela lya nnongo gwino, mwe ndi mipalwa kutenda yene kupala mupapile mwana nhwacha gwino.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Nambo Onani ngamanya kubhehe yana yenio naibhaha yakwe jhe. Yene pagholwika na mwikeghe jwenio mbejho yoha ngajhitila pahe kupala angampapii jhe mwana nhwacha mundo. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Chela chateila Onane, Bhambo Chapanga kikanhalalii jhe, yene helahela ngankoma Onane. <verse eid="GEN 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Peniya, Yuda ngannobholila kamwana mundo kubhehe, “Mmujhe kwa tate gwino, ntame manhwela ade papakuhamula manango Shela.” Yuda apwelila kubhehe Shela hele nakomwa ngita akahacha mundo. Yene Tamali ngabhujha kajhake.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Machiko ghamahele, nhwana mundo Yuda bite Shuwa ngajhomwika. Yuda pajhomolila kulela malelo ghake ngabhoka na nkoche mundo Hila, ku muche gwa Adulame, ngajhenda ku Timuna kuheketa mangoma gha mambelele ghake. <verse eid="GEN 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Tamali pajhoha kubhehe nkowano mundo abhii undela kujhenda ku Timuna kuheketa mangoma mambelele ghake, <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />ngaula ngobho ya malelo ya unahwela na ngakipuka kitambala kupala angamanyikana jhe, yene ngatama pannyango gwa kujhingilila ku Enaimu, chenda jhibhii undela jhuku Timuna. Ateila yene palola kubhehe Shela akibha akolite, nambo jwenie Tamali akalangii jhe abhehe nhwana mundo.<verse eid="GEN 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Yuda ngammona Tamali, ahambwika nngongola, mana akibha akitandite kumiho jhake. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Peniya, Yuda changamanya ngannyendila kamwana mundo, paupele jha ndela ngannobholila, “Mbala ng'oloke na mwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:16">Tamali pankonya, “Naumbela nike anda nnyeketile kugholoka na mwenga?”<verse eid="GEN 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Yuda nganyanguu, “Nanimpela mbuhe kubhoka muipugho yango.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:17">Tamali ngannobholila, “Naumbela nike kutama nacho ade pumba kuleta mbuhe.”<verse eid="GEN 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Yuda ngankonya, “Mipala kutama nacho kilebhe ghane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:18">Tamali ngajhangwila, “Umbe pete nu lughojhe lwake pamo na nkongocho ghunkamwile.” Peniya, Yuda ngampila ilebhe yenie yoha, ngagholwika nako. Tamali ngabhila na ndumbo. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Peniya, Tamali ngabhujha kajhake ngaula kitambala chake, ngawala kabhele ngobho yake yunahwela.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Yuda pantuma nkoche mundo Hila ampelekele mwikeghe jwenie mbuhe, kupala ammujhichile ilebhe yake, nambo Hila ankolii jhe mwikeghe jwenio. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Hila ngabhakonya akolo muche ghola gwa Enaimu, “Abhii kojhe mwikeghe nngongola jwatamita muupele jha ndela pahina na pambano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">Bhene ngabhannyangwila, “Chehemo jhenje, panabhehe jhe na mwikeghe nngongola.”<verse eid="GEN 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Peniya, nkoche mundo jhola ngabhujha kwa Yuda kunnobholela, “Nimpatite jhe! Kabhe akolo muche manobholii kubhehe panabhe jhe na mwikeghe jhojhoha nngongola.”<verse eid="GEN 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Yuda ngalonge, “Mneke atole ilebhe yene, anda jhe bhando apakutubheka tuhekwa. Mabhene nnolite kubhehe nganimpelikila mbuhe, nambo mumwenii jhe.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Puipetita myehe mitato bhando ngabhannobholila Yuda, “Tamali, kamwana gwino, ngohe angongola, abhii na ndumbo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Yuda ngaamulicha, “Mupikiye panja, ajhochwe mwotu ade aweghe.”<verse eid="GEN 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Pibhakibha bhampikiya panja, Tamali ngalaghila bhando bhajhende kwa nkowano mundo kulonge, “Ngwete ndumbo jwa mundo jhuna ilebhe henge. Ku yene, milolokeye maha ilebhe henge ya ghane? Pete jhenje nu lughojhe lwake na nkongocho ghone.”<verse eid="GEN 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Yuda ngaimanya ilebhe yenio, ngalonge, “Tamali jwaumbone palonge jha Chapanga kuliku nenga. Nhwalo nimpi jhe mwanango Shela abhehe ungana gwino.” Kuhumii lichiko lyenio Yuda agholwike jhe kabhele na Tamali.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Lichiko lya kupapa Tamali puliikita, ngimanyikina kubhehe ndumbo jhikibha jha mabhela. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Pulitumbwila lipyanda lya kupapa mwana jhumo ngapiya lubhoko lwake panja, na nkunga ngalutabha luche lukele lubhoko lwenio, ngalonge, “Jhonjo ndi mwana jwa litibho.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Nambo mwana jweno pawinicha lubhoko lwake nkate, unnung'una mundo ngatumbuu kubhelukwa. Nkunga ngalonge, “Mbone mwe mpetite kwa makakala?” Kuyene, ngankema mwana jweno Pelesi. <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Peniya, ngabhelwika unung'una abhii na luche lukele mulubhoko lwake, na jwenio ngakemwa Zela.<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s">Uchupo na nhwana jwa Potifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Peniya, Akaichumaile bhala ngabhantola Uchupo ade ku Michile, nu kunchuluchila Mmichile jhumo jwakemwa Potifa. Jwenio ndi akibha ntumiche jwa Falao na nkolo jwa bhalonda. <verse eid="GEN 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" />Bhambo Chapanga akibha pamonga na Uchupo, ngantangatila mu kila kilebhe chahengita. Uchupo ngahengita mahengo munyumba jha munahota gwake Mmichile. <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Munahota jwenio ngammanya kubhehe, Bhambo Chapanga abhii pamonga na Uchupo, ndi jwantangatila mu ilebhe yoha yateila Uchupo. <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Uchupo ngajheketilwa hake nnonge jha Potifa, ngabhe ntumiche jwakanjika na ngantenda nnonda na nnyemelela jwa ilebhe yake yoha. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Kutumbulii Potifa pammeka Uchupo kubhehe nnonda na nnyemelela jwa ilebhe yake, Bhambo Chapanga ngaipe mota yoha ibhii nkate jha Mmichile jwenio. Mota ya Bhambo ikibha mu kila chakibhanacho Potifa pakajhake nu kung'onda. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Kwa nhwalo gwenio, Potifa ngampe Uchupo ukindendeke mu ilebhe yake yoha, na Potifa ngaleka kutumika kwa chochoha nambo nga chakulya chake tugha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Uchupo akibha kangombo jhuna yegha jhina makalala na jwanyahinyahi.<verse eid="GEN 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Palonge pandina, aanabha bha Potifa ngang'ana Uchupo, ngannobholila, “Nng'oloke nanenga!” <verse eid="GEN 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Nambo Uchupo ngakana. Pannobholila mwikeghe jwenio, “Nenga angamwii ukindendeke mu kila kilebhe chochoha unyumba jhake jhenje, kila kilebhe chakwete angamwiye nenga nyemelele. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Pakajhango pano abhii jhe jhuna ukindendeke kumbeta nenga, anahota gwango anhibhiliki jhe kilebhe chochoha nambo nga mwe tugha maanamundo. Nahobhole kutenda gwanganandela nkolongwa gwenio nukuntende malemwa Chapanga?” <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Mwikeghe jwenio ngajhendilila kumpembekeya Uchupo kila lichiko, nambo Uchupo ngakana kugholoka nako.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Lichiko limo, Uchupo ngajhingii munyumba kuhenga lihengo. Nkate akibha jhe na ntumiche jhojhoha. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Peniya, aanabha gwa Potifa ngakamula nng'olole gwa Uchupo nu kulonge, “Nhwike nng'oloke na nenga!” Nambo Uchupo nganneke nng'olole gwake mulubhoko lwa mwikeghe jwenio nu kutilii panja. <verse eid="GEN 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Mwikeghe jwenio palola kubhehe Uchupo aulekite nng'olole gwake mulubhoko lwake nu kutilii panja, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />ngabhakema akatumiche bha pakajhake na kwalobholela, “Nnola! Mwibulaniya jwatuletii one kwa bhoha twenga. Ngaika kwango kumbala kunnimba, nambo ne ngangemita nnete. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Pajhohina nnete gwango, ngajhileka nng'olole gwake nu kutilii panja!”<verse eid="GEN 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Mwikeghe jwenio ngaibheka nng'olole gwenio ade pabhujha nnganamundo. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Nganchimulila nnganagwake nhwalo gwenio, “Ntumiche jwa Kiebulaniya jhummutuletii anhikilile kupala ambe one. <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />Nambo tu pungemita nnete, kupala bhando bhatangatile, ngajhileka nng'olole gwake nu kutilii panja.”<verse eid="GEN 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Potifa pajhohina malobhe gha nhwanamundo, ngayoma hake. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Ngantola Uchupo nu kuntabha mu kipungo, chehemo jhibhatabhitwe, akapungwa bha akanahota akakolongwa. <verse eid="GEN 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" />Nambo Bhambo Chapanga ngabhehe na Uchupo pamonga, ngampe mota na nkolongwa jwa kipungo ngahanganichwa nako. <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Yene, nkolongwa jwa kipungo ngammeka Uchupo kubhehe nkolo jwa akapungwa bhoha, kila kilebhe chikitendwa mwenio, kiteilwa kwa ukindendeke gwake. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Nkolongwa jwa kipungo jwenio akatei jhe kabhele kilebhe chochoha chankamwiywe Uchupo, nhwalo Chapanga akibha pamonga na Uchupo ngantangatila mu kila kilebhe chateila.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s">Uchupo ilonge mana jha maloto ya akapungwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Machiko ngaghapeta, akatumiche bhabhele bha Falao ngabhalemwiya nkolo jwabhe. Akatumiche bheniya akibha ntumiche jwa kutengenecha yukunywegha na nkolongwa jhu kuteleka mabumunda. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Falao ngabhachimwa akatumiche bhake bhabhele bheniya, <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />ngabhatabhita mukipungo munyumba jha nkolongwa jwa ulonda, chehemo papungitwa Uchupo. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Nkolo jwa ulonda ngahaghuu Uchupo bhatumikila. Na bhene bhakapungwitwe kwa machiko twe.<verse eid="GEN 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />Lichiko limo kilo, panakate jha bheniya bhabhele. Nkolongwa jwa kutenganecha yukunywegha na jhola nkolongwa jhukutengenecha mabumunda gha munahota nkolongwa jwaku Michile, ngabhalota maloto mu kipungo, kila mundo maloto ghake na mana ghake. <verse eid="GEN 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Uchupo pajhawila kwalola lukela, bhoha bhabhele bhakibha nu nhechuko hake. <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Yene, Uchupo ngabhakonya, akatumiche bheniya, bhubhakibha mu kipungo pamo na jwenio unyumba jwa ananhota bhake, “Kilebhe ghane nhechwikinge naha deleno?”<verse eid="GEN 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Ngabhannyangwila, “Tubhii nuhechuko nhwalo twabhoa tulotii maloto mu kipungo mwone, nambo abhii jhe mundo jwakutolongole mana jha maloto gheniya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:8">Peniya, Uchupo ngabhalongole, “Bho, kumanya mana jha maloto ndi lihengo lya Chapanga jhe? Ajha, njimulila maloto ghena.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Peniya, nkolongwa jwa kutengenecha yukunywegha ngachimulila maloto ghake, ngalonge, “Mumaloto ghango ngunubhona nchabibo nnonge jhango, <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />na gwenio nchabibo ukibha na ndabhe itato. Kipinde putumbwila kuipuka mahamba, malobha ghake pighatoloka ngibhonikina kihagho cha chabibo kijhelite. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Mulobhoko lwango nikibha ngamwii kikombe cha Falao, peniya ngamagwila chabibo nu kuminyii mu kikombe chenio, ngannipila Falao.”<verse eid="GEN 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Uchupo ngannobholila ntumiche jwenio, “Mana jha maloto ghino ndi jhenje, ndabhe itato ndi machiko matato. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />Mu machiko matato, Falao nampiya mu kipungo na kummeka kabhele palihengo lino. Mihoto kumpe kabhele kikombe Falao mulubhoko lwino ngita chiteila makacho. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Nambo chonde ninnyopa manganibhilila ilebhe pipakunyendela telatela. Undendela telatela na kungamuwa nnonge jha Falao, kupala mbite mu kipungo mwone. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Mana nenga nikatoilwe kwa makakala kukilambo chango cha Akaebulaniya na pa Michile pano kibhii jhe chindeile chikimbalwa ndabwe mu kipungo.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Nkolo jhu kuteleka mabumunda pajhoha maloto gha nnyake kuhalala, ngalonge, “Ata nenga nikalotite maloto! Mu maloto ghango nikibha ndwekile itandabhala itato ya mabumunda ghamaha. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Mu kitandabhala chu kunane pakibha na yakulya twe ikabanikwe kunhwalo gwa Falao. Nambo ijhune ikibha ihonywila muitandabhala pamuto gwango!”<verse eid="GEN 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Uchupo ngannobholila, “Mana jha maloto ghino ndi ghanga, itandabhala itato ndi machiko matato. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />Mu machiko matato gheniya, Falao nampiya mu kipungo kupala anhekete muto gwino na yegha jhino anhwomeka panane jha nkongo, na ijhune ihonyola yegha jhino.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Puliikita lichiko lyutato, ikibha ngombokelo lichiko lya kubhelukwa kwa Falao, jwenio ngabhalenganikiya ilongoche yake yoha unyagho gwa kubhelukwa. Ngabhampiya mukipungo, mundo jwake jhukutengenecha yukunywegha na mundo jwake jhukutengenecha mabumunda, ngabhabheka nnonge jha akatumiche bhake. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Falao ngammujhichila lihengo lyake ntengenecha yukunywegha kupala Falao antumikila kumpe kikombe. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />Nambo ntengenecha mabumunda jhola ngaheketwa muto, yegha jhake ngaihomekwa pankongo, ngita Uchupo pachimulila. <verse eid="GEN 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Nambo nkolo jhukutengecha yukunywegha, ngannibhilila Uchupo hilu ankombwike jhe.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s">Uchupo alonge mana jha maloto palonge jha Falao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Puipetita yaka ibhele, Falao ngalota maloto. Ngakibhona jwenio ajhemite paupele jha lukemba Naile. <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />Ngaibhona ng'ombi chaba inakuhalala na ikendite ikahuma kuloche kulye manyahe. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Peniya, ngaipiti ng'ombe henge chaba iakile nu kombala hake ngipeta mulukemba Naile, ngiika kujhema pahina na ng'ombe inakuhalala nu yukenda yela, paupele jha lukemba. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Ng'ombi chaba ikombii hake ngailye ng'ombi chaba inakuhalala nukenda. Peniya, Falao ngajhimuka mulughono. <verse eid="GEN 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Paghochila kabhele, ngalota kabhele. Ngaghabhona manjwanjwane chaba na jhina kuhalala jhikamelite mulitepo limo. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Peniya, manjwanjwane chaba ghighanying'inyile na ghajhomite nupepo gwa kunjenga ngiipitila. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Helahela manjwanjwane chaba ghighanying'inyile na jhijhomite jwenie ngimila manjwanjwane chaba mikolo jhitwelii mbonje. Peniya, Falao pajhimuka ngamanya kubhehe ghakibha maloto. <verse eid="GEN 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Pukuchila, Falao ngabhehe na mbwelelo hake, ngabhakema akaabhe bhoha bhuku Michile, na bhina malango, ngabhachimulila maloto ghake nambo akapitii jhe hilu jhumo jwakahotwi kunnobholela mana jha maloto ghake.<verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Peniya, nkolongwa jhukutengenecha yukunywe ngannobholila Falao, “Dele nukumanye kulemwa kwango! <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Utumonila wiho twenga twakatumiche bhino, nenga na nkolongwa jhukutengenecha mabumunda, ngamututabha munyumba jha nkolongwa jwa ulonda. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Uhiko ghumo ghatulota maloto, kila mundo na maloto ghake. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Peniya, kakombo jhumo Mwibulaniya, ntumiche jwa nkolongwa jwa ulonda. Putunchimulila maloto gwito, jwenio ngaotola kutulonge tela na maloto ghake. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Chalongila ndi chikipitile, nenga ngamujhila lihengo lyango. Na nkolongwa jhukuteleka mabumunda ngabhammamba munkongo.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Yene, Falao ngalaghila Uchupo akemwe, nwajwenio ngabhampiya mukipungo kajhombe. Pachekula majhunjo ghake nukuwala ngobho henge, Uchupo ngaika palonge jha Falao. <verse eid="GEN 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Falao ngannobholila Uchupo, “Nenga notite maloto, nambo apitii jhe mundo jhukunnobhelela mana ghake. Mwenga manumbilii, anda bhanchimulii maloto muhoto kulonge mana ghake.”<verse eid="GEN 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Uchupo ngannyangwila Falao, “Nenga nihoto jhe, nambo Chapanga nampela mana ghake.”<verse eid="GEN 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Peniya, Falao ngonnobholila Uchupo, “Notii naha, nikibha nyemite muupele jha lukemba Naile, <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />nganibhona ng'ombi chaba ina kuhalala nukenda yakabhoka kuloche kulye manyahe. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Yenie, ngaikengima ng'ombi henge chaba ikombile hake. Nenga nanaibhona jhe ng'ombi ngita yene pukilambo chuku Michile. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Peniya, ng'ombi ikombile yela ngaimila ng'ombi chaba ikendite. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Nambo ata puimilita ng'ombi ikendite, mundo jhojhoha ahotwi jhe kumanya kubhehe imilite ng'ombi ijhake, mana ikibha ikombile ngita makacho. Peniya nganyimuka mulughono. <verse eid="GEN 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />Peniya, nganotila maloto ghange, nginighabhona manjwanjwane chaba ghina kuhalala jhitwelii mbonje ikamela mulitepo limo. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Peniya, manjwanjwane ghange chaba majhejheto, jhinying'inyile jhijhomite nupepo ghukunjenga ngaghapitila. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />Manjwanjwane chaba ghighanying'inyile ngimila manjwanjwane chaba ghina kuhalala. Nganalobholela akaabhe maloto gheniya, nambo abhii jhe mundo jwahotwii kulonge mana ghake.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Peniya, Uchupo ngannobholila Falao, “Maloto gwino ghoha mabhele mana jhake jhimo tugha. Chapanga ayekulile ilebhe ipakuhenga kipinde chikipakuika. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Ng'ombi chaba inakuhalala ndi yaka chaba, na manjwanjwane chaba ghina kuhalala hele ndi yaka chaba. maloto gheniya mana jhake jhimo. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Ng'ombi chaba ikombile hake hela, ikengima ng'ombi ikendite na manjwanjwane chaba majhejheto, ijhomite nupepo ghuku njenga, mana ghake ndi yaka chaba ya njala. <verse eid="GEN 41:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />Ngita chininchimulila Falao, Chapanga ayekulile ilebhe ipakuhenga palonge. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Naipitila yaka chaba yu kujhukuta pikilambo choha chuku Michile. <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />Nambo puijhomoke jhenio, naikengama yaka chaba ya njala ade kulibhalila kujhukuta kwenio. Njala jhenio naikomelekea kilambo chenje. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Kujhukuta kwenio nakulibhililwa nhwalo njala ngolongwa jhipakupitila naibhaha pyepyepe hake. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Maloto ghino ghabhujhii pabhele mana ghilandana kunangiya Chapanga apangite gheniya, na jwenio Chapanga nalenganikiya kilebhe chenio machiko ghapahina.<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />“Ku yene, ipalwa ngohe, Falao, munhaghu mundo jhuna malango nu kumanya, mumpe lihengo likulolekeya kilambo choha chuku Michile. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Falao, mahaghule bhikujhemelela bhandina pikilambo cheno, malaghila bhatole lipungo lu nhwano lya mahuno ghoha mu Michile kwa kipinde cha yaka chaba jhukujhukuta jheno. <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />Malaghile bhikujhemelela bheniya bhatole yakulya yoha ya yaka chaba iika. Yakulya yenio ibhekwa mukindendeke gwino, kibhaha kihukilo cha yakulya kwa miche jhoha na bheniya bhakijhemelela maha. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Chakulya chenio kibhaha kihukilo kupala bhando bhuku Michile bhangawe jhe kwa njala.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uchupo ibhekwa kilongoche ku Michile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Lyalongila Uchupo ngalibhonikina lyambone palonge jha Falao na akatumiche bhange bhoha. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Falao, ngabhakonya akatumiche bhake, “Mundo ojho abhii nu uhuke gwa Chapanga! Bho, tuhoto kumpata jhonge mundo ngita jhonjone?” <verse eid="GEN 41:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Peniya, Falao ngannobholila Uchupo, “Nhwalo Chapanga annaite ghoha ghano, abhii jhe mundo jhonge jhuna malango nu kumanya ngita mwenga. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Mwenga ndi jhumpakujhemelela kilambo chango na bhando bhoha nabhabha pahe jha kindendeke chino. Ne tugha ndi nakolongwa kupeta mwenga mana ndamii kighoda chunahota nkolongwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Peniya, kuhumi ngohe nihaghuu mwenga kubhehe makilongoche bhikilambo choha chuku Michile!” <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />Peniya, Falao ngaula lupete jhina unepo mulukonje lwake nu kuwalicha Uchupo, ngawalicha likanjo lyamaha lihuo na nkupo gwa chaabo muntandala. <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Falao nganhobhokee Uchupo mutuka jhake jhenge jhijhiutwa na falache ngita ntangatila jwake na akalonda ngabhalongolila palonge jha Uchupo bhakilongela kanonoho, “Mmambale! Mmambale!” Yene Falao panhagwila Uchupo kubhehe kilongoche pakilambo chuku Michile. <verse eid="GEN 41:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Peniya, Falao ngannobholila Uchupo, “Ne, Nafalao, nahota nkolongwa! Mundo jhojhoha pakilambo choha chuku Michile angantenda jhe kilebhe chochoha changajheketela mwenga.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Falao ngankema Uchupo liina lya Kimichile, Safenasi Paneya. Falao ngantolakiya mwikeghe Uchupo, Asanate bite Potifela, mpiya litambiko jhuku kilambo chuku One. Peniya Uchupo ngatumbu kutyangi kilambo choha chuku Michile. <verse eid="GEN 41:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Uchupo pakibha na yaka makome matato ngatumbu kuntumikila Falao, munahota nkolongwa jhuku Michile. Uchupo ngabhoka kajhake Falao nu ngatyangila kilambo choha chuku Michile.<verse eid="GEN 41:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Muyaka chaba ya mota, mighonda jhuku Michile ngimota hake ilebhe. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Uchupo ngakongo yakulya yoha kipinde chenio cha yaka chaba yu kumota nukubheka kihukilo cha yakulya kubhoke mu mighonda jhibhii pahina na muche. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Uchupo ngabheka kihukilo twe ya kulya yangabhalangika ngita ncheke gwu kumbwane.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Kabula jha yaka chaba ya njala kupitila, Uchupo akibha apapite yana ibhele kunhwanamundo, Asanate bite Potifela, mpiya litambiko jwa kilambo chuku One. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Uchupo ngankema mwana mundo jhulitibho Manache, kulonge, “Chapanga andei nibhalile kulagha kwango kwoha na akalongo bha nyumba jha tategwango.” <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Mwana mundo jhuubhele ngankema, Efulaimo, kulonge, “Chapanga ambii yana mu kilambo cha malagho ghango.”<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Yaka yene chaba yu kumota mu kilambo chuku Michile ngaipeta. <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />Yaka chaba ya njala ngaipitila ngita chalongila Uchupo. Ilambo henge yoha ngibhe na njala, nambo kilambo choha chuku Michile kikibha na yakulya mbwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Akamichile pibhatumbwila kulela njala, ngabhannelila Falao abhape chakulya. Falao ngabhalobholela Akamichile bhoha, “Nnyendangane kwa Uchupo, chapakunnobholela nkamulila.” <verse eid="GEN 41:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Njala ngaichocha kubhehe ngolongwa mu kilambo choha chuku Michile. Yene, Uchupo ngajhogwila ikoko yoha, ngabhachulwichila Akamichile yakulya nhwalo njala ikibhe ngolonga hake. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Bhando ngabhabhoke mu ilambo henge ngabhaika ku Michile kwa Uchupo kueme yakulya, nhwalo njala ikibha ngolonga pannema poha.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s">Akang'una bha Uchupo bhijhenda ku Michile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Yakobu pajhoha kubhehe chakulya kibhii ku Michile, ngailobholila yanamundo, mbone ntamingine nukuloleya tugha? <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Ngajhendelela kwalobholela kubhehe, “Ku Michile kibhii chakulya. Nnyendangane kwenio makaemele chakulya kupala twakawe jhe na njala.” <verse eid="GEN 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Yene, akanung'una kome bha Uchupo ngabhajhenda ku Michile kueme chakulya. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Nambo Yakobu annekiti jhe Benjamine, unung'una jwa Uchupo, ajhende pamonga na mangota mana aholila pange jhe kihoto kunkolela kilebhe kibhoho.<verse eid="GEN 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Peniya, yana ya Akachilahele ngiika ku Michile ilongwine na bhando bhange bhibhajhenda kueme chakulya, nhwalo kukilambo chuku Kaanane pakibha na njala hele. <verse eid="GEN 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Uchupo akibha kilongoche nkolongwa kwenio ku Michile. Uchupo ndi jwajhemilila kwachuluchila chakulya bhando bhoha. Peniya, akawacha mundo ngabhaika nukutama makilikite palonge jha Uchupo. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Uchupo ngabhabhona akalongo mundo na kwamanya, nambo ngatenda ngita abhamanyii jhe, ngalonge nabho kuukale. Ngabhakonya, “Mangota mwe mibhoke koo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:7">Ngabhajhangwila, “Tubhoke kukilambo chuku Kaanane, tuikite kueme chakulya.”<verse eid="GEN 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Pamo na Uchupo kwamanya akalongo mundo, nambo bhene bhumanyii jhe. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />Uchupo ngakombokela maloto ghake gha makacho ngabhalobholila, “Mangota makalingukii. Nhikingine kulingukiya kilambo chito.”<verse eid="GEN 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Bhene ngabhalonge, “Nai jhe, manahota bhito.” Twenga akatumiche bhino tuikila kueme chakulya. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Twenga ndi twalukolo, yana ya tate jhumo. Twenga ndi bhando bhituhobholeka, twakalingukii jhe.<verse eid="GEN 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Nambo Uchupo ngaghaghalila kulonge, “Nai jhe! Nhikingine kulingukiya kilambo chito.”<verse eid="GEN 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Nambo ngabhalonge, “Twenga akatumiche bhino, tubhii kome na bhabhele bha kinyongo chimo, jwaitama kukilambo chuku Kaanane. Unung'una gwito aighilile na tate ukajha, na ungung'una jhonge ajhomwike.”<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Nambo Uchupo ngalonge, “Ndi ngita punnongila, mangotamwe makalingukii tugha. <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Yene, ndi chimpakujhighanikilwa, ngohe nilapi kwa liina lya munahota nkolongwa Falao. Mibhoka jhe pamba ade papakuika unung'una gwino. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Munnaghalikiya jhumo panakate jhino kunneta unung'una gwino jwenio, bhange mnnendela mukipungo. Peniya malobhe gwino naghamanyika kubhehe chakaka. Anda nai jhe, nilapa kwa liina lya Falao, kubhehe mangota ndi akalingukii tugha!” <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Peniya, ngabhabheka bhoha mukipungo kwa machiko matato.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Mulichiko lya utato Uchupo ngabhalobholila, “Nhwalo ne ndi mundo jwa Chapanga, nhenga chininnobholela kupala nnamengane. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Anda chakaka mangota mabhando bhukuhobholeka, jhumo panakate jhino aighala mukipungo na bhange bhabhotuya chakulya kwa akalongo bhino bhina njala. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Peniya, mukanneta unung'una gwino kwango. Yene, ndi nailangiya uchakaka gwa malobhe gwino, na mangota nankomwe jhe.” Ngabhajheketela kutenda yenio.<verse eid="GEN 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Ngabhalobhlilana bhene chika kubhehe, “Chakaka twe tulagha nhwalo tukannemwii hake unung'una gwito. Pamo tummonita akalombola umwojho gwake, twenga tunkannyokanikii jhe ata patumbembelekiya.”<verse eid="GEN 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Leubene ngabhalobholila, “Bho, nenga nakannobholiii jhe twangammengwa unung'una gwito? Nambo mangotamwe machikilo gwino majhumo! Ngohe tung'ahika nhwalo gwa chela chituntendii.” <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Bhene bhakamanyii jhe kubhehe Uchupo akibha aghamanye ghoha ghibhalongila mana pibhalongila bhalongila kupete mundo jhonge. <verse eid="GEN 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Uchupo ngaheghila pandina, ngapiya mahole tyee. Pakotwika, ngaika kulonge nabho kabhele. Peniya ngamupukila Chimeone nukutabha pingo palonge jha miho ghabhe.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akalongo bha Uchupo bhibhujha ku Kanaane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Uchupo ngaamulicha, mahako ghabhe bhatweleya yakulya, kila mundo bhamujhichila mbijha yake mulihako lyake, na bhampela machulopo. Ngabhatenda gheniya ghoha. <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />Peniya, akalongo mundo ngabhaghatweka maponda ghabhe mihigho jha yakulya, ngabhajhawila. <verse eid="GEN 42:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Pibhaika pakighono undela, jhumo kate jhabhe ngakwiula lihako lyake kupala alipe liponda lyake, ngakangicha kubhona mbijha yake panane jha nnomo gwa lihako lyake. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Ngabhalobholila akalongo mundo, “Mbijha yango amujhichile. Henge pamba mu lihako lyango!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:28">Pibhajhoha gheniya, ngabhahechwika. Nu kuloleana kumiho kongo bhikilendema nukonyana, “Chenje kilebhe ghane chatutendii Chapanga?” <verse eid="GEN 42:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Pibhaika ku Kaanane kwatate gwabhe, ngabhachimulila ghoha ghighapitii, ngibhalongila, <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />“Nkolo jwa kilambo chela ngalongila natwenga kukupwata, nukutuwachii twenga twakaingukii pikilambo chake. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Nambo ngabhannyangwila, ‘Twakaingukiii jhe,’ ngatulonge kubhehe twenga twabhando bhukuhobholeka hake. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />Nambo ngabhalonge, twenga akatumiche bhino, tubhii kome na bhabhele bha kinyongo chimo, jwaitama kukilambo chuku Kaanane. Unung'una gwito aighilile na tate ukajha, na ungung'una jhonge ajhomwike. <verse eid="GEN 42:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />Peniya, nkolongwa jwa kilambo chenio ngalonge, ‘Yene, ndi chimbakumanya kubhehe mangota ndi mabhando bhukuhobholeka. Mukannete nnongo gwino jhumo, na bhange bhakalekela yakulya kajhino kakalongo bhino bhina njala. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Peniya, mukanneta unung'una gwino kwango. Yene, ndi nailangiya uchakaka gwa malobhe gwino makalingukii jhe, nambo mabhando bhukuhobholeka. Anda ntei gheniya unnung'una gwino naninnekekeya akityangila tugha, namangota nannyeketelwa kuchulucha ilebhe mu kilambo chenje.’”<verse eid="GEN 42:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Pibhajhakina ilebhe mumahako ghabhe, ngabhahechwika kulola kila mundo abhujhichilwe mbijha yake nkate jha lihako lyake. Pibhalola gheniya, bhoha pamonga na akatate bhabhe ngabhajhogwipa hake. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Yakobu tate mundo ngalonge, “Umboka yana yango! Uchupo abhii jhe, na Chimeone abhii jhe, na ngohe mipala kuntola Benjamine. Ghoha ghambatite nenga!”<verse eid="GEN 42:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Peniya, Leubene ngannobholila tatemundo, “Anda ninnetite jhe Benjamine, mikoma yana yango ibhele. Munneke Benjemine mulubhoko lwango, nenga nanninchunga nukunneta kwino.”<verse eid="GEN 42:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Nambo tatemundo ngalonge, “Mwanango ajhendajhe namangota, unung'una mundo ajhomwike, jhonjo kanjika ndi jwaighilile. Nenga ng'oime anda mwana jhonjo apakupata indondo yoyoha hela umwanja gwapakujhenda mmanya nanhwa kwa ungolongonde.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s">Benjamine ijhenda ku Michile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Njala ngaichikana hake, kukilambo chuku Kaanane. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Yene, pibhajhomwila chakulya chibhahemila ku Michile, Yakobu ngailobholila yana yake, “Nnyende kabhele ku Michile, mukatuhemele chakulya chenge.”<verse eid="GEN 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Nambo Yuda ngannobholila tate mundo, “Mundo jwenio akatulakalii hake, alongila, ‘Nimpoke jhe nu kuika jhe na unung'una gwino.’ <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Anda nnyeketile tujhenda pamonga na unung'una gwito, bhahe, natujhenda kunhemele chakulya. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Nambo anda nnyeketii jhe alongohana na twenga, mmanya tujhenda jhe kwenio, nhwalo mundo jwenio akalongii hotuhotu, ‘Natukongana jhe anda nu kuika jhe pamonga na unung'una gwino.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Ichilahele ngalonge, “Nhwalo gwa nike umekite mumalagho kukulonge mundo jwenio kubhehe nkwete unung'una gwino jhonge?”<verse eid="GEN 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Ngabhanyangwila, “Mundo jwenio ngatukonyikiya hake nhwalo gwa lungolo lwito na akilongela, ‘Bho, tate gwino abhii ghome? Bho, nkwete unung'una jhonge?’ Twe tunyangita tela na chatukonyita. Ngatuhotwi bhole kumanya kubhehe natulongelela, munnete unung'una gwino?”<verse eid="GEN 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Peniya, Yuda ngannobholila tate mundo, “Unnyeketele nenga nyabhu nako tukaheme chakulya, anda yene jhe mwenga na yana ito tukoto kunhwe na njala. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Namwete nanalonda amwana bhino. Anda nakumujhicha jhe nu kummona kwa miho gwino mabhene, lukokoleko lubhaha nanenga machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Ikabhii nakiyoto jhe, ngatujhawii kweno na kubhujhii pabhele.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Peniya, tate gwabhe ngalonge, “Ajha! Anda ipalwa itendika yene, mungheghela hupo mundo jwenio. Mahuta ghandina gha ukwajho na bhuche gwandina nu ubane na manemane na kungu na loze. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Nghegha mbijha yukuhemele chakulya chenge, mangalibhilila jhe kubhujhicha mbijha yela ibhekitwa mumahako gwino, pangejhe bhakalebhelile kwitola. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Helahela nnongoana na unung'una gwino, nnyenda nako kwa mundo jwenio. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Chapanga jhuna Makakala mmonela kiha palonge jha mundo jwenio, annekekeya unung'una gwino Benjamine bhabhujha pamonga na mangota. Nenga anda mbaligwa kuwelelwa na yana yango, bhahe unneka hwelelwa tugha!”<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Bhahe, ngabhatola hupo, na mbijha mala pabhele, ngabhajhenda kajhombe ku Michile pamonga na unnung'una gwabhe Benjemine. Pibhaikita tugha, ngabhajhenda kujhema palonge jha Uchupo. <verse eid="GEN 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Uchupo pammonita Benjamine abhii pamo na bhena, ngannobholila nnonda bha nyumba jhake, “Mapeleke bhando bhamba kajhango, nchinja kinyama chimo nukulenganikiya maha, nhwalo bhando bheniya mbala kulabhuka nabho muhe.” <verse eid="GEN 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Ntumiche jwenio ngateila ngita chalaghalikilwe, ngabhapelika akaghene kajha kwa Uchupo.<verse eid="GEN 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Nambo pibhalola bhipelekwa kajha kwa Uchupo ngabhabhila na kiholo, ngabhapwepwilina bhene chika, “Bhutuletite kongo nhwalo gwa mbijha itubhekwila mumahako ghito kupala akola chikutukopokeya kutolongela nu kutupoka maponda ghito nu kututenda akabhanda bhake.” <verse eid="GEN 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Yene, ngabhannyendila nnonda jwa nnyango panyumba jha Uchupo ngabhalongila na nnonda pahina. <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />Ngabhalongila, “Chonde amanahota! Twenga ngatuika pamba mwanja ghukutumbula kuheme chakulya. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />Pituhikita pakighono, ngatuhambughina mahako gwito, ngatuhechwika kuikole mbijha kwa kila mundo ibhii mulihako lyake mbina. Deleno tuhikite kummujhichila mbijha jhito. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Helahela tuhikite na mbijha henge yukuheme chakulya. Tummanyi jhe jwabhekite mbijha yenio mu mahako ghito.”<verse eid="GEN 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Nnonda jwenio ngabhajhangwila, “Nkoto kupwelela hilu kujhoghopa. Chapanga jwino, Chapanga jwa tate gwino ndi jwamekila mbijha mu mahako gwino. Nenga ndi jhumbokila mbijha ino.” Peniya, ngabhannetila Chimione.<verse eid="GEN 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Nnonda jwenio ngabhajhingii unyumba jha Uchupo, ngabhape mache gha kukuwa makongono ghabhe na maponda ghabhe ngaghape chakulya. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Na bhene ngabhapiya hupo yabhe yakumpe Uchupo pahika muhe, nhwalo bhakajhoine kubhehe nabhalya pamonga najwenio. <verse eid="GEN 43:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Uchupo pabhujhita kajhake, ngabhampila hupo ibhakinayo, ngabhannyinamila palonge jhake. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Uchupo ngabhajhambucha nu kulonge, “Mukanjimulii nhwalo gwa oko gwino tategwino, bho, kubhii kunchela? Bho, abhii ghome?”<verse eid="GEN 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Ngabhanyangwila, “Ntumiche gwino, tategwito, kunchelela na abhii ghome.” Peniya ngabhannyinamila.<verse eid="GEN 43:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Uchupo pajhinuka nu kulola ngammona Benjamine, unnung'una mundo, mwana jwa majhe mundo, ngalonge, “Bho, jhonjo ndi unnung'una gwino jhola jhumunnongila? Peniya ngalongila kangombo, Chapanga ampe mota!” <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Papa tugha, Uchupo ngabhoka, nhwalo gwa lipyanda umwojho gwake, ngajhingii muchumbe chake, ngalelila mwenio. <verse eid="GEN 43:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Pakuita kumiho jhake, ngapita mwenio kongo akikwima mwojho, ngaamulicha akabhanda bhake bhaleta chakulya. <verse eid="GEN 43:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Uchupo ngabhammekila chakulya chake pakanjika, na akolongo mundo hele kabhabhekila pakanjika, na Akamichile hele bhabhila pakanjika, nhwalo nhwilo Akamichile kulye pamonga na Akabulaniya. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Akalongo bhake Uchupo ngabhatama nnonge jhake kukengama yaka yabhe, kutumbulii mwana jhukutumbula ade jhukujhomolela, ngabhalolekiyana kongo bhakihechukana. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Ngabhapeilwa Chakulya chikibhi pamecha jha Uchupo nakwepe bheniya, nambo Benjamine ngapata mala pa nuhwano hake kwapeta akajhake. Peniya, ngabhalye nu kunywelekeya nu kukianga pamonga na Uchupo.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s">Kikombe kibhonekana kwa Benjamine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Uchupo ngannaghila nnonda jwa nyumba jhake kukulonge, “Ntwele yakulya mumahako gha bhando bhamba tela na chibhahoto kughegha. Peniya, mmeka mbijha gwa kila mundo mulihako lyake. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />Peniya, bheka kikombe chango cha madine gha feza mulihako lya mwana nnchokombe, pamonga na mbijha yake.” Nnonda jwenio ngateila ngita chilaghilwa na Uchupo. <verse eid="GEN 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Pukuchila tugha, bhando bheniya ngabhalekwa bhajhende pamonga na maponda ghabhe. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Pibhabhoka pabomane bhajhendikii jhe, Uchupo ngannobholila ntumiche jhake, “Jhomboteka! Makengame bhando bheniya, pimapa kwakolela, makonye, ‘Kunike nnepite ghanganandela kwa ghambone? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Nhwalo ghane nkwatwii kikombe cha madine gha feza cha anahota bhango? Bho, chenje ndeka chanywele anahota bhango nu kulondolela? Nnemwingine hake kukutenda yenio!’ ”<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Nnonda jwenio pabhakolila ngabhalobholila malobhe gheniya. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Nambo bhene ngabhankonya, “Anahota, mmii nama ghane kutulonge malobhe ngita gheniya? Twenga akatumiche bhino tuhoto jhe kuhenga kilebhe ngita chenio! <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Nkombokela, manahota, mbijha itukolila mumahako ghito, ngatubhujhicha kuhumii mu kilambo chuku Kaanane. Naibhabhole tukwatuu mbijha amu chaabo munyumba jha anahota bhino? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />Ngohe, anda mundo jhojhoha panakate jhito abhii na kikombe chenio, akomwa na bhange twenga natubhaha akabhanda bhino.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Nnonda jwenio ngalonge, “Tela, ibhehe ngita chinnongii. Pakate jhino jhojhoha jhumbakunkolela na kikombe chenio, nabhaha mmanda jwango, nambo mabhangemwe nannekekelwa.” <verse eid="GEN 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Kila mundo ngauluya kajhombe lihako lyake nu kuhatambula. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Peniya, nnonda jwenio ngahambwila kila lihako, ngatumbuu lya nkolo gwabhe nu kujhomolela. Kikombe ngibhakikolila mulihako lya Benjamine. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Peniya, ngabhajwepwila ngobho yabhe kwa lipyanda. Kila mundo ngalitweka liponda lyake nhwigho nu kubhujha kubomane.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Yuda na akalongo mundo ngabhaika pakajha kwa Uchupo na jwenio akibha papa, peniya ngabhannyinamila palonge jhake, <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Uchupo jwenio ngabhakonya, “Nhwalo ghane ntei yene? Bho, mmanyijhe namundo anda nenga ngwete uhotolo ghu kulondola?”<verse eid="GEN 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Yuda ngalonge, “Tulongela kilebhe ghane anahota? Tulongila kilebhe ghane kulangii tukwete jhe lilemwa? Chapanga aghamwene malemwa ghito, twe akabhanda bhino. Ngohe twabhoha tubhii, twenga akabhanda bhino, twenga pamonga na jwajho jhumunkolii na kikombe chino.”<verse eid="GEN 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Nambo Uchupo ngalonge, “Ijhe! Nenga nitenda jhe gheniya! Jhola tugha jhuninkolii na kikombe chango ndi nabhaha mmanda jwango. Mangota bhange mihoto kujhenda kwa uteeke kwa tate gwino.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda inkengelela Benjamine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Yuda ngammandikila Uchupo nukulonge, “Manahota, nijhopa natumiche bhino, nonge namwe nhwalo gwandina, chonde ninnyopa manganjimwa jhe, nhwalo mwe ngita Falao jwene.” <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Manahota mwe ngamutukonya, Bho, tukwete atatebhito amu unung'una bhito? <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Natwe ngatujhangwila hena, Tukwete atate abhi ghome na aghoime, nu tukwete unnung'una gwito jhonge jwabhelwike mughohe. Nhwacha mundo ajhomwike na jwenio unnung'una ndi nganjika jwaighalile kwa majhe mundo, na tate mundo ndi antenda nkongocho gwake. <verse eid="GEN 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />Manahota, ngamutulaghila twe akatumiche bhino, tunnete jwenio kupala mummone. <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Ngutulonge, kangombo jwenio ahotojhe kunneka tatemundo, mana anda atei yenio, atate mundo kuwegha. <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Nambo manahota ngammutulonge kubhehe nu kuhika jhe unnung'una gwito jwenio, namutupoke jhe kabhele.<verse eid="GEN 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />Putubhujhita ukajha kwa tate gwito, ngatunnobholila ghumutulaghila, manahota. <verse eid="GEN 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />Peniya, tate gwito ngatulaghila tuike kabhele kuheme chakulya. <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />Nambo ngatunnobholila, Tuika jhe, pange tu anda unng'una gwito natulongohana mwanja pamo na twenga, anda tulongohine pamo na mundo jwenio natupoke ng'o. <verse eid="GEN 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />Peniya, atate gwito atumiche bhino, ngubhalonge, Umanyingine kubhehe aanabhango Alahele akambapiii yana ibhele inalome, <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />jhumo ngahobhalila kilambo, nenga nganongila, pange jhe ahanjaline ni kinyama chukumanyahe, mana abhonikine jhe kabhele. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Mipalakuntola na mwana ojho, jwenio anda alegwite hele, mmanya naunjika umambe kwa lipyanda na ughogholo gwango. <verse eid="GEN 44:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30" />Yene, manahota anda mujhite kwa tate bhango ntumiche gwino changa mwana ojho, na tate mwojho ghoha ubhii kwa jwenio, <verse eid="GEN 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31" />anda alolite mwana jwenio abhii jhe na twenga, nahwa! Yene, twe twakatumiche bhino, natunkoma tate gwito kwa ungolongonde. <verse eid="GEN 44:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />Namwete nantumiche bhino nganongila naninnonda mwana jwenio kwa uchakaka, anda nu kummujhiche jhe Benjamine kwino, lukokoleko lubhaha kwa nenga, machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="GEN 44:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />Ngohe, manahota, chonde ninnyopa, nhighale mme nabhanda kuliko mwana ojho. Munneke jwenio abhujhe kajha pamonga na akakolo mundo. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />“Nanhotola bhole kwabhujhii atate bhango changa kangombo jhonjone? Ninhoto jhe kuimbilila ungolongonde ghupakunkolela tate gwango.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s">Uchupo itenda kukilaya kwa akalongo bhake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Peniya, Uchupo ngalepelela kukiibhila nnonge jha bhoha bhibhakibha bhatamingine peniya ngalela kanonoya, na ngaamulicha akalaghalikihe bhapite panja. Uchupo ngaighila kanjika pakilangiya kwaakalongo mundo. <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Uchupo ngalela kanonoya ade Akamichile ngabhannyoa pamonga na bhando bha Falao na bhene hele ngabhannyoa. <verse eid="GEN 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Uchupo ngabhalobholela akalongo mundo, “Nenga ndi Uchupo, Bho, atate bhango bhabhii ghome?” Nambo akalongo mundo pibhajhoina bhakajhogwipe hake, ngabhahoti jhe kunnyanguu. <verse eid="GEN 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Uchupo ngabhalobholela akalongo mundo, “Chonde nhweghelele pahina na nenga.” Pibhanhweghelela ngalonge, “Nenga ndi unung'una gwino Uchupo jhumuchulwicha ku Michile.” <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Nambo mingahechuka jhe hilu kukokoleka nhwalo mkandei kunjulucha. Chapanga ndi jwanetita kongo ninnongolele, kupala niughombole ughome gwa bhando. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Chenje ndi chaka chuubhele ngohe, njala piijhingile pakilambo, na iighii yaka nhwano jhenge bhando bhilema jhe hilu kuuna. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Nambo Chapanga anetite kongo nannongolele, kupala nikombole kwa ndela jhenje ngolongwa, ndi namekele chakulya pakilambo na kwaghombola mumalagho makolo. <verse eid="GEN 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />Kuyene, mangota tujhe jhunetite nenga kongo, nambo Chapanga. Ndi jwandei natate kwa Falao, nkolo jwa nyumba jhake jhoha na kilongoche jwa kilambo choha cha ku Michile. <verse eid="GEN 45:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />“Ngohe, ntenda kajhombe, nnyende kwa tate gwango mukannobholela, Uchupo mwana gwino, ‘Ilonge, Chapanga andei mme nakilongoche nkolongwa kukilambo choha chuku Michile. Yene, mangabhehe jhe nakiyoto kuika kajhango. <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />Namwe natama pakilambo cha ku Gochene pahina na nenga, mwenga na yana ino nichokolo ino na ipogho ino na ilebhe ino yoha na mbuhe hino na mambelele hino na ng'ombi hino yoha. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Pumpakubhehe ku Gochene, nenga nanintunja mwenga akolongo bhino pamonga na ipugho ino kupala mingahwe jhe njala, nhwalo ihighi yaka henge nhwano ya njala.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />Peniya, Uchupo ngajhendelela ngalonge, “Mangota mabhene nnolite kwa miho gwino na ata unnung'una gwango Benjamine alolite kwa miho ghake kubhehe ndi nenga Uchupo jhunilonge na mangota chakaka ndi Uchupo. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Makalobholela tate bhango pinimanyikana pa Michile, pamonga na ghoha ghimaghawene. Ajha, nnyomboteke makannetela pamba tate gwango.”<verse eid="GEN 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Yene, Uchupo ngankumbatila unnung'una mundo Benjamine, bhoha ngabhalela kone bhakumbataline. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Kongo ajhendelela kulela, Uchupo ngabhakumbatila akalongo mundo. Peniya akalongo bhake ngabhaotola kulonge nako.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Mihalo jwenio piikita kunyumba jha munahota nkolongwa Falao, ngita akalongo mundo Uchupo bhaikite, Falao ngahangana hake kumwojho pamo na akatumiche bhake. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Falao ngannobholela Uchupo, “Malobholela akalongo bhino bhaghatwegha maponda ghabhe miigho, bhabhujhe kukilambo cha ku Kaanane, <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />Peniya, bhanneta pamba tate gwino na akolongo mundo bhoha. Nenga nanapela chehemo jhambone mukilambo chuku Michile, kwenio nabhahanganila ilebhe yoha ibhoke mukilambo chenje. <verse eid="GEN 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />Helahela malobholela bhatola mutuka ihutwa ninyama kwileta yana yabhe ing'enya na akaanabhabhe na atatemundo. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Malobholela mangahole jhe kunhwakolo gwa ilebhe yabhe nhwalo chehemo jhambone kupeta poha pikilambo chuku Michile napabhaha pabhe.”<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Yene, Yana ya Yakobu ngaitenda ngita chibhalaghalikilwe. Uchupo ngabhape mutuka tela na palaghila Falao pamonga na machulupo ghundela. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Peniya, ngampe kila mundo panakate jhabhe ngobho yukuwala, nambo ngampe Benjamine ipande miyatato ya mbijha pamonga na ngobho nhwano yukujhangangana. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Uchupo ngakamwiya hupo henge kwa tatemundo Yakobu, nhwalo gwa mwanja gwabhe gwa ghuhika ku Michile, maponda kome ghighagheghite ilebhe yambone yuku Michile na maponda ghankolo kome ghighagheghite yakulya, mabumunda na yakulya umwajha. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Peniya, Uchupo ngatabhukina akalongo mundo. Pibhakibha bhabhokita ngabhakelewiya, kulonge, “Mangakwapana jhe undela!”<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Yene, ngabhabhoka ku Michile nu kubhujha kajhabhe kwa tate gwabhe Yakobu, kukilambo chuku Kaanane. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Ngabhannobholila tate gwabhe, “Uchupo abhii ghome! Jwenio ndi kilongoche jwa kilambo chuku Michile!” Peniya Yakobu ngakangicha hake, nambo akakung'i jhe malobhe ghabhe.<verse eid="GEN 45:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Nambo pibhanchimulila ghoha ghabhalaghila Uchupo na pabhona mutuka ghipelikilwa na Uchupo akantole, Yakobu ngahangina hake. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Yakobu ngalonge, “Ngohe jhojwa kumwojho, mwanango Uchupo abhii ghome! ngohe Mbakujhenda nakammone nu kujhomoka jhe.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu na akalongo mundo bhijhenda ku Michile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Peniya, Yakobu ngabhoka pamonga na ilebhe yake yoha ngajhenda ku Michile. Paikita ku Belicheba, ngampikiya litambiko Chapanga jwa Ichaka, tatemundo. <verse eid="GEN 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Chapanga ngalongela na Yakobu kilo mumaloto, ngankema, “Yakobu! Yakobu!” Yakobu ngajhekita,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:2">“Ne pamba.”<verse eid="GEN 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Chapanga ngannobholila, “Ne ndi Chapanga, Chapanga jwa tate gwino. Mangajhoghopa kujhenda ku Michile, pumpa kubhehe kwenio, mbakukitenda kibheluko chino kibhaha ndii. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Ne namwete nanyenda pamonga na mwenga ku Michile nu kumujhicha kabhele pamba. Pumpa kujhomoka, lubhoko lwa Uchupo ndi nalubhaha papa kugubika miho ghino.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Yene, Yakobu ngabhoka ku Belicheba. Yana ya Yakobu ngabhantola tate gwabhe na ilemba yake pamonga na akaanamundo mumutuka yukuhutwa ilaghilwa na Falao kujhenda kuntola. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />Helahela ngabhatoila hele ipugho na ilebhe yabhe yoha ibhachumite kukilambo chuku Kaanane, Yakobu ngabhajhenda ku Michile. Yakobu ngaijhegha na ibheluko yake yoha, <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />yana mundo na ichokolo yake inalome na ikeghe, na kibheluko chake choha ngaileta ku Michile.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Ghanga ndi maina gha yana ya Yakobu ijhenda ku Michile, ku Ichilahele pamonga na bheniya ikibha Leubene, mwanamundo jwa litibho jwa Yakobu. <verse eid="GEN 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />Yana ya Leubene, Enoke na Palu na Echilone na Kalome. <verse eid="GEN 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Chimeone na yana yake, Yemuele na Yamine na Ohade na Yakine na Sohale na Saule, yapapii kwa mwikeghe kuhuma ku muche gwa ku Kaanane. <verse eid="GEN 46:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Lawe na yana yake, Gechone na Kohate na Melale. <verse eid="GEN 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Yuda na yana yake, Ele na Onane na Sela na Peleche na Zela. Nambo Ele na Onane ngaijhomwika kukilambo chuku Kaanane. Yana na Peleche ikibha Echilone na Amule. <verse eid="GEN 46:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Ichaka na yana yake, Tola na Puva na Yachubu na Shimulone. <verse eid="GEN 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Zebulone na yana yake, Selede na Elone na Yaleele. <verse eid="GEN 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Yenio ndi yana ya Leya yapapita kwa Yakobu kola ku Padane Alamo pamonga na Dina mwanamundo. Jumula ya ichokolo yake yoha ikaikii makome matato na itato<verse eid="GEN 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Gade na yana yake, Sifione na Hage na Shune na Esibone na Ele na Alode na Aleli <verse eid="GEN 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Ashele na yana yake, Imuna na Isiwa na Isiwe na Beliya na Sela nnombomundo. Beliya yanamundo ndi Ebele na Melikiele. <verse eid="GEN 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Bhamba ndi yana na ichokolo kome na chita ya Yakobu yapapita na Zilipa ntumiche, Labane jwampila Leya, mwanamundo.<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Lahele ngampapila Yakobu yana ibhele inalome, Uchupo na Benjamine. <verse eid="GEN 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Kwenio ku Michile, Asanate na kamwale Potifela, jwakibha mpiya litambiko jwa kilambo chaku One, ngampapila Uchupo yana ibhele inalome, Manache na Eulaimo. <verse eid="GEN 46:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Yana ya Benjamine ikibha Bela na Bekele na Ashibele na Gela na Namane na Ehi na Loshe na Mupimu na Upimu na Alide. <verse eid="GEN 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Bhando bhamba kome na ncheche ndi yana na ichokolo ya Yakobu na Lahele, nhwanamundo.<verse eid="GEN 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Mwana jwa Dane ndi Ushimo. <verse eid="GEN 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Nafutale na yana yake Yaseele na Gune na Yesele na Shilemo. <verse eid="GEN 46:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Bhando bheniya chaba ndi yana na ichokolo ya Yakobu na Biliya ntumiche, Labane jwampi kamwale jwake Lahele.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Yana ya Yakobu na ichokolo bhake yoha yaijhenda na Yakobu ade ku Michile, changabhalangii achikabhana bhake, ikibha bhando makome chita na chita. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Kwenio kukilambo chuku Michile Uchupo ngapapa yana inalome ibhele. Bhando bhoha bhu lungolo lwa Yakobu ikajhingii ku Michile ikibha makome chaba.<verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu ijhingii ku Michile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Yakobu ngantumita Yuda alongolele kunnyopa Uchupo bhakongane ku Gochene. ngabhaikita ku Gochene. <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Uchupo ngaobhoke mutuka jhake jhihutwa na falache, ngajhenda kumpokela Yakobu, tatemundo, kwenio ku Gochene. Panheghilila tatemundo, ngankumbatila na kulela hake. <verse eid="GEN 46:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Yakobu ngannobholila Uchupo, “Ata nganyomwoke deleno kilebhe jhe nhwalo nimwene kumiho jhino nu kumanya kubhehe mwe mmii ghome!”<verse eid="GEN 46:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Peniya, Uchupo ngabhalobholila akanung'una na akalongo mundo bhoha bha tatemundo, “Nyenda kunnobholela Falao kubhehe akanung'una bhango na akalongo bhoha bha tategwango bhibhakibha kukilambo chuku Kaanane ngohe bhaikite kwango. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Naninnobholela mangota ndi akalucha nu kubhehe nhwikingine pamonga na mbuhe na mambelele na ng'ombi na ilebhe ino yoha. <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Bhahe, Falao andankemingine nu kukonyangana, ‘Lihengo lino nike?’ <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />Munnobholela, ‘Twakatumiche bhino tukibha tuluchita ipugho kutumbulii uhwana gwito ade deleno, yene ndi chibhakibha akaokolo bhito.’ Nnongela nahela kupala annyeketele kutama chehemo jhaku Gochene.” Uchupo alongela gheniya nhwalo Akamichile bhapaijhe kutama na bhibhalucha.<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Yene, Uchupo ngajhenda kwa Falao na kunnobholela, “Tate gwango na akanung'una bhango pamonga na mambelele na ng'ombi na ilebhe yabhe yoha, bhaikite kuhuma ku kilambo chuku Kaanane. Ngohe bhabhii chehemo jhuku Gochene.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />Uchupo akalongiine na akalongo mundo nhwano, ngabhalangiya kwa Falao kupala bhamanye. <verse eid="GEN 47:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Falao ngabhakonya, “Lihengo lino nike?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:3">Ngabhannyangwila, “Anahota, twenga twakabhanda bhino twakalucha, anda chibhakibha akatate bhito.” <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Peniya ngabhannobholila Falao, “Twe takabhanda bhino tuikite kutama anda akaghene mu kilambo cheno nhwalo gwa njala hake kwenio ku Kaanane na pabhii jhe kabhele pukuluchii ipugho hito. Deleno munahota tunnyopa, twe, akabhanda bhino mutujheketele kutama ku Gochene.” <verse eid="GEN 47:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Falao ngannobholila Uchupo, “Tate gwino na akalongo bhino bhanhikilile mwenga, <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />kilambo choha chuku Michile kibhii mukindendeke chino. Mwape atate bhino na akalongo bhino chehemo jhambone pakilambo chenje. mwaleke bhatame mu kilambo chuku Gochene. Na anda mamanye bhando bhibhayobhalii kulucha nukilolekeya ipugho, nhaghulila bhabha akalucha bha ipugho yango.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Peniya, Uchupo ngabhaleta atate mundo Yakobu kwa Falao kupala bhumanye, na Yakobu ngannyope mota Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Falao ngankonya Yakobu, “Mmi na yaka ilee?”<verse eid="GEN 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Yakobu ngannyangwila, “Mmi na yaka miya jhimo na makome matato yukuamaama. Yaka yango ndi yandina tu na itwelii malagho, kabhele yanaikii jhe yaka ibhatamita akanahota bhango ngita bhabhii umwanja.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Yene, Yakobu ngampila mota Falao, ngajhenda. <verse eid="GEN 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Peniya, Uchupo ngampila tatemundo na akalongo mundo chehemo jha ku Lamesesi chehemo jha mbone mu kilambo chuku Michile, ibhehe kitamo chabhe, na bhene ngapabhe ngita chalaghila Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Uchupo ngampila chakulya tatemundo na akanung'una bhake na akalongo bhoha bha tatemundo tela na mundo na yana mundo.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njala ngolongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Peniya, chakulya ngakihobha hake pakilambo choha. Njala ikibha ngolongwa hake ade kwatenda bhando bhoha mu kilambo chuku Michile na ku Kaanane, bhakombale kwa nhwalo jha njala. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Uchupo ngakongo mbijha yoha ya kilambo chuku Michile na jhuku Kaanane ibhokila kwachuluchila bhando yakulya, ngaipelika mbijha yenio kwa Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Peniya, bhando bhoha bhi kilambo chuku Michile na kilambo chuku Kaanane ngabhajhomwila mbijha yabhe yoha Akamichile ngabhannyendila Uchupo nu kunnobholela, “Mutukeye chakulya! Nhwalo ghane tuwe palonge jha miho ghino? Dola ngohe mbijha hito ijhomwike!”<verse eid="GEN 47:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Uchupo ngabhalobholila, “Anda mbijha ino ijhomwike, bhahe, tujhangangana na ipugho ino, nanenga nanipela chakulya.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Ngabhampelikila Uchupo ipugho yabhe falache na ng'ombi na mbuhe na maponda na mambelele, na jwenio ngabhape chakulya. Chaka chenio Uchupo ngabhape chakulya chukujhangangana na ipugho yabhe yoha.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Piikita chenge chaka ngabhanhikilila kabhele nu kunnobholela, “Ananhota, tulonge hotuhotu mbijha hito yoha ijhomwikile na ipugho hito ibhii male jhino. Ngohe anahota, twenga akabhanda bhino tukwetii jhe kilebhe chituoto kumpela nambo makakala ghito na mighonda jhito. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Nhwalo ghane twe tuhwa palonge jhino na mighonda jhito jhihalibike? Tubhe akabhanda bha Falao nambo mutupe chakulya, kupala twangahwe jhe, mutupela na mbejho kwa nhwalo gwa mighonda jhito ikoto kuhobhelela.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Yene, Uchupo nganhemelela Falao kilambo choa chuku Michile, mana Akamichile bhaketei kunchuluchila kila mundo nng'onda gwake, kwa nhwalo gwa njala jhikibha ngolongwa hake, yene kilambo choha ghakibhila male jha Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Uchupo ngabhateila bhando bhoha bhuku Michile kubhehe akabhanda. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Nambo Uchupo akahemii jhe nng'onda ghukibha gwa mpiya litambiko nhwalo bheniya bhakibha jhe na njala, nhwalo bhatamita kupoke mapungo ghabhe kuhumii kwa Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Uchupo ngabhalobholela bhando, “Dola, nihwemelingine mangota mabhoha na mighonda jhino kubhehe mabhando bha Falao. Nanimmaghulila mbejho mpanda mu mighonda jhino. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Nambo muda gwa mahuno, lipungo limo panakate jha mapungo nhwano mumpela Falao. Mapungo ncheche ghighaighilike ghabha mbejho na chakulya kwa nhwalo gwino na akalongo bhino na yana ino.”<verse eid="GEN 47:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Ngabhanyangwila, “Anahota, nghombwile ughome gwito utubhonii kiya! Nhwalo nnangiye gwambone ghino, twe tubhehe akabhanda bha Falao.” <verse eid="GEN 47:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Peniya, Uchupo ndi ngatangacha mihilo jhake, gwenio ubhii ade deleno ku kilambo chuku Michile. Kila mundo ipalwa apiya lipungo lyu nhwano lya mahuno ghake kwa Falao. Nng'onda gwa akapiya litambiko tu ndi gwangaemelelwa nu kubhehe gwa Falao.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghilo gha Yakobu ghukukutila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Bhando bhuku Ichilahele ngabhatama chehemo jhikemwa Goshene kukilambo chuku Michile. Pibhakibha kwenio, ngabhabhe na ilebhe mbwe, ngabhabhelikina nu kujhonjekeka kubhehe mbwe. <verse eid="GEN 47:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Yakobu ngatama kukilambo chuku Michile kwa yaka kome na chaba, ade pahikicha yaka miya jhimo na makome ncheche na chaba. <verse eid="GEN 47:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Pabhandikila kuhwe, Yakobu ngankema mwanamundo Uchupo, ngannobholila, “Ngohe, anda chakaka umbaile, mmeke lubhoko lwino pa libhondo lyango, nnapile kubhehe naundendela ghambone ghukuaminika. Kubhehe naunjika jhe Pamichile. <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />Pambakujhomoka, mindola kuhumii ku Michile, mimbeleka kunjika kumambe ya akatate bhango.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:30">Uchupo ngannyanguu, “Nandenda ngita chimulongela.”<verse eid="GEN 47:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Yakobu ngannobholila, “Nnapile!” Uchupo ngalapila. Peniya, Yakobu ngalitii kunhwagho jha kindanda chake, ngannyopita Chapanga.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu abhape mota Efulaimo na Manache</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Pughapetita gheniya, Uchupo ngajhoha nhwalo kubhehe tate mundo ilwalwa. Yene, ngaitola yana yake ibhele, Efulaimo na Manache, ngajhenda nabho kwa tate mundo. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Yakobu pamanya kubhehe mwana mundo Uchupo aikite kunninga, ngakighaghalila kujhimuka na kutama pakindanda. <verse eid="GEN 48:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />Yakobu ngannobholila Uchupo, “Chapanga jhuna makakala ngambitila pinikibha ku Luzu kukilambo chuku Kaanane, ngambila mota. <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />Ndi ngannobholila, ‘Dola, mba nintende mme maokolo bhu lukolo lukolongwa lwa bhando. Nnema ghongo nanimpela ibheluko ino bhakilongocha kilambo chenje machiko ghoha ghangapeta.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />Yakobu ngajhendelela kulonge, “Uchupo, yana ibhele impapii ku Michile kabula ninaika jhe ndi yanango, Efulaimo na Manache, naibhaha yango ngita chabhii Leubene na Chimeone. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Nambo yana impakupapa pa henge, nahibhaha ino, bhibhujhii jhe kilambo chango nambo nabhapokela lipungo lyabhe lya uliche kwa mahina gha akanung'una bhabhe bhabhele, Efulaimo na Manache. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Ndei yenio nhwalo gwa majhe gwino Alahele. Punikibha mujhita ku Padane Lahele, jwenio ngajhomwikila undela mu kilambo chuku Kaanane, pahina numkuika ku Efulate, nganeka muungolongonde hake. Bhahe, ngananchika papa muupele jha ndela jhijhenda ku Efulate.” Kilambo chenio ngohe kikemwa Betelehemo.<verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Yakobu paibhona yana ya Uchupo ngankonya, “Bheniya ndi meneke?”<verse eid="GEN 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Uchupo nganyangwila tate mundo, “Henge ndi yanango yambii Chapanga pambii ku Michile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 48:9">Yakobu ngalonge, “Chonde, mihegheghe pahina nimpe mota.”<verse eid="GEN 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Miho gha Yakobu ghakibha chwilili nhwalo gwa ughoe. Bhahe, Uchupo ngaheghekeya yana yake pahina na tate mundo ngaipokela na kuikumbatila na kwachopachopa. <verse eid="GEN 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Yakobu ngannobholela Uchupo, “Nikakiingite kummona kabhele, ngohe Chapanga atujhojwiye ngongine na yana hino!” <verse eid="GEN 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Yene, Uchupo ngaibhowa yana mundo pamajhugho gha tatemundo na ngabhajhinamila.<verse eid="GEN 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Uchupo ngaibheka yana yake ibhele, Efulaimo mu lubhoko lwalelo, na Manache lubhoko lwa ngejha lwa tate mundo. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Nambo Yakobu ngaponangina mabhoko ghake, lubhoko lwalelo ngabheka panane jha muto gwa Efulaimo, pamo jwenio akibha unnung'una nu lubhoko lwa ngejha ngabheka panane jha muto gwa Manache, jwakibha mwana jwa litibho. <verse eid="GEN 48:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Peniya, Yakobu ngampe mota Uchupo nu kulonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">“Chapanga jhubhantembikiya akaoko bhango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">Ulaimo na Ichaka ngabhantembikiya mu ughome gwabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">Chapanga jwannongwiye muughome gwango ade deleno abhape mota.<verse eid="GEN 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />Ntumiche jwa kunane kwa Chapanga akombwile mughanganandela ghoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">aipe mota yana henge!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">Lina lyango na mahina gha akanahota bhango, Ulahimo na Ichaka, ngajhendele kubhehe pamo na yana henge.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">Nabhene nabhabhaha na yana na ibheluko ndii pannema!”<verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Uchupo palola kubhehe tate mundo abhekite lubhoko lwalelo panane jha muto gwa Efulaimo, akahangini jhe. Bhahe, ngalukamula lubhoko lwa tate mundo, ngalupala kulubhowa na kulubheka panane jha muto gwa Manache. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Uchupo ngannobholila tate mundo, “Nahi jhe matate! Jhonjo ndi jwa litibho. Chonde mmeke lubhoko lwino lwalelo pamuto gwake.”<verse eid="GEN 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Nambo tate mundo ngakanita mbe, ngalonge, “Manye manango, manye. Yana ya Manache hele naibhaha ndii pannema. Na yene, unnung'una mundo nabhaha nkolongwa kupeta jwenio, na ibheluko yake naubhaha ilambo mbwe.”<verse eid="GEN 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />Yakobu ngaipe mota lichiko lele, ngalonge, “Akaichilahele nabhatumila mahina gwino kumpe mota, nabhalongela, ‘Chapanga antendela ghambone ngita Efulaimo na Manache!’ ” Yene Yakobu pammeka Efulaimo kubhehe nkolongwa kuliku Manache.<verse eid="GEN 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Peniya, Yakobu ngannobholila Uchupo, “Anda chinnola, ne mandikii kuwegha. Nambo Chapanga abhaha pamonga na mangota na kumujhicha ku kilambo cha akaoko bhino. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Nimpe mwenga kilambo cha Chekemo na chi akanung'una bhino jhe chehemo jhimo jhibholile kukitombe, lyanapokita Akaamole kwa kubulana kwa upanga na upende gwango.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu aikuchulii yana mundo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Yakobu ngaikema yanamundo, ngalonge, nkonganike pamonga nanenga mbanonge ilebhe impakumpata machiko ghighaika.<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />“Nkonganike pamonga nnyohe, mangota yana ya Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:2">unyokanikiye ne Ichilahele, tate gwino.”<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />Mwe ma Leubene ndi malitibho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">makakala ghango nimpapita mungombo gwango.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">Mapetite bhange ku ukolongwa na makakala.<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Mwe anda mache ghamaheluko.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">Nambo mibhe jhe kabhele bhakutumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">nhwalo nng'olwike na kilaghe chango, mikiakiye kndanda chango!<verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />Chimeone na Lawe ndi akalongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:5">mapanga ghabhe ndi chilaa yukukomanila.<verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Nambo nenga nanyingi ng'o munginyika yabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">Mbahi jhe ndama mungongano yabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">mana mu lilaka lyabhe, bhakomite bhando,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">na ngabhehekita ncheketa gwa ng'ombi kwa ubhiche gwabhe.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Lilaka lyabhe libhekitwe nhwilo, mana likibha likolonga hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">na lilaka lyabhe lyangakiya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Nanabhaghanicha mu kilambo cha Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">nanabhapechengana mu kilambo chuku Ichilahele.<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />Mwe ma Yuda, akalongo bhino nabhannumbalila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">Namapopotola ntandala akamakoko bhino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">na akalongo bhino nabhanyinamila.<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Mwe ma Yuda nkwete makakala ngita liimba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">jwahumii kuyemo ngaombe kunane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">jwakigholwii na kugholoka pahe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">liimba lina makakala, aghane jwapakujhigha kulijhimuya?<verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Mwe ma Yuda nankamula luyato lwa unahota nkolongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">na luyato lwa ulongoche mu makongono ghino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">ade papakuika jwanio,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">na bhando nabhantembekeya.<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />Nalitabha liponda lyake muchabibo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">na litohe lya liponda lyake mu chabibo gwambone.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">Napula ngobho yake mu divaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">na kanjo jhake mu divaye ngele pyuu.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Miho ghake makele kukunywe divaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:12">na mino ghake manhuu mbuu kukunywe mabhele.<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />Zabulone natama kumbwane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">kwenio napata pukujhemeke mele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">Kilambo chake nakipakana na Chidone.<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />Ichakale ngita liponda lina makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:14">jwakighoneka panakate jha miigho jhake.<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Nambo pabhona chehemo jha kupomolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">na kilambo chupomolela nu kuhalalila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">peniya, najhinama nu kughegha miigho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">nabhaha mmanda kwa lihengo lijhundupaho.<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />Dane nabhahadabula bhando bhake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:16">ngita makabila ghange ghaku ichilahele.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Dane nabhaha ngita lijhoka undela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">lijhoka lina uchongo muupele jha ndela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">jwaluma kiingilo cha falache,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">nhwombe falache kugwe luangalagha jhe.<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />Mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga, nende ung'ombole!<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />Gade najhingililwa na bhando bhibhapoka ilebhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:19">nambo jwenio nabhakengama unyuma na kwajhingilila.<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />Nnema ghu kilambo cha Ashele naupiya mahuno mbwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:20">na jwenio nampela chakulya chikihalala kwa munahota nkolongwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />Nafutale ngita oloko jwalekekiwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:21">jwapapa yana inakuhalala.<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />Uchupo ngita nkongo ghupambika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">nkongo ghupambika paupele jha chembwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">ndabhii yake ilandalii mumapamanda. <verse eid="GEN 49:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Akamakoko bhake nabhambula hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:23">ngabhannyekeya mahonga nu kunchumbuya hake.<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Nambo upende gwake ubhii nganganga mumabhoko ghake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">na mabhoko ghake ghabhii na makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">kwa uhotolo gwa Jhuna Makakala Chapanga jwa Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">kwa liina lya Nnucha jhe, Lindalabho lya Ichilahele.<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />Kwa nhwalo gwa Chapanga jwa tate gwino jwapakuntangatila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">kwa Chapanga jhuna makakala jwapakukuchulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">mma na mota jha hula kubhoke kunane kwa Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">mota jha mache ya ilendela ibhii pahe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">mota jha akakeghe kubhelukana kwa na mota ya ipugho kubhehe ndii.<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Tate gwino ampe mota mbwe kupeta mota ibhoke muitombe ya makacho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">kupeta ilebhe yambone ibhonekana kupeta itombe ya makacho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">Mota jhenio ibhaha pamuto gwa Uchupo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">panane jha lototohi lwake jwabhii kwa panakate jha akalongo mundo.<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />“Benjamine ndi ngita limehe likale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">lukela alye yakomita kilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">na kimiye ibhenga nu kubhaghana chayemita.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Gheniya ndi makabila kome na mabhele ghuku Ichilahele, na gheniya ndi malobhe ghalongila tategwabhe pabhapila mota, kila mundo ngampila mota ngita chiipalitwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu iwegha nu kuchikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Peniya, Yakaobu ngailaghila yana mundo, kulonge, “Nenga mandikii kujhomoka nyenda kukokongana na bhando bhango. Unjika pamonga na akanahota ajhango mu likwembe lilibhii mughonda gwa Efulaimo, mundo jwa likabila lya Wahite, <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" />kwenio ku Makipela, upande ghulihumii lyobha gwa Mamule mukilambo chuku Kaanane. Ulaimo akahemi nkwembe na nng'onda gwenio kwa Efulaimo, mundo jwa likabila lya Wahite libhehe lyake lyukuchikila. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />Kwenio ndi kwachikilwe Ulaimo na Sala nhwana mundo, na kwachikilwe Ichaka na Lebeka nhwana mundo, kwenio ndi kwachikilwe Leya. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Nng'onda gwenio na nkwembe gwake, ukahemilwe kwa Akahite.” <verse eid="GEN 49:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Yakobu pajhomolila kwalaghalikiya yana yake, ngagholwila makongono ghake pakindanda, peniya, ngajhomwika.<verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Pena, Uchupo ngalita ngankumbatila tatemundo, akapeta kulela. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Peniya, Uchupo ngalaghila akaghanga bhake bhampakaye ntela tatemundo akotokubhola. Na bhene ngateila yene. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Lihengo lyukupakaya malelo ntela ngalitoila machiko makome ncheche kwa lihengo lyenio. Akamichile hele ngabhalelita malelo gha Yakobu kwa machiko makome chaba.<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Pughajhomokila kulela malelo, Uchupo ngalonge na bhando bha nyumba jha Falao, “Ninnyopangane, chonde munnobholele Falao naha, <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" />‘Tate pabhandikila kuwegha. Mipalwa mukanjika mu linkwembe lihembite mukilambo chuku Kaanane. Kwa yene najhopa anyeketele nyende nakachike atate bhango, peniya namujha.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Falao ngalonge, “Nnyende makachike atate bhino ngita channapanikiya.”<verse eid="GEN 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Yene, Uchupo ngajhenda kunchika tatemundo, ngachindikichwa na akatumiche bhoha bha nyumba jha Falao, pamonga na akanahota bha paudamo na ilongoche yoha yuku Michile. <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />Nyumba jhoha jha Uchupo na akalongomundo na nyumba jhoha jha tatemundo, mu kilambo chuku Goshene ngabhaileka yana pamonga na mambelele na mbuhe na ng'ombi yabhe. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Helahela ngabhalongohina nabho bhibhahobhokii falache na mutuka iitwa na maponda, likibha lilongo likolongwa hake.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Pubhaikita palubhanja lukuhebhela mahuno lwa Atade, kwiye jha lukemba lwaku Yoludane, ngabhalelita malelo kwa ungolongonde hake, na Uchupo ngantendila matanga tatemundo jwajhomwike kwa machiko chaba. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Akakaanane akolo kilambo chenio, pubhabhona bhakalela malelo ghakatendika palubhanja lukuhebhe mahuno lwa Atade, ngabhalonge, “Kulela kongo kwa Akamichile, chakaka kukolongwa hake!” Yene chehemo jhenio ngabhaikema, Abele Michile, ndi mana chehemo jhene jhibhii kwiye jha lukemba lwaku Yoludane pikemwa Abele Michile.<verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Yana ya Yakobu ngabhantendila tate gwabhe ngita chabhalaghila, <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />ngabhantola ade kukilambo chuku Kaanane na ngabhanchika mu linkwembe lilibhii munng'onda gwako kola ku Makipela, kola ku Mamule. Nkwembe gwenio na nng'onda gwenio Ulaamo akate kuhemela kwa Akafulone Akahite, kupala ibhaha chehemo jhake jha kuchikila. <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Pajhomolila kunchika tatemundo, Uchupo ngabhujha ku Michile pamonga na akalongo mundo na bhando bhoha bhubhanchindikicha kunchika tatemundo.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uchupo abhabhoke iholo akalongo mundo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Bhahe, pughapetita malelo gha tate gwabhe, akalongomundo ngabhapwepwelina kubhehe, “Pange jhe Uchupo natuchimwa nu kutulepechela ghanganandela ghoha ghutuntendila.” <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Yene, ngabhampelikila Uchupo chalamo, bhalongila, “Tate gwino kabula jhukuwegha, akalaghii naha, <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />tunnobholele naha, Uchupo pambala kuwe ne, ‘Chonde, malekekeye akalongo bhino malemo ghabhe na ubhoho ghoha ghubhantendii.’ Ngohe, chonde tunnyopa mutulekekeye ulemo ghutuntendii twe takatumiche bha Chapanga.” Uchupo pajhohina gheniya, ngalela.<verse eid="GEN 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Peniya, akalongomundo ngabhannyendila ngabhannyinamila nukulonge, “Nnola, twe ndi akabhanda bhino.”<verse eid="GEN 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Nambo Uchupo ngabhalobholila, “Mangajhoghopa jhe! Bho, nenga ndi Chapanga jwahadabuu bhando? <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Mangota mapala kundende ghanganandela, nambo Chapanga ngaghalambiya kubhehe ghambone kupala bhando bhange bhabha ghome ngita chimulola deleno. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Mangajhoghopa jhe. Nenga nanimpela chakulya mangota na yana hino.” Peniya, ngabhapepicha nu kulonge nabho maha.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uchupo itenda kuwegha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Uchupo ngajhendilila kutama ku kilambo chuku Michile pamonga na akalongo bhoha bha tate mundo. Uchupo ngatama yaka miya jhimo na likome limo. <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />Uchupo ngaibhona yana na ichokolo ya Efulaimo. Hele ngaipokela yana ya Makile, mwana jwa Manache. <verse eid="GEN 50:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Uchupo ngabhalobholila akalongo mundo kubhehe, “Ne, ngohe mandikii kuwe. Nambo Chapanga nahwikilila kuntangatila mangota nu kummowa mu kilambo chenje nu kumpeleka mu kilambo channaghila kumpe Ulaamo na Ichaka na Yakobu.” <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Peniya, Uchupo ngailapila yana ya Ichilahele, kulonge, “Chapanga papakuika kuntangatila, ntola ihupa jhango kubhoka pamba, mmoka nayo.” <verse eid="GEN 50:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Uchupo ngajhomwika kwenio ku Michile, akibha na yaka miya jhimo na likome limo. Ngabhaupikiya ntela malelo ghakoto kubhola, ngabhabheka mu lichanduko kwenio ku Michile.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>